<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">JEREMIAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">JEREMIAH</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jer</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEREMIAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Profeh Jeremiah tuh BC za sari athang dyn te za taruh athotakawnaw loukaw kya a la umpaw thua zah, khaw cia rya a law lungkhu kya Pachia ccungccaw hae kya-e zohtuh beiknaw te mih seinaw keiccuze minphuin tungvaw a thua cih paw vawsawnaw kong kha raeringnaw a pya hae. A la hodaepaw kha amaw a muihnaw kya mawkhe ccing zah, Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem te Beikinn kha roh zah Judah siapharan te a ccungccaw hae patae kha kyngte Babilon lang a cciakhae hae. Te Judah hae a kithui lan hae paw te minphuin phuin kheit bua athua nawlan hae paw kong kha mah a hodae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah ccauh hynh phuin pangaw lang phia kho athua: (1) Jeremiah kha konaw; (2) Judah ram uktu Josiah, Jehoiakim, Jehoiakhin te Zedekiah she lyaze Pachia nynh Judah hae te mih uktu hae a hopya hae paw bya; (3) Jeremiah a ryaccinkhan Baruk nynh a zeipaw ccauh lungkhu kyaze Jeremiah nynh a hiin lya a la hopaw profehbya hae te abyapipaw acyihkuhpaw aphuinphuin; (4) ramccang hae konglang Bawipaw kyate yn thuapaw bya; (5) Jerusalem khua aro lanpaw kong te Babilon lang see lang a tang lan hae paw kong.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah tuh ccungccaw rynaw a nyhthyapaw nynh thua, a ccungccaw hae kha myarya sungsah hae zah minmin tungvaw byapianaw kong papin ho ry khyh. Pachia nynh profeh lang a la ko keiccuze vawsaw a teingnaw kong kha thinlungccite a hopya hae. Pachia bya tuh a thinlung kya maee hawte rua zah ho leite um kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah ccauh lungkhu e abyapi huaccepaw bya abang nynh Jeremiah a vawsaw ccyh athang koute malang a um cih paw byakin thawpaw ccyh hanlan cia a ho. Tuin ccyh kya tuh Pachia ccungccaw hae kha nysah khylan ccangpahtu um leite tuh-e byakinnaw thawpaw kha a zui cih hae, pawccecize tuh-e tuh mih thinlung kya zei athua vae cih (31.31-34).</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremiah kha konaw 1.1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Josiah, Jehoiakim, Jehoiakhin te Zedekiah siapharan hae</para>
  <para style="io1">uknaw ccyh kya Jeremiah a hopaw bya 2.1—25.38</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremiah she lungkhu acyihkuhpaw hae 26.1—45.5</para>
  <para style="io1">Minphuin ccangpaw hae rawsete hopaw bya hae 46.1—51.64</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem ronaw 52.1-34</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin ram Anathoth khua kya umpaw ranpibawi hae kyaze lu kheit athua buapaw Hilkiah ccapaw Jeremiah bya: <verse number="2" style="v" />Amon ccapaw Siapharan Josiah nynh Judah ram a uknaw kum haw lae thumnaw kum khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya a thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:3-23:27">2Si 22.3—23.27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:8-35:19">2Sh 34.8—35.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim ccyh lya thuasah, Josiah ccapaw Siapharan Zedekiah nynh Judah ram a uknaw kum haw lae kheitnaw kum kyacia thuasah, tuh-e kum kya Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae a kyng ccyh hae sawpaw sah pangawnaw kyacia thuasah tuh-e <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya a thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2Si 23.36—24.7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:1-25:21">18.1—25.21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2Sh 36.5-8</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 11:21">11.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah Konaw te Ryalaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua zah yn hopyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na nung vue lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">kae rae mawze nang kha kae ny vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na pui mawze nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thyaasah vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae hanlan nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh lang kae khang vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kae tuh ka imua ung keiccuze pawte ho lan cipaw ka nyh ccaccing khyh,” ka ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “ ‘Imua nynh ka thua ung,’ cite ho nan;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae sawnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw balyn kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">na cceih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kaw kae pyapaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ho cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin kha rih nan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nang khum khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya ka um cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuinte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kuih kha dyng zah ka mung kha yn hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Atu ka bya hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na mung kya ka nung vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dotua, atunin nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae te peenaw hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">phoh khylan te suebung khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ro khylan te khulia khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">sak khylan te lin khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae khang vae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah, “Jeremiah, Pawmou na muih?” yn cipya. Te kae nynh, “Almond ku ange ngekheit kha ka muih,” ka cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Hoyte phe na muih vae, pawccecize ka bya ccingsah lanpaw kha phang ka ngaw,” yn cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kalan vae ningnaw yn thua zah, “Pawmou na muih?” yn ci. Te kae nynh, “Accoh cciamangpaw, palung lang apahaekuhpaw ang kha ka muih,” ka cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: Ram lungkhu um hae paw balyn tungvaw khe palung langte shethya yn thua cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize atu palung lang peenaw kya-e minphuin hae balyn kha ka ko hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; minmin nynh oun thua cih hae zah, Jerusalem koikua teenaw kya, po koihlukuhpaw khualungrua hae kya te Judah ram e khua hae balyn kyakhe mih bawitungkhung hae kha ccarou a nung cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin tungvaw bya ka piapaw kha ka ho cih, pawccecize kae kha yn vua hae zah a sei hae, ccangpaw pachia hae kalan silawnaw rae hae zah, mih kuih te a raeku hae paw kha a beik hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh na taevoiboei kha voiku tua; thadyn lah kaw kae pyapaw balyn kha hopah hae. Mih malang khe rih nan, tuhkhyhze tuh mih malang khe maethya kae lah cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah siapharan hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, ranpibawi hae te ramccungccaw hae athuapaw khah-e ram pynpi te arawsekuh lante, nang kha rhawlungrua te akoihlukuhpaw khuapi, sivaw tung, sohin pang lang atunin kae rae vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh nang kha rhaw ae tuk hae zemah ae tae lan khyh hae, pawccecize nang kha luesah khylan na kya ka um cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel A Ngaesiku nawlan Ngianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah a hopaw tuh, <verse number="2" style="v" />Cceih lah, Jerusalem nynh a thaenaw khe siatua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ngawphue lya-e na lungzinaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaenung liaccanung hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">nae sungsahnaw te paw sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">accouku leinaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw kya nae zuipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liathui.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan thyaa zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">looh a ruepaw kyaze</para>
  <para style="q1">thaety nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e looh a aepaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a sei hae; shethya nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuanua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Jakob ciihan hae te Israel ccaawno hae balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngaetua oh. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae minpaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw pawcihawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw muih hae zahte mou</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kyate asawnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">cceih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungkia leipaw nulang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">zuikute accakaepaw lang a tang hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Izip ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cciakhae thung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw, laesia ram te</para>
  <para style="q2">hunghua alungnaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaakannaw ram te</para>
  <para style="q2">marae zipingkuhpaw mohnaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccia boi leinaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuasahtu lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">a um leinaw ram kya</para>
  <para style="q1">oun cciakhaetupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um?” cite ho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram hoypaw lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">apoupaw athae te uccaw hoypaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae khylan kae teekhae oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama he na tee oh te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ram kha na thusah oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rho kha anungsikuhpaw lang na rae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um?” cite ho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Phungbya a kyng hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn nyh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">uktu hae nynh ka tungvaw a sei vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh hae nynh Baal min te</para>
  <para style="q1">profehbya ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athane leipaw uccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang a zuiku hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sei kae be cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ccaaw hae ccaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sei ka be cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saipras tuikoih kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">po zua oh lah, dotua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kedar ram lang ccungccaw saw oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaw-aleih hoyte dosah tua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hynhcihawpaw uccaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">acyihkuh boi tou cipaw tuatua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minphuin phuin kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pachia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">pachia a la thua khyh hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">a rulae boi zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama ka ccungccaw hae nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih phu-enaw kha athane leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw lang a rulae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou vaawlui hae, e konglang hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ngaeangthua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thyngkute siiku tua oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize ka ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw phuin ning kha a rae vae hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">hiinnaw tuidy ka thuapaw kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn vua hae zah, tui a ynkuh kho leipaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">azupaw tuikua kha a thaeku vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel tuh see tou athua?</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning tuh innvaw a puipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ryalahtu tou athua?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou aning kha a kyngde hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chindeih hae nynh aning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sianua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">roi myarya ccae lante a hu a raw hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">A ram kha accakaepaw lang a raepya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a khuapi hae tuh roh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, Memfis hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">Tahpanhes hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lu ae koi vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae cciakhae lya oh khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha na vua oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh naemaw toulou nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tungvaw na thuakhaeku oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nal vawkhu e tui kha nia khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip ram lang na ccia oh liate</para>
  <para style="q1">pawmou na mue oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhkhyhze Zufrates vawkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">tui nia khylan Assiria lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccia oh paw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou na mue oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae hoyleinaw nynh naemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de ae tah cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae lungzi leinaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae seinaw kha ae phy cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia na vua oh paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raw nae ri khyh oh paw hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">naemaw hanlan ahoy leipaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">akhahpaw nynh thua cipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nyh oh lah, muihtua oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite Alesaepaw Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Langmawlya na puihnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccong kha na khya,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae khiipaw arui kha na paekuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Rya kae lawpah vae lan khyh!” na ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahangpaw mua vawlan miakaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">na ih zah na ohhuaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang kha acii ahoy huapaw kyate lawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku ahoy huaccepaw lante kae linku.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhzemah pawccemou phe na roh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e misu ku lang poh na tang?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saepia te na singkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">saepia kha patae na mang zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">na seinaw athupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang phang a um mamin,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Kae tuh ka nungsikuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Baal nulang ka zuikuh khyh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">pawtemou na ho kho?</para>
  <para style="q1">Accya kya-e na laanpi khuh dotua;</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyisahnaw kha nyku tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">rangtareih lan a ccue bungthungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kalauh nopi akiakuh leipaw nynh na lo.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ramkaw kya kheccungte</para>
  <para style="q2">khiavuikuh zah, sahpaw a ry keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">amyn a suethungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lann apuapaw nynh na lo!</para>
  <para style="q1">A ry ccyh a thua vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a khee kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning a ccungtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thawbangsakute ccung lan ccan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw accyh yn zaw te a muih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na phanah kha paesah nan lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui hawsakuh nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama nang nynh tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ngaehoinaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ramccang hae pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sungsah vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih nulang ka zuikuh vae cih,” na ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miruh kha kyng vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">a maethya hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel hae tuh mih maethah cih—</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw, mih siapharan hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih bawi hae, mih ranpibawi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih profeh hae tuh mih maethah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thingku kha, “Nang tuh ka paaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua,” cipah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lung kha, “Nang nynh kae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae saahkuh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae kha mih nulang yn sangsah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mae kha ka kalan hawi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama mih vawsaw ccyh lyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Oun cceih lah, kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun khumtua!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na raeku oh paw nae pachia hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae vawsaw ccyh lya ae khum kho oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Judah, khua patae na hoi zeihte</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia patae kha na hoi.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccemou nae bonua oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae balyn mawte nae dou oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nae ccaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">alakaw lan ka zia vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh thuiheinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lawkuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">A kanmawpaw chindeih hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thaloi toulou nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae profeh hae kha a tei hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />E she kya-e ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh Israel hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw khyhze</para>
  <para style="q1">marae mohpaw ram hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua boi zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou ka ccungccaw hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kaening tuh kae lue vae, na kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae cceih vae lan khyh,” a ci hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Liaccanung nynh a ccaankunawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ning kho zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Akaenung liaccanung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a boeining kha a ning kho zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhzemah ka ccungccaw hae nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ninsaw riatae lei yn ning vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na rypaw kha ccung nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">na paccynkupaw laanpi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">pawcih baban mou ahoy!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nopi hoyleinung kha heize</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi kha phe na ccangpya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Seinaw a hoi leipaw ryachi hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">hiinnaw chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na boeining dung kya muih athua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e chiise tuh ae teenua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na kyngbia hae paw chiise thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhcite e hae balyn hynh mang na cyih pite,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nang nynh, “Kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sei leipaw nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tungvaw um ccaccing vae khyh,” na ci.</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ka sei khyh,” na ci keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">byapianaw lang atu kae cciakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na laanpi kha rulaekute</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou na khiavuiku?</para>
  <para style="q1">Assiria nynh maethya ae law hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip nynh mah maethya ae lah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na lu vawlan na kuih khangkute</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip ram kyate mah na ki cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize na doliakuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vua vae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin liate na laan na sui ualae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">A Lungzi leipaw Israel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pisepaw nynh a zu kha a mya keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">a zu tuh a vawpaw kyate pou zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">milae zu lang a tang vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e pisepaw nynh tuh-e nopinung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zu lang bua a umkhae ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhcihawpaw ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw nungsikuh lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang tuh na rykuh oh paw patae te</para>
  <para style="q2">na ohhuakuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">te ka kalan nae ki ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahangnaw hmin hae khuh</para>
  <para style="q2">dothung tua lah, muihtua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Na ikhae leipaw hmin a um zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ramkaw e Arab hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi pe khe</para>
  <para style="q2">na rykuh oh paw kha na ngaw hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ohhuakunaw te na hoyleinaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kha na thusah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khuaakan zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hawkhuaa mah rah vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah na terui tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ohhuanung terui hawte thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethya na nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Atu hynhte nang nynh kae kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Apang, nang tuh ka ngawphue lya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka banpaw nynh na thua—</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pachia tuh zungzae a thinria cih zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Athangnaw cia a thinria cih zawtou?” nae ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh na ho vae paw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama hoyleinaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na rae kho thyhte na rae vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ngaesiku lan Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josiah Siapharan she lyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: A lungzi leipaw Israel nynh pawtemou a cyi cipaw na muih vae tou? Ahangpaw mua miakaw kalan kaethungte ohhuakuh zah, hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw kya a ohhuaku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:1-23:30">2Si 22.1—23.30</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:1-35:27">2Sh 34.1—35.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />“E hae balyn hynh a cyih koute ka kalan yn kithui cih,” cite ka la tua; thuasalama ka kalan yn kithui khyh; tuh-e tuh a lungzi leinung a neitawnung Judah nynh phe a muih. <verse number="8" style="v" />A lungzi leipaw Israel nynh milae vawpaw kya a seinaw balyn keiccuze myanawpaw ccaw ryte ka cciasahpaw kha Judah nynh phe a muih; tuhzemah a lungzi leinung a neitawnung Judah tuh ri leite cceih zah a ohhuakuh bua. <verse number="9" style="v" />A ohhuakunaw kha huatawpaw lang a ria keiccuze lung te thing ryte ohhuakute ram kha a thusah. <verse number="10" style="v" />E hae balyn koute mah a lungzi leinung a neitawnung Judah tuh a thinlung balyn te ka kalan ki leite, cyisakunynte nynh yn ki, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: A lungzi leipaw Israel nynh a seinung Judah laeze a seinaw azya huanaw kha a langsaku. <verse number="12" style="v" />Cceih lah, e bya hynh thahlang khe la siakhae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou a lungzi leipaw Israel, yn kithui,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha thinriate kae do vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thawccinaw a hoipaw nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ka thinria lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na doupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na seinaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang pachia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na sungsah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya na zui leinaw kyalya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasah phyku tua,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou mih lungzi leipaw ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">oun kithui oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae bawi nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khua khuakheit kyate lu kheit,</para>
  <para style="q2">innbyn byn kheit kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">lu ning kae ko cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion lang kae cciakhae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungry yn tungpaw tuurin hae kha kae nungpah cih oh zah, minmin nynh hawnaw te nythyanaw khate ae ccangpah cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te ram lungkhu kya na pungzae oh zah he na lungthung oh tetuh, minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua kong kha ho vae lan khyh hae. Tuh-e thingkua kha mih thinlung kya um vae lan khyh, liathui leite a ning vae cih hae; ccangpaw kha mah rae vae lan khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh Jerusalem kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawitungkhung cite a ko cih hae, minphuin balyn tuh Jerusalem kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a sueluakuh cih hae zah, ahoy leipaw mimaw rynaw kha lungkhungte zui vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Judah phin hae te Israel phin hae tuh a pykuh cih hae zah, thahlang ram kyate nae minpaaw hae kalan rho lang ka pya hae paw ram langkhe a cceihkheih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang kha ka ccaaw hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou kae nung cih cipaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ram hoypaw, ram balyn kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithya huaccepaw rho kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou kae pya cih cipaw kha ka tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te nang nynh kae kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">Apang cite nae ko cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae nae zuinaw kyate ccanglang</para>
  <para style="q2">na cceihsei lan khyh cite ka tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou Israel phin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungzi leipaw zu nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a vawpaw kha a cciataw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning tuh ka tungvaw nae lungzi vae khyh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel ccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangnaw hmin vawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethyate a raw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">roi kha thae athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zuisei hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ning vae hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pou mih lungzi leipaw ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">oun kithui oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae lungzi leinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae dansah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">“Kaening nynh na kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae cceih vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thanccingte sangpyng hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">hoysah huatawte siarisiarae um tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thanccingte Israel khumnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kya nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ah minpaaw hae nynh a la bangnuathe hae paw mih tuuphu hae te mih vaetua phu hae, mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae kha maethya lan umpaw uccaw nynh aening ah ngawphue lya oh mawte phe a ae kou vae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Maethyate ih oh sih lah, ah thethyanaw nynh aening kha oun bong sah; pawccecize aening te ah minpaaw hae nynh aening ah ngawphue lya oh te atunin cia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia tungvaw ah sei vae oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia bya kha ah zui khyh oh,” na ci oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Pou Israel, nae ki ze, ka kalan nae ki cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na kya-e anungsikuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka malang te na vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na cciasei khyh ze thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte!” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">byaccing te, byading te dingnaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">bya na kinku ze thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae tuh tuh-e Pachia liate</para>
  <para style="q2">hythua a ccou cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e Pachia liate</para>
  <para style="q2">a pookuh cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah hae te Jerusalem um hae paw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Athuekuh boi leipaw lei kha thue oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">hinpaw hae laku khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccacii kha vua nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:12">Hos 10.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Judah hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">vingdungawkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thinlung vingdung kha awkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhkhyhze tuh na rae oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee lang arua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">the kho lei lan ciate arua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Judah kha Rhawthiingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah ram kya te Jerusalem kyakhe siatua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ram pynpi balyn kya mungkae tuu oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pynkheihlan sueluakuh oh sih lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawlungrua akoihkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae kalan tee oh sih!”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite siatua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion lang ccianaw laanpi</para>
  <para style="q2">a muihsahpaw alan kha saetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">khyn khylan ccuetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thysung nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize hoyleinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw ronaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thahlang te kae thuakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chindeih tuh a umnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thabu kyate yn pou vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae a rohtu tuh yn cceih vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ram kha ccungccaw adaenaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lang rae khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">a umnaw kyate yn pou vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khuapi hae tuh ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">um lei lan ciate aroh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />E keiccuze buriboei kha zingkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyate rah oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw myarya lepaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening kyate maekuh khyh,” cite rah oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin kya tuh siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae tuh mih rawthah cih; ranpibawi hae tuh a siikuh cih hae zah, profeh hae tuh myarya mih ngaeangthua cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, thaloi kha mih nging kya phang nungde athua lya heize, ‘Nae kya daenaw a um cih,’ cite na ho zah, e ccungccaw hae te Jerusalem kha ccadya na ling vae hae!” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin ccyh lyakhe e ccungccaw hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha hynhte hopya athua cih hae: Asopaw khisan tuh ramkaw e ahangnaw hmin kyate ka ccungccaw ryachi hae kalan azaw; tuh-e khisan tuh vaekang mungsah khylan thua khyh, thyaasah nawlan mah thua khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e khisan laeze a thawsaepaw khisan tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thua cih. Atu minmin kha bya ka pia cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dotua! Rhaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking hawte yn thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw a marangle hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khiccung hawte yn thua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a marang hae tuh mosi laeze aranghua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">aening hanlan ngaethya lan kou um,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ro ah thua vae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou Jerusalem, khum na thua nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thinlung kya-e hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thyaasahku tua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ahoy leipaw na paccynkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na lungkhu kya hohseciamou</para>
  <para style="q2">a um ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan ram kyate roi roikheit</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ccae zah, Efraim Mua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya kong kha a siakhae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“E kya rhaw hae a um hae!” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha hopah hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kha rawsete,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Rhaw hae tuh asawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah ram e khuapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a sianua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Loo a ngaw hae paw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae nynh Judah kha a koihlu vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize Judah nynh kae kha yn rawse vae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na umtu te na cyisahnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh na tungvaw a thuakhae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh na ronaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawcih baban mou acci!</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh na bung lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">phe athua vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Arohpaw Ram hanlan Ngaethyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thin tuhlou, ka thin tuhlou!</para>
  <para style="q2">Ccinaw keiccuze ka khang ka tua khyh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka thinlungcci tuhlou!</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka bung tuh thawte asohkuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Daebabi lan ka um kho khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize rhaw roi,</para>
  <para style="q2">mungkae roi kha ka thae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shethya ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit yn thua, ram pynpi tuh aroh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka bu hae tuh vaekheihmawte aroh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">zokhawpaw ka boei hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sosoh taraw kya aroh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hohseciamou alan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka muih ung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mungkae roi kha ka thae ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka ccungccaw hae tuh a ngaee hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn nyh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh angaeepaw ccaaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tuh ahoy leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya raethya hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama ahoypaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou rae lan cipaw nyh khyh hae.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Laephi kha ka do zah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawpaw mah um leite accawnghan;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kha mah ka do zah</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mua hae kha ka do zah ahy hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">sangpyng balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hebung hethung a hekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka do zah ccungccaw lu kheit san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang e pavaw balyn tuh a zou vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka do zah looh voipaw ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram lang tang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang aroh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a thinrianaw malang khe aroh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ram pynpi tuh aroh cih; tuhzemah athangnaw ccaccing tuh ka thuasah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E keiccuze laephi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a rah a khui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlang e vaawlui tuh aman cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ho vae paw te ka paccyn vae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">thua zah, ka ngaesikuh lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinlung mah paleihkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Marang rhawkaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">li rhawkaw hae siho keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">khua miakaw tuh a ccue hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw lang a ccue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpi hae kalan a kae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae balyn kha ccuetaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya ccungccaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pou a lanmepaw nang,</para>
  <para style="q2">boei sepaw kha zingkute</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaankunawpaw sui te na ccaankuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na mit kha thuhkuhpaw si</para>
  <para style="q1">na thuhkuhpaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">paw suilan mou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Alakaw lan na ccaanku.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na sungsah hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ae dothatheih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na hiinnaw kha chia lan ae ccung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Neitangia accihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung roi hawte siaruanaw roi,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccatawccaw a saahpaw nopinung roi hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">teingnaw roi kha ka thae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh a hysue a vawsawkhaekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung a rawnaw roi nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kha dyng zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ka hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh ccungccaw theihtu hae malang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thawthang!” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Ccungccaw hae Seinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem e laanpi hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccia bungthungte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngawdo oh lah, ccungtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem kha ka ngaethya kho nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">hmerarih lan hiin zah</para>
  <para style="q1">byaccing a ccungpaw lu kheit kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khualae e laanpi hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte ccungtua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hiin,” a ci hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahme lei lante thyalawkute</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a kinku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na mit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">byaccing kha a ccung khaw?</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha de na tah hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha na ro hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">thuiheinaw kha a vua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih mae kha lungpi laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">tansakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kithui lan a mya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “E hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ryachi hae thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nythyanaw hoi khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih Pachia phung kha nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Alesae hae paw kalan ka cceih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih Pachia phung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ny ccaccing hae,” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kya-e puihnawpaw ccong kha</para>
  <para style="q1">khya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">heenawpaw arui kha a paeku vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ramkaw e chindeih nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a theih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laesia ram e suizaw nynh a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kaesing nynh mih khuapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">phang buh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khua atolang a poupaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">zoihtatyh lan a tei cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize mih cyiseimenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya lung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungzinaw thyhsan hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawtemou nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ngaethya kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ccaaw hae nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn vua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pachia athua lei hae paw min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phyate bya a kinku vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha phe byn lan</para>
  <para style="q2">looh he ka dang hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nopi pise seinaw rae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ohhuanung hae inn khe a sueluakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin tuh thobaleih lan</para>
  <para style="q2">looh dangpaw rangtepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athungpaw hawte thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh mih innpaw hae raveih zu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">seikhae rynaw te soihnaw bya a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E cyisahnaw hanlan minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de ka tah lan khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hynhcihawpaw minphuin tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw ka thuasah lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A misu karan hae laku khe</para>
  <para style="q2">po cceihthung lah rotua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama marya thangsah nan;</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">athua khyh keiccuze bae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel phin te Judah phin hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw papinmaw mih lungzi khyh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme lei lante ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawpaw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">cyih lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hoyleinaw nynh oun thuanua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi rhaw khyhze ccakannaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ah tung lan khyh oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Profeh hae tuh accakaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khivae nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kya Pachia bya um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh a ho hae thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tungvaw cyi athua cih!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw Pachia nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh e bya a ho hae keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya kha na khalang kya</para>
  <para style="q1">maee lang ka tangsah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">e ccungccaw hae hynh maeething lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tangsah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh a u cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pou Israel phin, asawnaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin phuin kheit kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na kalan kae thuakhae cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh athungpaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya te a la um vae paw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bya na thaepya leipaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw kha na thaethyapya leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih the bawng tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">shaw ahungkuhpaw te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a thungpaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh na thingthae-eccang te</para>
  <para style="q2">na looh kha a ae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccapaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccanung hae kha a ae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na tuu hae te na vaetua hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ae cih hae; na misu ku te</para>
  <para style="q1">na thaeku ku hae kha mah a ae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">na doliakupaw khuapi hae</para>
  <para style="q1">akoihkhawkuhpaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thaloi te a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama tuin nin kya heize na thangnaw ccaccing kha ka thuasah loh lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te na ccungccaw hae nynh, “Pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh e uccaw hae balyn hynh aening tungvaw a cyi?” cite ae khia hae ze, “Nanning nynh amaw kha na vua oh zah, nae ram kya ramccang pachia hae kha na beik oh, tukeiccuze nae ram athua leipaw ram kyakhe ramccang hae kha rya na lawpah cih oh,” cite na hopah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakob ciihan te Judah ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhte ho oh lah siakhae oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mit a hoi hae zemah a muih lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nakaring a hoi hae zemah a thae lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">pou mingaee hae te tuanaw hoi lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh ngaetua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eze 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:18">Mar 8.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kae hynh nae rih khyh oh tou? cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka malang na thyngkuh khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Rili hanlan laesia kha ramri lang ka nung,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh tui nynh a lawe kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw khawtu nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuileih atho zemah lawe kho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuileih nynh a siarua zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">po khung kho khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:8-11">Job 38.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama e ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungkhung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">dou rynaw thinlung a hoi hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang maekuh hae zah a cceih vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Kumvaelori thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaarawsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaatui te hawkhuaa kha</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw accyh thyhte a rawsahpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">loohrue ccyh kha aening hanlan a tynsahpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kha rih oh sih,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite mih thinlung kya cikuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nae hoyleinaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e ccyh hae kha pong paleih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae seinaw nynh hoynaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phang ae khawpya oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae laku a umbua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh milae hae uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a luade hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kaangsyatu hae hawte kaangsya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha a kyng hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pavaw phe abeihpaw awbu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih inn tuh hynhunaw te phe abeih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze minmin tuh alesaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mihoipaw lang a tang hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mih ngesaw tuh tho zah anae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hoyleinaw raenaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">azaw ci nykuh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ngawraw hae byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tae nawlan hae ahmete</para>
  <para style="q1">byapiapah khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a nyaa hae paw nynh mue lan</para>
  <para style="q1">accan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pankhae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />E cyisahnaw hanlan minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de ka tah lan khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hynhcihawpaw minphuin tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw ka thuakhae lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siiku lan umpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lungkhu kya acyihkuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />profeh hae nynh ahme leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">bya kha ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ranpibawi hae nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh hae bya thyhte a uk hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhcihawpaw tuh a ry hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama athangnaw he yn thua te,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou na um cih oh?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem te Judah Ronaw Anae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Benjamin phin hae, lue khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kyate ccue oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Tekoa kya mungkae tu oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Beth-hakkherem kya</para>
  <para style="q1">alan kha saetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya lepaw ronaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thahlang te yn langkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithya zah a ninccehoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka roh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuurin hae te mih tuuphu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha a ccianua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a pepan khe bu a saknuakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh mih umnaw raveih kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">tuu hae kha rampaeesakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aning kha dou khylan paccynkuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">thokuh oh lah, ninthuccynglyn khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk oh sih!”</para>
  <para style="q1">“Aening elang ngaethya lan kou um,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize taezaw vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi bia vae!”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thokuh oh, khuazi khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk oh sih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a siapharan inn hae kha ropah oh sih!”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem a thingku hae kha nge oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem dou nawlan laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thae oh lah dohsah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">E khua tuh detah hahe lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khua nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khua lungkhu kya tuaasahkunaw laelan</para>
  <para style="q2">pawpaw mah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuisung nynh tui thawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">palei a pousah hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">e khua nynh a hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">palei a pousah;</para>
  <para style="q1">khua lungkhu khe puathonaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw the kha thae athua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccihawnaw te vaemaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ka muih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou Jerusalem, raeringkuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhkhyhze tuh na nungsiku keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">kae maetawkuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae roh cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lang kae rae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Misu ku kya a laehypaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athae kha lo hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae a laehy hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">marya lo oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae a lotu hawte na kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">misu karan kalan khe bua dyngtua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thae ccaw hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">hum hae kha mou ka hopah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">raeringnaw ka pya cih hae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, mih nakaring kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hu thua zah, thae kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh minmin hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">saryapaw uccaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e bya kya mih lungrythua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw phe beih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ngaesang kho vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e thinrianaw tuh laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw imua hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a sueluakuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangvae hae tungvaw khe ccawsah tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">zu te vaw parouh mawte law athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kum tang vae hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya taw vae hae paw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">law athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih inn mih loo hae te mih zu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">milae kalan pya athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize tuin ram kya um hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih ka hangnua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:10-12">Jer 8.10-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin tuh adih huapaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ale huapaw kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">ahme leipaw muenaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte a karankuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">profeh kyate ranpibawi kyacia</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte a hyn a hu hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Daenaw a um vae khyh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Daenaw, daenaw,” cite ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae vaemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oihsah khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Eze 13.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maethya lan umpaw kha cyih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw rya kha a law hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah mih maethah khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethya mah nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tukeiccuze a khuliakuh hae paw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh bua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha de he ka tah hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Laanpi atungkunaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">thadyn oh lah dotua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya e laanpi,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi hoypaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">teimou a um cite khiakuh oh lah</para>
  <para style="q2">zui oh, nae hiinnaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">haeungnaw kha muihkuh oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama minmin nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Tuh-e laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae zui lan khyh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanning hanlan rhawviatu</para>
  <para style="q2">kae nungpya oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Mungkae roi kha hoyte</para>
  <para style="q2">ngae oh!” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama minmin nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawlang kae ria lan khyh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou minphuin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou zapi hae, minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">yn cyihkuh cih paw kha nytua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou laephi, ngaetua;</para>
  <para style="q2">e ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">mih khuakhannaw athae athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw kha ka thuasah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria vae khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccangpyanaw kha a vua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sheba ram kyate yn thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">amynkhuhpaw frankinsen te</para>
  <para style="q1">laansaw langte yn thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccazung epaw kha ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">pawmou a ccungkia?</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae kya-e maee-ute silawnaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccoupya thua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kya-e silawnaw hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungrythua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, a thy a pawku nawlan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">e ccungccaw hae malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nungkhaw cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nungpaaw hae te ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">innpaw hae te ruiban hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan aroh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, thahlang e ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin phuin kheit yn thua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw minphuin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw kyate paccynkute a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin nynh li te</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoi kha a ccyngku hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rysawthah zah</para>
  <para style="q1">thawccinaw hoi khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih roi tuh rili roi te nynh aloku.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Zion ccanung, minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">marang kha ccikuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw a tuk cih paw rhawkawpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha zunghe ae ccyngnuakuh hae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Minmin konglang kae thae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thawzung phe ting;</para>
  <para style="q1">lungriathaenaw nynh oun thuanua,</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia ccihpaw nopi hawte kae teing.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ramkaw lang cceih nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kya cceih nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize rhaw tuh thaloi a hoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawpaw kya balyn ri lan phe um.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pou aryachipaw ka ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">buriboei kha zingkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">buhhaw kya toukuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit kyalyapaw ccaaw chih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">raw hawkhate, thawmawte rah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize rohtu tuh vaekheihmawte</para>
  <para style="q1">aening tungvaw yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pou Jeremiah, ka ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hiinzia kha ny khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">na syntawtua ccaw hae cite,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha syntawtuanawpaw uccaw lang te</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin thyaasahnawpaw lang kae rae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mih balyn mawte lungkhungte</para>
  <para style="q2">rawse a mang hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw lawtyte</para>
  <para style="q2">a khiavuikuh hae paw nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh sohin te</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte ro a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sosuhnawpaw maee tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte rua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kuee mah maee nynh pong u vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">paw sanmah thanenaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize sivaw-ia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaa kho lae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Minmin kha “vua athuapaw ngun”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ko athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a vua vae hae.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Pachia Byapianaw kha A Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw bya tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn koikua kyakhe thadyn lah, e bya hynh hopah hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beik khylan e thuakaw hae kya oun tee hae paw nanning Judah ccungccaw hae balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nae hiinzia te nae cyisahnaw kha raekuh thui oh lah, e hmin kya kae umsah cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />“E hmin hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn nynh thua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn nynh thua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn nynh thua,” cite hynpaw bya kha doliakuh nan oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae hiinzia te nae cyisahnaw kha thanccingte na raeku thui oh ze thuasah, lu kheit te lu kheit hmerarih lante na ccuepeku oh ze thuasah, <verse number="6" style="v" />ramccang hae, ngawraw hae te nomae hae tungvaw tuaasahnaw rae leite na um oh zah, seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise kha e hmin kya na luasah khyh oh ze thuasah, naemaw toulou vaemaw muesaku khylan ccangpaw pachia hae kha na zui khyh oh ze thuasah, <verse number="7" style="v" />langmawlya te zungzae hanlan nae minpaaw hae ka pya hae paw ram, e hmin kyahin nanning ryte ka um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Athane leipaw hynbya kha na doliaku oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh rute, ccungccaw chiate, nopi pise seinaw raete, ahme lei lante byakinkute, Baal kalan silawnaw raete, na ny lei oh paw ccangpaw pachia hae kalan zuikute, <verse number="10" style="v" />nae cceih oh zah ka min te kopaw e inn kya, ka malang khe na thadyn oh, te e anungsikuhpaw balyn hynh ah rae keiccu oh nynh, “Aening tuh ah khyn oh!” cite na ho cih oh tou? <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka min te kopaw e inn hynh miruh hae karung lang tou na ria oh? E hae balyn hynh phe ka muih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luk 19.46</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka min kha masaty ka la umsahnaw, Shiloh khua umpaw ka umnaw hmin langkhe atu cceih oh lah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae mih hoyleinaw keiccuze, tuh-e hmin kha pawtemou ka la cyi cipaw la do oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Jos 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:60">Sam 78.60</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:6">Jer 26.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Nanning nynh e uccaw hae balyn hynh na cyi oh keiccuze thuasah, atu te atu kae hopah oh zahmah na ngae khyh oh keiccuze thuasah, kae ko vae oh ze nae oi khyh oh keiccuze thuasah <verse number="14" style="v" />ka min liate kopaw, na doliakuh oh paw e inn, nanning te nae minpaaw hae kae pya oh paw hmin kha Shiloh kya ka cyi hawte ka cyih cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nae puizia athuapaw Efraim ciihan balyn kha ka vua hae hawte, nanning kha ka muih leinaw langkhe kae vua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah hae nynh Kaw-einaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeremiah, e ccungccaw hae hanlan sawsang nan, minmin ccelang sia nan lah, sawsang nan, kae hynh mah yn soihbia nan, pawccecize na bya kha kae thaepah lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh Judah khua hae kya te Jerusalem laanpi hae kya a cyi hae paw kha na muih khyh tou? <verse number="18" style="v" />Imua hae nynh maeething a suelua hae, paaw hae nynh maee a tua hae, nung hae nynh chanvuih khui kha non hae zah vaawlui siapharannung elang sanlou a raepya hae; ccangpaw pachia hae kalan niapaw silawnaw kha rae hae zah ka thin yn riasah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:7-19">Jer 44.7-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh a thinriasah hae paw tuh kae ka thua tou? Mimaw toulou kha vaemaw muesakuh khyh hae tou? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: E hmin kya um hae paw ccungccaw te sarangpaw kya thuasah, loo lungkhu e thingku hae te laephi kya-e thingthae-eccang kya thuasah ka thinrianaw te ka bungpawnaw tuh accah cih; tuh-e thinrianaw maee tuh arua cih zah chih vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nae kya-e maee-ute silawnawpaw kha si na lawnaw oh paw kyakhe nungchih oh lah, asaw kha phe ae lalae oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize nae minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate ka poukhae lya hae ze, maee-ute silawnaw kong te silawnaw kong kha ka hopah khyh hae zah kawbya mah ka pya khyh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin kha, “Ka bya ngae oh lah, nae Pachia ka thua cih zah, nanning tuh ka ccungccaw hae na thua cih oh; nae laan nae sui a ua nawlan, kaw kae pya oh paw rou kha zui oh,” cite kawbya ka pya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin nynh kawngae khyh hae, mih nakaring mah tuakuh khyh hae, ahoy leipaw mih rynaw te mih lungkhungnaw khate mih tuakunaw kyakhe cceih hae zah, malang laeze nulang kha a dohua paleih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae nynh Izip ram kyate oun pou nin hae te atunin cia, ka ryalahtu profeh hae kha nin kheit koute nin kheit minmin kalan atu te atu ka saw hae; <verse number="26" style="v" />tuhzemah minmin nynh ka bya kha ngae leite pawlangria khyh hae, mih nging tokarae lan a um hae. Mih minpaaw hae nynh a cyi hae paw laeze houh athahhua lante a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />E bya balyn hynh na hopya hae zemah ae ngaepah lan khyh hae. Na ko hae zemah ae oi lan khyh hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang nynh na hopya lan hae paw tuh: E minphuin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia bya a ngae lei hae paw te thuiheinaw a lawkuh lei hae paw nynh thua; byaccing tuh aroh vae; mih mung kyate byaccing kha a vua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na sang kha ngo lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaring vuatua;</para>
  <para style="q1">mua otung vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite umtua,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize amaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thin a riasahpaw she kha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a vua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Judah hae nynh ka malang khe hoyleinaw kha a rae vae hae; ka min te kopaw inn kyakhe mih kya-e anungsikuhpaw kha nung hae zah a thusah hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha maee te u nawlan cite, Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya khe Tofet cikuhpaw beiknawpaw hminthyaa kha a rae hae, tuh-e tuh kaw ka pya hae paw thua khyh, ka lungkhu yn thungkuhpaw mah thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18.21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:10">2Si 23.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:35">Jer 32.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, dotua, tuh-e accya tuh Tofet cite ko thua vae lan khyh, Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya cite mah ko thua vae lan khyh, Chianaw accya cite ko athua ccyh yn thua vae cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; pawccecize michi uunaw hmin a um lei lan ciate Tofet kyakhe michi a uh cih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae rhua tuh vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi kya-e sarangpaw hae hanlan looh athua cih; lu kheit nynh sanmah khah-e hae kha dee lan khyh hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah khuapi hae kya te Jerusalem e laanpi hae kyakhe lungtua lungpawnaw roi, zudy ccangvaepaw te akaenung liaccanung roi kha ka daesah cih; pawccecize ram tuh ccungccaw adaenaw ram lang a tang vae cih, a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:9">Jer 16.9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:10">25.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:23">Bya 18.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Tuin ccyh vae tuh Judah siapharan hae ru, Judah bawi hae ru, ranpibawi hae ru, profeh hae ru te Jerusalem um hae paw ru kha mih shaw lungkhu te law athua cih; <verse number="2" style="v" />minmin nynh a la ry hae paw te rya a la lawpya hae paw, a la zui hae paw, a la ccung hae paw te a la beik hae paw khuanin, sawpaw te vaaw bawi hae malang khe pazaesaku athua cih hae; khah-e hae kha suelua thua lan khyh zah uu thua lan khyh hae; lae vawlan khe ia hawte athua cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw e minphuin kya-e ahiinhy hae paw balyn nynh ka deenaw hae hmin miakaw kyakhe hiinnaw laeze chinaw kha a ryhua cih hae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Seinaw te Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang nynh minmin kya na hopya lan hae paw tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw tuh he a khuliaku vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">bua thokuh khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">A cciasei ze, kithui khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccemou e ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kyate maeleihkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kithui leite a um zungzae hae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hynbya kha ccavyng kyngkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kithui lan a mya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pekite ka ngaepya hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">asasite byaho khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pawmou ka cyisei!” cite ho hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q1">a hoyleinaw kha ngaesikuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Rhawtuknaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccue cciamangpaw marang hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q1">mih laanpi raveih langkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a maekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaawlui kya azouthyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kaepaw-pavaw nynh heize</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw ccyh kha a nyku;</para>
  <para style="q2">vahu, ccipae te ccusae-pavaw nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ki ccyh kha a nyku hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ka ccungccaw hae nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungzae kha nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Aening tuh ah haw oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">aening kya a um,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou na ho kho oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccawzeitu hae kya-e ahynpaw bawpe nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihaw hae kha maethyalaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih hae, a siikuh cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">kaang a kae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha he a ei hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kya pawcihawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw mou a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih zu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae kalan ka pya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih loo kha taetu hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka pya cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize adih huapaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ale huapaw kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte ahme leite</para>
  <para style="q2">mue lan a karankuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">profeh kyate ranpibawi kyacia</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte a hyn a hu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:12-15">Jer 6.12-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Daenaw a um vae khyh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Daenaw, daenaw,” cite ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae vaemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oihsah khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Eze 13.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maethya lan umpaw kha cyih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw rya kha a law hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah mih maethah khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethya mah nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tukeiccuze a khuliakuh hae paw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh bua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha de he ka tah hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin kha suelua ka ry hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama misu ku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thaeku ku kya thaeku thae um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">anaw heize anaan,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin ka pya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kyate phe azo vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccemou phang ah haung oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Sueluakuh oh sih, akoihkhawkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi hae kalan cceih oh sih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya chih oh sih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ah sei oh keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ro khylan oun vua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">chi sii thungkuhpaw tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nia lan oun pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaengannaw kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">hoynaw ah mue khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">dannaw ccyh kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">siikunaw kha nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih marang hae naduh kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">accaepaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Dan ram kyate phe thaekuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih marangtepaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a siarua hae paw roi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ram pynpi tuh ahy.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh oun thua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ram te ram kya umpaw balyn kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi te khuaccaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasah pong a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dotua, zingsah kho athua leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">huparepaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nae kalan kae sawnua cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae khyh cih oh, cite</para>
  <para style="qr">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw hae hanlan Profeh A Rah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungpawnaw phe zo,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyanaw nynh yn thuanua,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrote ka um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asawnaw ram um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw ryachi hae</para>
  <para style="q1">siaruanaw kha ngaetua oh:</para>
  <para style="q2">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Zion kya</para>
  <para style="q1">um vae khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">A Siapharan tuh amaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">um vae khyh tou?” cite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">(“Pawccemou mih zohtuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang zohtuh hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thin yn riasah hae?”)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Loohrue ccyh athang vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnin ccyh mah alia vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening tuh khum ah thua</para>
  <para style="q2">lae khyh oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw ryachi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaemaw a mue hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">kae mah vaemaw ka mue,</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite ka um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thinphangnaw te phe ka beih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gilead tuh Jordan vaw nithua lang a umpaw ram thua zah, thingku hae tuh isei lang rae lan a minthaan.</char></note> ram kya dannawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">isei um khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuin ram kya sibawi so um khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou ka ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ryachi hae hynh a dan khyh hae?</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lu hynh tuisung thua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mit hynh mitphi apounaw</para>
  <para style="q1">tuidy thua vae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhteze nynh a chih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw ryachi hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi khuadae ka rah kho cih!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae kha cciataw te</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw lang ka ccia kho nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">laesia ram khe ryanawpaw bu bukheit</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hoi ravo nyn!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">milae zu milae vawpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw rae hae paw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungzi leipaw phu nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih lae kha li hawte a koi hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">byaccing hanlan thua leite</para>
  <para style="q1">hynbya hanlan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lungkhu kya thawzung</para>
  <para style="q1">a hoithung hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangkheit rae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn nyh khyh hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nae innpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">raeringkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae puizia lu kheit sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">doliakuh nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nae puizia miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahynthyapaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ruiban miakaw tuh thethya</para>
  <para style="q2">a hothyapaw nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih balynte mih ruiban hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ling hae zah, byaccing a hopaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit san um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya ho lan mih lae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccangpya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw kha rae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaesiku khylan myaryamaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaethang vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaasahkunaw kha ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit, lingkunaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangkheit koute ccangkheit a rae hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae kha yn nyh ry khyh hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha sivaw tuisahte</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaasah hawte ka thyaasah</para>
  <para style="q1">cih hae zah, ka syntawtua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">aseipaw ka ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou ka cyih kho ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih lae tuh chinawpaw the thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khalang lungkhu te hynbya kha a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih balynte mih innpaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">nawnekute bya kha a ho hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama mih lungkhu kya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">dokhawnaw kha a paccyn hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E mih cyisahnaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">de ka tah lan khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hynhcihawpaw minphuin tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw kha ka thuakhae</para>
  <para style="q1">lan khyh tou? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mua hae te ramkaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sahiin paeekunaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rah ka khui cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize tuh-e ram hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maee nynh a u keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q1">cceih vae khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">sahiin siho mah thae lan um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlang e pavaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw hae mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccue hae zah um vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem kha arohpaw apumkuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram-ui karung lang ka rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah ram e khua hae kha arohpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw a um leipaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />E acyihkuhpaw hynh thaethya lan ciate ahawpaw hummou a um? E kong hynh a ho kho ccaw cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hummou a hopya? Lu kheit nynh sanmah a ccia vae khyh ccaw cite pawccemou ram tuh roh zah, ramkaw hawte ccungccaw phe adae? <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: “Mih malang ka nungpya hae paw ka kawbya kha vua hae zah, ka bya kha eite zui khyh hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />mih minpaaw hae nynh a ccangpya hae hawte, mih lungkhung thyhte um hae zah Baal pachia kha a zui hae,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E ccungccaw hae hynh eccangkary kha ka dang cih hae zah, chi sii thungkuhpaw tui kha nia lan ka pya cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin te mih minpaaw hae nynh a la ny boi lei hae paw minphuin hae laku khe phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae; minmin kha ka maemih mawlaezung hae, mih nulang te thaloi kha ka sawnua cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Byapianaw kya A Rah hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Hoyte tua oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rah a khuithyapaw nopi hae kha ko oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">michi hlaw a sahthya hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hae kha kosah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aening hanlan michi hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte oun sahpah hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhteze nynh ah mitphi alua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah mitteky kyate tui alua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion kya-e rawnaw roi</para>
  <para style="q2">thae athuapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hohcih ciate mou ronaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ah teing oh! Ah teing oh paw</para>
  <para style="q1">maethyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw accih,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ah ram kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ah cciataw oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ah inn ah lo hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ah vuasya vae oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pou nopi hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngaetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae nakaring nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a khalang lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">bya kha thae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ccanung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">michi hlaw ccangpah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae innpaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethyanaw hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chinaw tuh aening thanlan-aw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkhu lang yn tee zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening siapharan inn hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn tee vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">imua hae kha laanpi kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">maemih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangvae hae kha khualae e</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi hae kyate a maemih hae.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Michi rhua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">loo lungkhu khe ia hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">loohruetu nukhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">ccamua hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sueluatu lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">um lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: A hawpaw ccungccaw nynh a hawnaw khate pookuh nan sah, a thawsaepaw nynh a thawsaenaw khate pookuh nan sah, mihoipaw nynh a hoipaw khate pookuh nan sah; <verse number="24" style="v" />thuasalama pooku a rypaw nynh tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuanaw yn nyh zah yn thaethyanaw kyakhe pookuh sah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:31">1Ko 1.31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:17">2Ko 10.17</ref></char></note> laephi vawlan hin atynpaw sungsakunaw, byading te dingnaw khate rya ka lah, pawccecize e uccaw hae kyahin ka lungrythua, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Mih pynsaw vingdung rou kha aw athua hae paw Izip hae, Judah hae, Edom hae, Ammon hae, Moab hae te mih sang ngokuh hae paw laesia ram a um hae paw balyn tungvaw detahnaw nin tuh yn thua ccaccing cih. Pawccecize e minphuin hae tuh vingdungawkuh khyh hae, Israel hae balyn mah mih thinlung kya vingdungawkuh khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh keiccu Israel Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Israel hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae hopya oh paw bya hynh ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Minphuin ccangpaw hae laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangkuh nan oh, vaawlui e</para>
  <para style="q2">muihsahnaw hae keiccu mah</para>
  <para style="q1">siikuh nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin ccangpaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae keiccu a siikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae phungtho tuh kyh khyh:</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e thing kha nge hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuihhae hoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw nynh hae te a sue;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuh-e tuh sui te ngun te ccaan hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang a nueku khyh ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">khynlyng te thingkhia a khiade hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih zohtuh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zinae khokhu kya arih-avaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rih sah cite saepaw uccaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">lokuh hae zah bya mah</para>
  <para style="q1">hothya khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciathya khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">phu te a phu hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khah-e hae kha rih nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rae kho khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hoynaw kha mah rae kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang ae lopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung mah um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh na lesae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min mah thungnaw te a lesae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou minphuin hae Siapharan,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae rih leipaw hummou a um?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Bya 15.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan a ccanpaw nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">a hawhua hae paw kya thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih peenaw balyn kya thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae lopaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin tuh angaee-abupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">zohtuh kyate a mue hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thuiheinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thingtung laeze ahoy huanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">um khyh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adeihkuhpaw ngun tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Tarshish ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">a phu hae paw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sui tuh Ufaz ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">a phu hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khah-e hae tuh a kuihhae hoypaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">suitheithyapaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae hae paw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih boeining tuh meizong te</para>
  <para style="q2">sephaphuhpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalaw apuakuhpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahmepaw Pachia nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh ahiinpaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae Siapharan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">A thinria vae ze laephi tuh ahy,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaesang kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin kha hynhte hopah oh: Vaaw te lae a rae leipaw pachia hae tuh laephi kyate thuasah, vaawlui zakaw kyate thuasah aroh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a huhan te a rae, laephipi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a hawnaw te tynsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha a thyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">tharae a dawsaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A roi he a saw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kya tui roi accae,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking kha a kaethungsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Khuaa hanlan khozaw laesakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccakhungnaw inn kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan kha a pousah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nynaw a hoi leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mingaee cci nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">suilaeethya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih zohtuh hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyalaw athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih zohtuh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynpyakunaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kya hy um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khah-e hae tuh alakawpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">hynpaw ryalaw nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin detahnaw ccyh kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh aroh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob a hanpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhcihawpaw hae te lokuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh atyn-are a raetu thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel tuh amaw rho athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">a min tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> acikuh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ramccang lang Kyngkunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou rhaw nynh a koihlu hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kya-e nae sisua hae kha suelua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Atumaw, ram lungkhu um hae paw hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka deihnah vae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw kha a teing nawlan hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih tungvaw ka thuasah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka vaemaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka vaemaw tuh myarya le.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama, kae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“E ka teingpaw detahnaw hynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka teing hahe cih,” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka bu tuh aroh vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bu heenawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">liarui balyn tuh apae vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">phe yn cciataw hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bu kha bua a daw lanpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a zokhaw lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize tuurin hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaee hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha tuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ngiakuh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze mih laan mih sui ua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuuphu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">phiariphiarae a phiakuh hae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siarisiaraepaw roi tuh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Oun ccia hae paw roi tuh ngaetua oh—</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah khuapi hae kha rote</para>
  <para style="q2">suizaw hae karung lang rae khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">thahlang ram kyate ngaluin-ngaluin</para>
  <para style="q2">accaepaw roi pipi tuh yn naekuh vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ccungccaw nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a zuipaw a laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">uk kho khyh zah, a ccia lyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a laanccia kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">dosekuh thya khyh cipaw ka ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, yn thuiheitua,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama thinriate thuihei leite</para>
  <para style="q1">byading te yn thuiheitua;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhkhyhze tuh accakaepaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tangsahsei cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang ae nyh leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae tungvaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">na min ae ko leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q1">na thinrianaw kha ccawsah tua,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob kha karyh ae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a maemih vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a umnaw kha mah a ropya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw A Ro hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />E byakinnaw bya hae hynh ngae lah, Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kalan hopah hae. <verse number="3-5" style="v" />Nang nynh minmin kya na hopya lan hae paw tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw</char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Sivaw tuisahnawpaw somaee athuapaw Izip ram kyate nae minpaaw hae kha, Ka bya ngae oh lah, kaw kae pya oh paw balyn hynh cyih oh, cite hopyate ka poukhae lya hae ze, kaw ka pya hae paw, e byakinnaw bya hynh pawlang a ria leipaw miakaw kya thyalawnaw ccah sah. Atunin acyiku hawte, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram kha kae pya cih oh, cite nae minpaaw hae kya bya ka kinpyaku hae paw kha ka ccingsah nawlan, nanning tuh ka ccungccaw hae na thua cih oh zah, kae tuh nae Pachia ka thua cih, a ci. Tetuh kae nynh, “Tuhmawte thua sah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,” ka cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Judah khuapi hae kya te Jerusalem laanpi hae kyakhe hynhte siakhae tua: E byakinnaw bya hynh thae oh lah, zui oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize nae minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate ka poukhae lya hae te atunin cia, Ka bya ngae oh, cite raeringnaw hoyte ka pya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin nynh zui khyh hae, mih nakaring tuakuh khyh hae, mih balynte ahoy leipaw mih rynaw thyhte lungkhungte a ccia hae. Tukeiccuze zui lan kaw ka pya hae zah a zui lei hae paw e byakinnaw bya balyn hynh mih tungvaw ka ccawsah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn hopyapaw tuh: Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh aruh lante paccynkunaw a hoi hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka bya a ei hae paw langmawlya e mih minpaaw hae hoyleinaw kalan khe a ki vae hae; ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik khylan, tuh-e hae nulang khe a zuikuh vae hae; mih minpaaw hae ryte kae raekheihpaw byakinnaw kha Israel hae te Judah hae nynh a ro vae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin nynh a lue kho lei hae paw ronaw kha mih tungvaw ka thuasah ccaccing cih; ka kalan a sia hae zemah, ka ngaepah lan khyh hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Judah khuapi hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh si a law hae paw pachia hae kalan cciate a sia hae zemah, mih vawsaw ccyh lyakhe tuh-e pachia hae nynh kharouh khum lan khyh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou Judah, na pachia hae tuh na khua hae zeih acih hae; te maethyalawku khylan na raepaw silawhang hae, Baal kalan silaw nawlan na raepaw silawhang hae tuh Jerusalem khua e laanpi hae zeih acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jeremiah, nang nynh e ccungccaw hae hanlan sawsang nan, minmin ccelang sia nan lah sawsang nan, pawccecize mih vawsaw lya yn ko hae ze, ka ngaepah lan khyh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sungsahnung nynh anungsikuhpaw rya a law lyakhe, ka inn kya paw kaw mou a hoi ung? Byakinpyakunaw te silawnawpaw saw nynh nae kya-e ronaw kha a sibia kho tou? Te nae lungtua kho tou? <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaekheihlya tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha, “Thae hoypaw te apuithya khaekuhpaw, hinlalyhpaw oliv thing,” cite ae la ko; thuasalama tuh-e oliv thing tuh myarya ccaepaw roi khate maee a soi cih zah, a karan hae tuh a u cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel hae te Judah hae nynh Baal kalan silawnaw raete ka thin yn riasah hae zah, hoyleinaw a rae hae keiccuze, nang ae linkuhtupaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang ae rawsenawpaw hoyleinaw kong kha a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah hanlan Rhaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka rhaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">paccynkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">yn nysah keiccuze ka ny;</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw mih cyisahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae langsahpyaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama kae tuh chia khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">tuutaw zingbabipaw hawte nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin nynh, “A min kha</para>
  <para style="q1">liathui athua vae khyh nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning hynh a hiin hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">umnaw laephi kyate zosah oh sih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku kha athae ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">roh oh sih,” cite hokute, hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">yn la paccynnuaku hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka la nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thinlung te tuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a syntawtuapaw, ahmete bya a piapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">de na tah hae paw kha beih yn muih sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh ka byathan kha nang kae pya vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze e hynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te profehbya na ho lan khyh, tuhkhyhze tuh kae kuih te na chih cih,” cite nang kha ae hopah hae zah, na hiinnaw ae hawkuh hae paw Anathoth ccungccaw hae te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw nynh thua— <verse number="22" style="v" />tukeiccuze vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin kha de ka tah cih hae; ccangvae hae tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae; mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae tuh ccakan te a chih cih hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />lu kheit sanmah hiinhy lan khyh. Pawccecize Anathoth ccungccaw hae tungvaw, minmin detahnaw kum, ronaw kha ka thuasah cih,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia kya Jeremiah Lungccing leinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsete bya he ka hotua tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh a dingpaw nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ka byathan hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">na kalan beih kae thuakhae sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hoylei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih laan mih sui a ua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou mihyn hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoirum hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na lin hae zah, mih tharui asaw;</para>
  <para style="q1">lethung hae zah athae a thae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh mih munglae te na naekuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah mih thinlung te tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na sawkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh phe nae ny;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinlung tuh na kya a umpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na muih zah nae syntawtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Chia lanpaw tuu hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ccaring sue hae lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">chia nin hanlan taetynte nung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae ram hynh hohseciamou</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite a um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram pynpi e lonua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hohseciamou arou cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw keiccu thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae nynh “Ah cyi oh paw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh muih lan khyh,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite a ho hae keiccu thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw hae te pavaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">phe mih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Jeremiah kha Bya A Leih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang tuh ccungccaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccuesuekuh oh zah na bang lanze,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawtemou marang hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">na taekuh kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Akhynnaw ram kya na khuliaku lanze,</para>
  <para style="q2">thabu alungnaw Jordan vaw kin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou na cyih kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na uno te na innbyn hae nynh heize,</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw mih lungzi vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na nulang te thawte ae sianua vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh nawnekute</para>
  <para style="q1">bya ae hopya hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">zyn nan hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka inn kha ka vua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rho kha ka cciataw vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka thinlung te myarya ka sungsahpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rhaw hae kuih kalan ka pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka rho tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e chindeih hawte nynh athua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha thawte yn sianua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha ka hua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rho hynh kae ka hanlan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sawhepaw a aepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">pavaw apyaapaw te nynh aloku.</para>
  <para style="q2">Sawhepaw a aepaw pavaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha phang a koihlu hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Rang oh, loramsaw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae balynte sueluakuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha tei khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">loramsaw hae kha oun ko oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuurin hae patae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka misu khokhu kha a ro vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh ka hanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a syde vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungrythuakhaekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hanpaw kha ccungccaw a um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw lang a rae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh ram rohpaw lang a rae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ram tuh aro keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kalan yn rawnua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ram pynpi mawte phe roh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ramkaw ahangnaw hmin balyn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">luadetu hae a thua vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thaloi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ram voikheit langte voikheit lang cia</para>
  <para style="q1">a ro vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit sanmah khyn lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh chanvuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccou hae zah, hinpaw kha a rue hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a bangsakuh hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">athanenaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh myaryamaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinria keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh a mue hae paw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">mih maethyakhaekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka ccungccaw Israel hae nynh rho lang ccou hae sah cite ka pya hae paw ka rho kha a rohtu hae, ahoy leipaw ka innpaw hae balyn kha mih ram kyate poh ka khoi cih hae, te minmin laku kyate Judah phin kha poh ka khoi cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin kha poh ka khoi kou hae te, mih tungvaw ngaethya ka umsah thui cih hae zah, mih balynte mih rho athuapaw mih ram langkhe bua ka cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae kha Baal pachia min te byakinku lan a ccangpya hae hawte, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin,” cite ka min phyate byakinku khylan, minmin nynh ka ccungccaw hae beiknaw phung kha zuakute a ccangku hae zetuh, ka ccungccaw hae laku ka tynsah cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama bya a ngae leipaw minphuin miakaw tuh abalyn mawte poh ka khaee cih hae zah ka roh cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Cce kya Voikupaw Boeining</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “La cceih lah, tae kya voikupaw boei kha la rekuh lah, na tae kya voikuh, thuasalama tui kya na dung lan khyh,” yn cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte cce kya voikupaw boei kha ka rekuh zah ka tae kya ka voiku. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh vae ningnaw ka kya yn thua zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na rekuh zah na voikupaw ccevoiboei kha lawkuh lah, atu Zufrates vaw lang la cciatua, te tuh-e tuh lungpi karung kyakhe la thuruhtua,” yn cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw yn pya thyhte ka cceih zah tuh-e tuh Zufrates vaw kin khe ka thuruh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccyh hynhsepi aro te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Atu Zufrates lang la cceih lah, tuin kya thuruh lan kaw kae pyapaw ccevoiboei kha la lah,” yn cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh Zufrates vaw lang ka cceih zah, ka thuruhnaw hmin kya-e ccevoiboei kha ka thaebia zah ka law. Thuasalama ccevoiboei tuh baluh mawe vae zah, pawpaw lang mah hoy vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E hawte Judah nynh a lysakunaw te Jerusalem nynh myarya a lysakunaw kha ka roh cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka bya a thae ry lei hae paw, mimaw rynaw kha lungkhungte a zui hae paw, te ccangpaw pachia hae kha ryalawpya khylan te beik khylan tuh-e pachia hae nulang a zuikuh hae paw, e ccungccaw hoylei hae paw hynh pawpaw lang mah ahoy lei vae paw, e ccevoiboei hawte athua cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccevoiboei tuh ccungccaw tae kya a beku hawte, Israel hae balyn te Judah hae balyn tuh kamaw hanlan minphuin phuin kheit, min minkheit, thehoynaw ccangkheit te phu-enaw ccangkheit athua ccaw hae cite kamaw kya a bekuh lante ka rae hae. Thuasalama ka bya ngae khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Misu Tui-ung Syntawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />E bya hynh minmin kalan na hopah cih hae: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Misu tui-ung miakaw kya misutui phe abeih cih. Te minmin nynh nang kha, “Misu tui-ung miakaw kya misutui bia lanpaw tuh nyh lan khyh hae cite tou nae tua?” ae cipah cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh nang nynh minmin kyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E ram kya a um hae paw balyn, David kya-e bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw siapharan hae, ranpibawi hae, profeh hae te Jerusalem kya a um hae paw kha marya ka ruisah cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te lu kheit te lu kheit, nungpaaw hae te ccaaw hae kha rawsekute ka ziasakuh cih hae; minmin kha he ka roh hae te, ngaethyaumsahnaw, synkunaw te thawccinaw ka hoi lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ramccang lang Kyngkunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngae oh lah, nae nakaring kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaku tua oh; lysakuh nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zetepakaw amohdyn, nae ccu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mua vawlan a thyku mawkhe thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh mohnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuakhae mawkhe thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">te awnaw kha na ngaehoi zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e awnaw tuh ngaethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">marae zipingkuhpaw mohnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae mawkhe thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha phu-esah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanning nynh na ngae khyh oh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning na lysahkunaw oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinlung tuh aruh lante a rah a khui cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuuphu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kyng hae zah a cciakhae vae hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte ka rah cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mitphi alua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siapharan te siapharan nung kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Haungnaw anenaw kya haung oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize apuithyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nae bawilukhung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lu kyate accah vae,” cite hopah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Alia lang e khua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q1">hung lei lante khaw athua vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah hae balyn kha see lang</para>
  <para style="q1">cciakhae athua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte see lang</para>
  <para style="q1">cciakhae athua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngawran do oh lah, thahlang te</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua hae paw khuh dotua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kae pyapaw tuuphu,</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw na tuuphu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ruiban lang tang khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccangpya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na tungvaw uktu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">nung he athua hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">pawtemou na ho cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Neitangia accihpaw nopi hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ccinaw na teing lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thinlung kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawccemou e uccaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tungvaw yn thua?” cite na ciku lanze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na seinaw myarya ale keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">na boeipae kha kalyng na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">seikhae na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ethiopia ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ving kha a rulaekuh kho hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kaesing nynh a pyaa kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rulaekuh kho tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">A la rulaekuh kho lanze,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw palei na rae oh paw</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">hoynaw kha na rae kho cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laesia ram e khisan nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a mungpaw vaekang hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha phiariphiarae kae nung cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nanning nynh kae kha nae ning oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya kha na doliaku oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning elang kae toupya oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nae hanpaw tuh e hynh nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae boeipae kha nae mae kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kalyngpah cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae maethyanaw kha ka langsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na nungsikunaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ohhuakunaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">rangtepaw siate na sianaw oh</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">maethya ny leite</para>
  <para style="q2">na ohhuakunaw oh kha ka muih vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Jerusalem, na hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha thyaasah na thua maw</para>
  <para style="q2">hohseciamou hynhte na um ung cih?</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khuaakannaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw khuaakannaw te asekuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ram tuh rawkhuite um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a koikua hae tuh vawsaw a teing hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya te laephi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a huekuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem a rawnaw roi tuh houhouh accae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi hae nynh mih ryalahtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tui the lan a saw hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ryalahtu hae tuh tuisung kya a thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama tui kha muih khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui-ung ccakaete a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin tuh maethya lungrote</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu a bongkuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize laephi tuh phaephae apaw.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ram kya khuaaraw khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">loopho hae tuh lungrote um hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu kha a bongku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ramkaw e sazuh pinung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua a um khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ataw anopaw kha a cciataw.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ramkaw e lann hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangnaw otung kya thadyn hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">suizaw hae hawte khivae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte a sue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">lonua a um khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mit tuh ngawmuih kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae hoyleinaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaekia a khan zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min keiccuze beih oun bawmtua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae lungzi leinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya alung ccaccing,</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw kae sei vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou Israel nynh a ngaehoikupaw nang,</para>
  <para style="q2">a vawsaw ccyh lya a khumtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccemou kae ram lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">mikhia hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zi kheit rya te yn thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaccongtu hawte thuasah na thua cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccemou a lungmuapaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">bawmnaw a pya kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawkawpaw a thungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawte thuasah na thua cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening laku na um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening tuh na min te</para>
  <para style="q2">ko athua hae paw nynh kae thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening hynh oun vua nan!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae te asekuh lante</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh khiavuiku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a ry hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccu kha sungkuh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tungvaw a lungrythua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoyleinaw kha a liathui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih seinaw kha de a tah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn hopyapaw tuh: E ccungccaw hae hoynaw hanlan sawsangpah nan hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Looh-ae a sung hae zemah mih siaruanaw kha ka thaepah khyh hae, maee-ute silawnaw te ccathae silawnaw kha a rae hae zemah ka ccoupah khyh hae; thaloi, ccakannaw te shethya khate minmin kha ka maemih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahynpaw Profeh hae Seisahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, profeh hae nynh minmin kha, ‘Thaloi rhaw na tung lan khyh oh, na ccakan lan khyh oh, e hmin kya atynpaw daenaw kha kae pya cih oh,’ cite a hopya hae,” ka cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Profeh hae nynh ka min te hynbya kha a ho hae; minmin kha ka saw khyh hae, kaw ka pya khyh hae, ho mah ka hopah khyh hae. Minmin nynh nanning kha ahme leipaw vizin, ccungkia leipaw khozi bahkuhpaw bya, mimaw tuanaw te a hyn hae paw bya kha ae hopya oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha a saw lei hae pite, “E ram kya thaloi rhaw te ccakannaw thua lan khyh,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te a ho hae paw profeh hae konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Tuh-e profeh hae tuh thaloi rhaw te ccakannaw khate maemih athua cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te minmin bya a ngaepaw ccungccaw hae tuh mimaw, mih zu hae, mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae ryte ccakannaw te thaloi rhaw keiccuze Jerusalem laanpi hae kyakhe vua athua cih hae zah, minmin a uhtu lu kheit san um lan khyh. Pawccecize mih hoyleinaw kha mih tungvaw ka vuanua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />E bya hynh minmin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na hopah cih hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Khuazi khuadae ka mitphi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kan leite lua sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka minphuin liaccady tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccih lan zia thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccihpaw vaemaw a mue.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramkaw lang he ka cceih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te chia athua hae paw kha ka muih!</para>
  <para style="q1">Khuapi lungkhu lang he ka tee tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakan keiccuze kanmaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a um hae paw kha ka muih!</para>
  <para style="q2">Profeh hae te ranpibawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nythyanaw hoi leite</para>
  <para style="q2">ram pynpi kya khuaccong bungthung hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Thawccinaw A Ngiaku hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah tuh na vua ccaccing vae tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion tungvaw na lua na aethua vae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kaening hynh dan kho lei lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou nae zia?</para>
  <para style="q1">Daenaw kha kae ngaehoi salamah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoynaw kae mue khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">dannaw ccyh kha kae ngaehoi salamah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rikawnaw kha nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae hoyleinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">kae minpaaw hae seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae phyku, pawccecize</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw phe kae sei vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na min keiccuze kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun vua nan;</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-epaw na bawitungkhung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thethyasah nan;</para>
  <para style="q1">liathui lah, kaening kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na raepaw na byakinnaw kha roh nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minphuin ccangpaw hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh hae kya khuaa a rawsah</para>
  <para style="q1">khopaw zohtuh a um zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhkhyhze vaawlui nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaa a rawsah kho tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">a cyih khopaw tuh namaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae ngaehoinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw kya kae nung,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize e hae balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">a cyihtupaw tuh namaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sibia kho Leipaw Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Moses te Samuel nynh ka malang a thadyn hae zemah, e ccungccaw hae hynh ngaethya ka ungsah lan khyh hae. Minmin kha ka kyate de hae lah, cceih hae sah!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Exo 32.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:13-19">Nam 14.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:5-9">1Sa 7.5-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, “Teilangmou kae cceih cih?” cite ae khia hae ze, na hopya lan hae paw tuh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ci:</para>
  <para style="q1">Shethya kalan accan hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya kalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi kalan accan hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi kalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccakannaw kalan accan hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakannaw kalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyngkunaw kalan accan hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kyngkunaw kalan cceih oh, cite na hopah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin tungvaw rohtu phuin pali ka nungnua cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci: chia nawlan thaloi, sue te tei nawlan ui, a aetu lang vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi kya-e loramsaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah siapharan Hezekiah ccapaw Manasseh nynh Jerusalem khua lungkhu a cyipaw keiccuze minmin tuh laephi vaw e ram balyn hanlan ri lan um hae paw lang ka rae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:1-16">2Si 21.1-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:1-9">2Sh 33.1-9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pou Jerusalem, hum nynh mou nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya ae ungsah cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum nynh mou a ngae ae thyakhae cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na dan tou, cite nang kha byabeih khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou na kalan yn teepaw cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang nynh kae kha nae vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang nae sihtawku vae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze ka kuih kae dyngnua zah kae ro vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsah tolae tuh phe ka bang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin kha ram lungkhu e koikua hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkung te ka vaw vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha rawkhuite ka nung vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih laanpi kyate maeleihkuh khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae kha ka ro vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih nomae hae tuh rili laesia laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">a lunghua vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ninthuccynglyn khe imua hae mih nung hae</para>
  <para style="q2">a rohtupaw kha ka thuasah vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e mih nung tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathaenaw te rikawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheihmawte ka thuasah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccapaw lu sari a saahpaw nopi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawzya vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a hy athang vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">khuadae ccyh lyamawkhe a khuanin accah;</para>
  <para style="q2">maethya thethyate a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin laku e tuhlaepaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhaw hae malang khe</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi rhaw kalan ka pya cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh A Lungbounaw A Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pou anung, ka tungvaw ngaethya lan kou um, ram pynpi te a pekuh hae paw te a eikuh hae paw pisepaw kae hynh nae la saahku! Humhung kha mah phua ka koiisakuh boi khyh zah, koii mah ka koii boi khyh, tuhzemah ccungccaw balyn nynh kae kha thya yn law hae. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Na hiin hoynaw hanlan kae cyipya ccaccing vae, vawsaw ccyh te riathae ccyh kya na rhaw hae nynh nang kha bawmnaw ae ngiaku nawlan hae kae cyipya ccaccing vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Sivaw te sohin nynh palung langte yn thuapaw sivaw kha a khya kho hae tou?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ram pynpi kya-e na seinaw balyn keiccuze na sisua te na hoirumnaw kha amee leite, luadetu hae kalan ka pya cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ny leipaw ram kyakhe na rhaw hae hanlan rya kae lawsah cih, pawccecize ka thinria keiccuze zungzae arua cih paw maee tuh tyh athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang nynh phe na ny;</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hynh yn liathui lah, yn paebua tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae yn tuaa yn sah hae paw tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw kha thuakhae tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha ngaesangpyate</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hynh beih yn maemih nan;</para>
  <para style="q1">na hanlan theihryanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka teingpaw hynh beih nytua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">na bya kha ka muih zah ka lawku,</para>
  <para style="q1">na bya tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw lang tang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungrythuakhaekuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize kae tuh na min te ko ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungpawnaw a raekuh hae paw phu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka haungbua khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpawnaw mah ka raekuh khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuih khangte rya nae pyapaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka makhaete ka um,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinrianaw te phe nae biasah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccemou ka ngesaw accipaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">adae kho khyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou ka vaemaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">dan kho leite um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">azo kho khyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Thanccingte, nang tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ahynhupaw vaw taraw,</para>
  <para style="q1">karae akanpaw tui hawte nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka kalan nae kithui zetuh kae lahthui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rya kha bua na lah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aphutepaw bya kha na ho zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athane leipaw bya kha na ho khyh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya a hotu na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh ka kalan oun kithui cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang nynh minmin kalan na cceih lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae hanlan nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sohin te raepaw khualungrua lang kae rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh nang kha ae rawse cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ae tae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang kha khum khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">luesah khylan kae tuh na kya ka um,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang kha ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">kae luesah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih rysawthah hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kyngkunaw kyate kae shawkhaw cih.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah Zudy leinaw te A Hopaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang tuh zu na dy lan khyh, e hmin kya ccanung ccapaw na saahkuh lan khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />E hmin kya a puipaw ccanung ccapaw hae te thuasah, mih nung mih paaw hae te thuasah asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin tuh a chisah khopaw ccinaw te a chih cih hae. Minmin kha rawhuite uu thua lan khyh hae; lae vawlan e ia hawte athua cih hae. Thaloi te ccakannaw khate a chih cih hae zah, mih rhua tuh vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi vawlan e loramsaw hae hanlan looh athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Michi sungkunaw inn lungkhu lang tee nan, michi rawhui khylan te ngaethyakhae khylan mah cceih nan; pawccecize e ccungccaw hae kyate ka daenaw, atynpaw ka sungsahnaw te ka thawccinaw kha phe ka law vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />E ram kya ccungccaw a lesaepaw te a nyaapaw parouhte a chih cih hae; minmin kha uu thua lan khyh hae, te lu kheit nynh sanmah rawhui lan khyh hae, minmin hanlan ngesaw awkunaw te lu-okunaw um lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Michi hanlan rawkhuite a um hae paw kha lungtangnaw pya khylan hum nynh sanmah loohdangkunaw rae lan khyh; mih nung mih paaw a chi hae keiccuze minmin kha nia lanpaw lungtangnaw banang nangkheit san a pyatu um lan khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Poi tuanaw inn lungkhu lang na tee lan khyh, minmin ryte aekheih niakheih khylan na haungkheih lan khyh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E hmin kya lungtuanaw roi, lungpawnaw roi, zudy ccangvaepaw roi te akaenung liaccanung roi kha naemaw she kya, nae muihnaw kyate ka zosah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7.34</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:10">25.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:23">Bya 18.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang nynh e bya balyn hynh e ccungccaw hae kya na hopah hae zah, minmin nynh, “Pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e myarya lepaw hoyleinaw balyn hynh kaening tungvaw oun honua? Paw hoyleinaw mou kae rae? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia tungvaw paw seinaw mou kae rae?” cite nang kha he ae khia hae te, <verse number="11" style="v" />nang nynh minmin na hopya lan hae paw tuh: Nae minpaaw hae nynh kae kha yn vua hae, ccangpaw pachia hae nulang zuikute ryalawpah hae zah a beik hae, kae kha yn vua hae zah ka kawbya kha a zui khyh hae keiccu nynh thua; <verse number="12" style="v" />te nanning nynh nae minpaaw hae laeze athahhua lante na um oh zah, alungkhungpaw te ahoy leipaw nae rynaw kha zuite, ka bya ngae lan na ei oh keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning te nae minpaaw hae nynh na ny lei oh paw ram lungkhu langkhe e ram kyate kae vua cih oh, tuin ram khe ccangpaw pachia hae kha khuazi khuadae rya na lawpah cih oh, pawccecize nanning kha maehoynaw kae pya lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Israel A Kikhae Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: “Israel hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin,” cite ho vae leite, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Israel hae kha thahlang ram kyate thuasah, aning nynh a la deenaw hae ram takyh kyate thuasah a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin,” cite a honaw hae ccyh tuh yn thua ccaccing cih. Pawccecize mih minpaaw hae ka la pya hae paw mih ram langkhe minmin kha ka kikhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ngasaw a kyngtu hae patae kha ka saw cih hae zah, minmin kha a kyng cih hae; tukoute sawkawthya hae paw kha ka saw cih hae zah mua takyh, sangpyng takyh te lungpi hae laku khe minmin kha a ccung cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize ka mit nynh mih laanpi balyn kha pong a muih; ka kyate rekuh kho khyh hae zah, mih hoyleinaw kha ka muihnaw kyate thuruh kho khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh ka ram kha anungsikuhpaw mih zohtuh achih hae paw khate phe biasah hae zah, ka rho kha mih nungsikunaw khate phe a biasah hae keiccuze mih hoyleinaw te mih seinaw kha leit ning te ka liaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thawzung te ka rhawlungrua,</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw ccyh lya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khynnaw athuapaw, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan oun cceih cih hae zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae minpaaw hae nynh rho lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a la ccou hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hynbya, accakaepaw te athane leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw ccungkia leipaw nynh a la thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh amaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hae kha a raekuh kho tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhcihawpaw pachia hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia thua khyh hae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze minmin kha solei ka ccangpah cih hae, atu ka huhan te ka thungnaw kha ka nysah cih hae zah, minmin nynh ka min <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> athuapaw kha a nyh cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Seinaw te Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah seinaw kha sivaw bawpe te zei athua; mih thinlung lungphe vawlan khe daimon azuingpaw te karynte zei thua zah, mih silawhang ki hae kyakhe zei athua, <verse number="2" style="v" />ramkaw kya umpaw mua hae vawlan, ahangpaw mua dung hae vawlan te hinlalyhpaw thingku miakaw pepan kya a umpaw mih silawhang hae te Asherah khozinung tung hae kha mih ccaaw hae nynh a liathui hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ram pynpi e na seinaw mee lang na sisua te na ccakhungkupaw na uccaw balyn kha luadetu hae kalan ka pya cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na cyisahnaw keiccuze nang kae pyapaw rho kha na shung cih, na ny leipaw ram kya-e na rhaw hae hanlan rya kae lawsah cih, pawccecize ka thinria keiccuze zungzae arua cih paw maee tuh tyh athua vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw basi kha doliakuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw basi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawzung lang nungkute</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate a thinlung</para>
  <para style="q2">a maeleihkuhpaw tuh thyalaw athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning tuh laesia ram e</para>
  <para style="q2">thabu hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">bawmnaw he yn thua te mue lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning tuh ramkaw e ramrou,</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung mah a um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">loi ram kyakhe a um cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a doliakuhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hythua ccoupaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh a doliakupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning tuh tui pe lin thua zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:3">Sam 1.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">vawkhu kin atharui a sawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e thingku nynh asopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua vae ze rih lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">anaw tuh hinlalyh lan a um cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaakan kum khe a thinphang khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athae dy leite po athae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinlung tuh pawpaw balyn laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyaruhhua;</para>
  <para style="q1">thinlung tuh a ccouseikuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou thinlung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nyhthya kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ccungccaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih cyisahnaw thyhte,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sam 62.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">Bya 2.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">a cyi hae paw thyhte aphu-aphae pya khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuanaw kha ka syntawtua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thinlung kha akaw-aleih ka do.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahme leite sisua a ccakhungkuhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw atui athua leipaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungpaw vawkya pavaw hawte nynh athua;</para>
  <para style="q2">a hiinshe angankuh he athua te,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e sisua hae kha a cciataw cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athangnaw kya tuh mingaee athuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw nynh ccaekia a khan cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Athotakawnaw kyate hangthung athuapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">aphu-epaw bawitungkhung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ah beiknaw hminthyaa nynh thua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou Israel a ngaehoinaw athuapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang ae vuapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na kyate ccanglang a maeleihkuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi ccazing kya zei athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin nynh hiinnaw tuidy,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a vua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Thyaaccounaw hanlan Jeremiah Sawsang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, yn dansah lah, ka dan cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn khum lah, khum ka thua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize the ka hoysahpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Atu oun thua sah!” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh kae kha yn ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama na ryalaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tuurintu thuanaw kha ka ccuetaw boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw ccyh kha ka ry boi khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka munglae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">atoikuhpaw bya kha na nyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e bya tuh na malang khe a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hanlan ri lan umpaw lang tang nan;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh shethya ccyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khynnaw nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kae yn tuaa yn sahtu hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw mue hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw ka mue nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh mih lungroh sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungronaw ka mue nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang nynh mih tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q1">shethya kha thuasah lah khaleih roh hae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Sabbath Nin kha Thyaasah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: La cceih lah Judah siapharan hae nynh a teenaw hae te a pounaw hae Zapi Koikua kya te Jerusalem koikua balyn kyakhe thadyn lah, <verse number="20" style="v" />ccungccaw hae kha hynhte hopah hae: E koikua hae kyate na tee oh paw Judah siapharan hae, Judah hae balyn te Jerusalem a um hae paw nanning, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngaetua oh, cite hopah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae hiinnaw hanlan, nanning nynh sabbath nin kya uccaw na phu khyh nawlan oh te Jerusalem koikua kyate na teekhae khyh nawlan oh raeringkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:15-22">Neh 13.15-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Sabbath nin kya nae inn kyate uccaw toikhaekuh nan oh, pawpaw rya mah lah nan oh, nae minpaaw hae kha kaw ka pya hae thyhte, sabbath nin kha thyaasah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Exo 20.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Deu 5.12-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin nynh ngae khyh hae zah, mih nakaring tuakuh khyh hae; mih nging tokarae lan a um hae, thuiheinaw kha thae ry khyh hae zah lawkuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Nanning nynh ka bya kha ngaete, sabbath nin kya uccaw kha hynh-e khuapi koikua kyate teekhae leite na um oh zah, sabbath nin kha thyaasahte rya na law khyh oh zetuh, <verse number="25" style="v" />David bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw siapharan hae tuh marangle hae te marang hae kha ccikute, mih kuihkaw e bawi hae, Judah ccungccaw hae te Jerusalem um hae paw ryte, e khuapi koikua hae kyate a tee cih hae; e khuapi tuh zungzae atyn cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae te Jerusalem pepan e hmin hae, Benjamin ram, mua leihpaw e khua, mua vaw e khua hae te alia lang e khua ccungccaw hae tuh oun cceih cih hae zah, maee-ute silawnawpaw, silawnawpaw hae, ccathae silawnawpaw te frankinsen, lungtuanaw silawnawpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang oun ccyng cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama ka bya na ngae khyh oh zah, sabbath nin thyaasah lanpaw te sabbath nin kya Jerusalem koikua hae kyate uccaw phute teekhae lei lanpaw ka bya kha na ngae khyh oh zetuh, tuh-e khua koikua kyakhe maee ka ruasah cih; tuh-e maee nynh Jerusalem khua e siapharan inn hae kha khaleih a u cih zah, tuh-e maee tuh the thua lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ang Raetu te Anglae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw bya tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thokuh lah, ang raetu inn lang cciatua, tuin kya ka bya kha kae thaesah cih,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ang raetu inn lang ka cceih zah, ang raenawpaw a leccu te rya a lah cciamangpaw kha ka muih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Anglae te a raepaw ang tuh ang raetu kuih kya phe aro ze, tuh-e maw tuh a ry hawte ccangpaw ang lang bua a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah, <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Pou Israel phin hae, e ang raetu nynh a rae hawte nanning kha kae rae kho khyh oh tou? Pou Israel phin hae, anglae tuh ang raetu kuih kya a um hawte nanning tuh ka kuih kya nynh na um oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh kya, minphuin phuin kheit khyhze ram ramkheit kha poh ka khaee lanpaw, ka koi lanpaw te ka ro lanpaw kong kha ka ho cih, <verse number="8" style="v" />thuasalama ka honuathepaw tuh-e minphuin nynh a hoyleinaw kyate a maeku zetuh, tuh-e minphuin tungvaw thuakhae lan ka paccynpaw ronaw kong kha ka thinlung ka paleih cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ccangpaw sosoh ccyh kya, minphuin phuin kheit khyhze ram ramkheit ka rae lanpaw te ka lin lanpaw kong kha ka ho cih, <verse number="10" style="v" />thuasalama ka bya ngae leite, ka muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae zetuh, tuh-e ram tungvaw raepya lan ka paccynpaw hoynaw kong kha ka thinlung ka paleih cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, atu, Judah ccungccaw hae te Jerusalem a um hae paw kalan khe hopah hae: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Dotua, kae tuh nanning kha hoyleinaw raenua te ae paccynnuakuhpaw ang raetu nynh ka thua. Nanning balyn nynh ahoy leipaw nae laanpi kyate maeleihkuh oh lah, nae hiinzia te nae cyisahnaw kha raekuh thui oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel A Lungkhungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Ccungkianaw um khyh! Aening nynh ah paccynku oh paw kha ah zui cih oh zah, aening lu kheit cci nynh ahoy leipaw te alungkhungpaw ah rynaw thyhte ah cyih cih oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Minphuin hae kha la khiatua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Hynhcihawpaw hynh hummou a thae boi?</para>
  <para style="q2">Liaccady Israel nynh myaryamaw</para>
  <para style="q1">anungsikuhpaw uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a cyi vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon mua e lungpi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon vuiraw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a vuasya boi hae zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e mua vawlan e tui,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyaakakin lan aluapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vawkhutui hae tuh akan boi zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama ka ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn ning vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw lingkunaw kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">mynkhuhpaw kha a upya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya a zuimae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih laanpi kyakhe thykuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laanluepi kha zui leite</para>
  <para style="q2">sah leipaw laanpi kha a zui hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mih ram kha ri lan umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae a sarya hae paw lang a tangsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">A pepan a cceihpaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">siikuh hae zah, mih lu a he hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nithua lang e khisan hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha rhaw hae malang khe</para>
  <para style="q1">phiariphiarae ka nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Shethya ccyh lyakhe minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mae langsahpyaku leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ke kha ka langsapakuh cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah kha Rawsenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh, “Rang oh, Jeremiah kha rawsete khuakhankuh oh sih; ccangpahtu lang ranpibawi hae, tuanaw pyatu lang mihaw hae te Pachia bya a hotu lang profeh hae tuh a um mamin cih hae. Rang oh, Jeremiah kha bya ccungpah oh sih lah, a bya kha pawlangria nan oh sih,” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hynh pe yn kitua lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rhaw hae nynh pawmou</para>
  <para style="q2">a ho hae cipaw kha beih ngaetua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hoynaw hynh hoyleinaw tetou</para>
  <para style="q2">liaru athua cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh ka hiinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">uu nawlan laekarung a thae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tungvaw na thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">adae nawlan te</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin hanlan hoynaw byaho khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang ka thadynpaw kha liathuitua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih ccaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakannaw kalan ap hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha thaloi rhaw kalan vua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih zu hae tuh ccaawno hoi leite</para>
  <para style="q1">um hae sah lah, nomae lang tang hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">mih vawpaw hae tuh shethya keiccu</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw tung hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccangvae hae tuh rhawtuknaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te chih hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Luadetu hae kha minmin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheihmawte he na thuakhae hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih inn kya-e siaruanaw kha thae thua sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize minmin nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kyng nawlan laekarung thae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccu kaesahnaw lanpaw kaang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn syakhaw vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhzemah, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha chia lan cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a paccynkunaw hae balyn kha phe na ny.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih hoyleinaw kha ngaethya nan hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na muihnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">mih seinaw kha zosah nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na malang khe khuliakuh hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">na thinria lyakhe minmin kha cyih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tui-ung Koipaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Cceih lah, ang raetu kya-e anglae te raekuhpaw tui-ung kha la re. Piccan hae abang te a kum tangpaw ranpibawi hae abang kha kobua hae lah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Potsherd Koikua teenaw kya umpaw Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya langkhe la cceih, tuin kyakhe kae hopyapaw bya kha la ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2Si 23.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30-32">Jer 7.30-32</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:34-35">32.34-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang nynh na ho lanpaw tuh: Pou Judah siapharan hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh. Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E hmin kyahin shethya ka thua sah cih zah, tuh-e kong a thaepaw miakaw tuh a nakaring kya ringtering lan accae cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize e ccungccaw hae nynh kae kha yn vua vae hae, te mimaw, mih minpaaw hae te Judah siapharan hae nynh a la ny lei hae paw ccangpaw pachia hae kalan khe silawnaw raete, e hmin hynh a thusah hae; e hmin hynh seinaw a hoi lei hae paw chiise te phe a biasah hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />Baal kalan maee-ute silawnaw lante mih ccaaw hae kha maee te u nawlan cite Baal hanlan ahangpaw hmin kha a raepya hae, tuh-e tuh kae nynh ka hopya hae paw te kaw ka pya hae paw thua khyh, ka lungkhu a thungkuhpaw mah thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, e hmin hynh Tofeth cite thuasah, Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya cite thuasah ko thua vae leite, Chianaw accya cite ko athua ccyh yn thua ccaccing cih, <verse number="7" style="v" />E hmin kyahin Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae mih paccynkunaw kha accakaepaw lang ka tangsah cih zah, minmin kha mih rhaw hae malang khe thaloi te thuasah, minmin chia khylan a ccung hae paw kuih te thuasah ka theih cih hae. Mih rhua kha vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi vaw e loramsaw hae kalan looh lang ka pya cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />E khua hynh ri lan umpaw te a sarya hae paw khua lang ka rae cih; e khua nynh a tungpaw ronaw balyn keiccuze, a pepan po a cceihpaw miakaw nynh mih ngaeangthua cih zah a sarya cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae saw kha ka aesah cih hae, mih rhaw hae te minmin kha chia lan a ccung hae paw nynh koihlu hae zah, riathaesahte teingnaw a pya hae keiccuze mih innpaw hae saw kha a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh na cceihkheih oh paw muihnaw khe tui-ung kha na koi cih zah, <verse number="11" style="v" />hynhte na hopah cih hae: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Lukhakheit nynh ang raetu kya-e ang kha raethui kho lei lan ciate a koipya hawte, e ccungccaw hae te e khua hynh ka koi cih hae. Tofeth kyakhe uukunaw hmin a um vae lei lan ciate a uhkuh cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: E hmin kya te e hmin kya a um hae paw tungvaw khe tuhcite ka cyih cih zah, e khua hynh Tofeth hawte ka thuasah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem e inn hae te Judah siapharan hae mih inn hae tuh Tofeth hmin hawte thusah athua cih hae—innccuvaw miakaw khe vaawlui kya a umpaw balyn kalan silawnaw rae hae zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kalan khe niapaw silawnaw kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh profehbya ho lan a sawnaw hmin Tofeth kyate he yn thua te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn maepaw khe thadyn zah ccungccaw balyn kalan a hopya hae paw tuh: <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E khuapi te a pepan e khua hae balyn tungvaw thuakhae lan ka la hoty vae paw ronaw balyn kha atu ka thuasah vae cih, pawccecize minmin nynh ka bya kha thae ry leite mih nging tokarae lan a um hae.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pashhur nynh Jeremiah A Tuaa A Sah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh tuhcite a hopaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn uktu lupi athuapaw Immer ccapaw ranpibawi Pashhur nynh a thae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetuh Pashhur nynh Jeremiah kha a zia, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya-e palung lang e Benjamin Koikua kyakhe khii zah a nung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua khe Pashhur nynh Jeremiah kha a khiinaw kyate he a luesah te, Jeremiah nynh aning kha, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang hynh Pashhur cite min ae phu khyh, “Pawpaw kya balyn ri lan umpaw,” cite min ae phu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang hynh namaw te na ban hae balyn hanlan ri lan umpaw lang kae rae cih; na muihnaw ccaccei khe minmin tuh mih rhaw hae thaloi khate a khuliakuh cih hae. Judah ram balyn hynh Babilon siapharan kuih kalan ka pya cih; aning nynh minmin kha Babilon lang see lang a cciakhae cih hae zah thaloi te a theih cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />E khuapi lungkhu e sisua balyn thuasah, a mue hae paw uccaw balyn thuasah, aphutepaw mih hoirumnaw balyn thuasah, Judah siapharan kya-e sisua balyn thuasah mih rhaw hae kuih kalan ka pya cih hae zah, minmin kha a luade cih hae, a kyng cih hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Namaw Pashhur te na inn umpaw balyn tuh ae kyng cih oh zah, Babilon lang na cceih cih oh; namaw te ahme leipaw profehbya na hopya hae paw na ban hae balyn tuh tuin kya na chih cih oh zah, tuin kya maw ae uh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Tuaasahtu hae tungvaw Seibenaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae hynh nae soih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh soih ka thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae laeze na thunghua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae tae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae hynh anin ninlang</para>
  <para style="q2">nuinsepaw lang yn mang hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw miakaw nynh yn sarya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bya ka ho takyhte, ka siabia zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Puathonaw te ronaw!” cite ka sia cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">anin ninlang theihryaku nawlan te</para>
  <para style="q2">dothatheihku nawlan nynh a tang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ho vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a min te bya ka ho vae</para>
  <para style="q2">lan khyh,” cite ka ci lanze,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ru kya te ka lungkhu kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">aruapaw maee hawte phang a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sungkuh kho khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka umkhaekuh kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">byaru a hoku hae paw kha ka thae:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawpaw kya balyn rinaw a um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Amaw kha seibe oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Amaw kha seibe oh sih!” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae mungkuh huapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ruiban hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thy ka pawkuh lanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phang yn buh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Aning kha soih kho athua vosi,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha tae khote,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah liaru kho oh vema,” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ri lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawthungpaw hawte kae kha yn umkhae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze kae yn tuaa yn sahtu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thy a pawkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">taenaw mue lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih laan mih sui a ua khyh keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya mih maethah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Azo kho leipaw mih thethyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">papin ning kho um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, miding hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na syntawtua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung te tuanaw kha na ny;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka byathan kha phe kae ap vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">de na tah hae paw kha beih yn muihsah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlawsah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize anyaa hae paw hiinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw a rae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">kuih kyate a luesah hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka pui nin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalaw thua sah!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.14-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-19">Job 3.1-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Ka nung nynh yn saahku nin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw ccou nan sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na ccaaw a pui vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccapise nynh thua,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">apang kha hopah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya a lungtuasahtu pisepaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalaw thua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e pisepaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsah leite</para>
  <para style="q2">a vuapaw khuapi hae hawte thua vae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh awkhua takaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruanaw roi kha thae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ninthuccynglyn khe raeringnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pyanawpaw roi kha thae vae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />pawccecize aning nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nung vue lungkhu khe yn la theih khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">yn la chia ze, ka nung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka shawku a la thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a vue kyakhe po yn poi cih paw.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thawbangnaw te ngaethyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">teing khylan te maethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka hiin ccyh kha liasah khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou ka nung vue kyate ka la pui.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem A Law</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah Siapharan nynh Malkhiah ccapaw Pashhur te Maseiah ccapaw ranpibawi Zefaniah kha Jeremiah kalan saw hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh rhaw oun tuk keiccuze aning nynh kaening kyate nulang a ki nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh leih a cyimae hawte, ngaeangnaw kha kaening elang poh oun raepah kho vema; tukeiccuze thawccinaw te kaening ccelang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha oun khiapya tua,” a cipya lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2Si 25.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2Sh 36.17-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh minmin kha hopah hae zah: <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning nynh Zedekiah kha la hopah oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Khualungrua atolang te nanning ae koihlu oh paw Babilon siapharan te Khaldi hae kha rhaw na tuknaw oh paw te nae kuih kya a umpaw rhaw zunghe hae kha nae tungvaw ka ccawsah cih; khah-e hae kha e khuapi ngaelung langkhe pynkheihlan ka teekhae cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei nynh athungpaw kuih, dyngpaw kuih te nang kha thinria, bungpaw, thinsote rhaw kae tuk cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />E khuapi lungkhu a um hae paw ccungccaw te sahiinpaw hae kha ka theih cih hae; myarya ccihpaw shethya te a chih cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute shethya, thaloi te ccakan kyate lue hae zah, a hiinhy hae paw Judah Siapharan Zedekiah te a ryalahtu hae te khuapi kya a um hae paw kha Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kuih kya, mih rhaw hae kuih kya te minmin chia a ry hae paw kuih kyakhe ka pya cih hae. Aning nynh thaloi te a theih cih hae; minmin tungvaw ngaethyaumsahnaw, thawccinaw hoi leite haang lan khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te, e ccungccaw hae kya na hopya lan hae paw tuh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, Ngae oh, hiinnaw laanpi te chinaw laanpi kha nae malang kae nungpya oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />E khuapi kya a um hae paw tuh thaloi, ccakan te shethya khate a chih cih hae; thuasalama khuapi atolang toikuh zah, nanning ae koihlu oh paw Khaldi hae kya a pyakuh hae paw tuh a hiin cih hae; rhawtuknaw kyate muepaw lasung hawte mih hiinnaw kha a mue cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: E khua hynh hoynaw hanlan thua leite hoyleinaw hanlan ka mae ka hawinua vae. Babilon siapharan kuih kalan pya athua cih zah, aning nynh maee te a soi cih, a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Phin kalan Thaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah siapharan phin kalan hopya tua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngae oh, <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou David phin! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nin takyhte byading te byapia oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">luadenaw a teingpaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahtu hae kuih kyate luesah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhkhyhze tuh, ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nae cyisahnaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw tuh maee hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">athua cih zah arua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah the kho thua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou accya kya umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou bialae kya umpaw lungpi,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae rawse cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nynh, “Hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">aening kya-e khynnaw hmin kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">oun teenua kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hum nynh mou aening umnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkhu lang oun teenua kho cih?” na ci oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae cyisahnaw athae thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">de kae tah cih oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae loram kha maee te ka soi cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a pepan umpaw balyn kha pong a u cih.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ngaesiku lan Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang nynh Judah siapharan inn lang la cceih lah, e bya hynh la hopah hae: <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou David bawitungkhung kya a haungpaw Judah Siapharan, nang, na ryalahtu hae te e koikua kya a tee hae paw na ccungccaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Byading te dingnaw khate ryalah oh lah, luadenaw a teingpaw kha tuaasahtu hae kuih kyate luesah oh. Te ramccang ccungccaw, ngawraw te nomae hae tungvaw cyihsei nan oh lah, puatho nan oh, e hmin kya seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise kha luasah nan oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh e bya hynh na zui oh zetuh, David bawitungkhung kya a haung hae paw, marangle te marang hae kha a ccikuh hae paw siapharan hae nynh mimaw, mih ryalahtu hae te mih ccungccaw hae ryte e inn thuakaw hae kya a tee cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama e bya hae hynh pawlang na ria khyh oh zetuh, e inn hynh ccungccaw phe adae cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kamaw min phyakute bya ka kinku, a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:38">Mat 23.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:35">Luk 13.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah siapharan inn te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Gilead hawte na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Lebanon mua dung hawte nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama laesia ram,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw a um leinaw khuapi lang</para>
  <para style="q2">kae rae cih, cite bya ka kinku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang kha rawse khylan rohtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih zunghe balyn ryte ka paccyn cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy huaccepaw na sidar ku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nge cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee lungkhu lang a phung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te minphuin patae nynh e khuapi pe a cceih cih hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khuh-e myarya lepaw khuapi khuh pawccemou khuhte a cyi?” cite a hokuh cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />“Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia byakinnaw kha vua hae zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha beikte rya a lawpya hae keiccu nynh thua,” cite a khungru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chihpaw Josiah Siapharan hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya rawkhuite um nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhlaeze ccanglang ccaring</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihpaw hanlan kha rah oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize aning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a puinaw ram kha muih khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">kithui vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josiah Ccapaw hae kalan Thaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A paaw Josiah rya kha ranoih lah zah, e hmin kyate ccanglang ccaring a cceihpaw, Judah Siapharan Josiah ccapaw Shallum te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Shallum tuh e ram lang kithui vae lan khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:31-34">2Si 23.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:1-4">2Sh 36.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />rhaw hae nynh kyng hae zah a cciakhaenaw hae ram kyakhe a chih cih zah, e ram hynh kharouh muihthui vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A inn kha dingleinaw te sak zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a inn avawlan khaan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">atazae leite a saktupaw aning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh a innpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">alakawte ryalawsah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ryalaw mee pya khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />aning nynh, “Akopaw avawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khaan a umpaw inn myarya lepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sakkuh cih,” ci zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thanlan-aw kha uasah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">sidar thing te a rae koute</para>
  <para style="q2">asepaw si kha a thuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sidar thing te kou hoy lan</para>
  <para style="q2">na sakku keiccu tou</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan lang na tang?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na paaw tuh phe byn lan ae zah neih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">byading te dingnaw te rya a lah khaw?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tukeiccuze aning hanlan hoynaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh ryachi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">anyaa hae paw byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyte bya a piapya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze hoynaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh kae yn ny keiccu thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama na mit te na thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">atazae leite muenaw kya rou khe um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise luasahnaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw te puathonaw rou kha na tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Judah siapharan Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim Siapharan te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ezou, ka upaw! Ezou ka ccianung!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2Si 23.36—24.6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">cite rawhui lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning hanlan, “Ezou, bawipaw!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ezou, a lesaenaw khalou!”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite rah lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lann kha a uu hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha a uh cih hae—</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem koikua khunglang</para>
  <para style="q2">a sue cih hae zah a vua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon langkhe kaethung oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">siatua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Bashan kyakhe nae roi kha sawtua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Abarim kyate siatua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize na ruiban hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ro athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na khosah a um lya kae hopya zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ka ngae lan khyh,” nae cipya.</para>
  <para style="q1">E ozia hynh na di lya mawte na hoipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thua zah, ka bya na ngae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang ae do-oihpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan nynh a mung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ruiban hae kha a kyng cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh na hoyleinaw balyn keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">na maethah cih zah na lungroh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pou Lebanon kya a um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Sidar ku hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">bu a sakkuh hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung nynh neitangia a teing hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngesaw ccinaw kha he na teing oh te,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawcih baban mou na hawkhaekuh cih oh!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Koniah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koniah ci zemah kyh zah Jehoiakhin ci zemah akyh.</char></note> tungvaw Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Judah siapharan Jehoiakim ccapaw Koniah Siapharan tuh ka ranglang kuih kya-e tazeih kuihpu na thua zemah, kae tuh ka hiin thyhte nang kha thoh kae pae cih zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:8-15">2Si 24.8-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2Sh 36.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />nang kha chia ae ry hae paw kuih kalan, na ri hae paw kuih kalan, Nebukhadnezzar Siapharan te Khaldi hae kuih kalan kae pya cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang te na nung kha nae puinaw ram athua leipaw ramccang langkhe kae vua cih oh zah, tuin kya na chih cih oh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Minmin nynh kithui a rynaw hae ram lang kithui lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E ccungccapaw Koniah hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a dothatheih hae paw anglohpaekua,</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah a ry leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw khaw athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Amaw te a ciihan hae kha minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a la ny boi lei hae paw ram langkhe</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccemou dee thua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athua hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou ram, ram, ram,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw hynh ngaetua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">E ccungccapaw hynh ccaawno</para>
  <para style="q1">a hoi leipaw cite thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a she lungkhu a laan a sui</para>
  <para style="q1">a ua cih leipaw cite thuasah zeitua;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize a ciihan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">David bawitungkhung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">haung vae lan khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah ram hynh ukthui vae lan khyh hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ramccang lang Deeku koute Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ka ramnonaw kya-e ka tuu hae kha phiariphiarae nung hae zah a roh hae paw tuurin hae hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccungccaw hae kha a rintu hae tuurin hae te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh ka tuuphu hae kha phiariphiarae na nung oh zah, ccanglang ccaring na dee oh, minmin kha hoyte na do-oih khyh oh. Tukeiccuze ahoy leipaw nae cyisahnaw hanlan de kae tah cih oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te minmin ka deenaw hae ram balyn kyate ka tuuphu kya-e a laehy hae paw kha ka suelua cih hae zah, mih tuukhia langkhe ka kikhae cih hae, te a pungzae cih hae zah a lungthung cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin a rin cih hae paw tuurin hae kha ka nungpah cih hae zah, rinaw, siikunaw te zonaw papin tung vae lan khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Adingpaw David Ciihan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: David hanlan adingpaw Ciihan kha he ka langsakuh te, aning nynh hawnaw te a ukpaw siapharan hawte a uk cih zah, ram lungkhu kya byading te dingnaw kha a rae ccyh tuh solei yn thua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:14-16">Jer 33.14-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning ccyh kyakhe Judah tuh khum athua cih zah, Israel tuh khyndadyh lan a um cih. A min kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening dingnaw nynh thua,” cite ko athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: “Israel hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin,” cite ho lei vae te, <verse number="8" style="v" />“Palung lang e ram kyate thuasah, aning nynh minmin a deenaw hae ram balyn kyate thuasah Israel phin hae kha poukhae hae zah a cciakhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin,” cite a ho ccyh hae tuh solei yn thua cih. Tetuh mih ram kyakhe a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Lingthya Profeh hae Seisahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Profeh hae te asekuh lante:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka lungkhu kya ka thinlung phe koi zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ru hae balyn tuh a thyngkuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> keiccu thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw a bya keiccu thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh aruipaw hawte ka thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misutui nynh a taepaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize ram tuh nopi pise</para>
  <para style="q2">ohhuakunaw te phe abeih;</para>
  <para style="q1">thyalawnaw keiccuze ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw e ramnonaw hae tuh karae arou.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih laanpi tuh hoyleinaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thungnaw tuh ahme leipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Profeh hae te ranpibawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">parouh mawte Pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q1">pawlangria khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka inn kya heize</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoyleinaw kha ka muih vae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih laanpi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kya-e nawpalaepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi hawte nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e laanpi langkhe</para>
  <para style="q1">dee athua cih hae zah a khuliakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize minmin detah kum khe</para>
  <para style="q1">mih tungvaw shethya ka thuasah cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria ram e profeh hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw uccaw kha ka muih:</para>
  <para style="q1">Baal min liate profehbya ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhaesei hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem profeh hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">siiku lan a um huapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw kha ka muih vae:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Gen 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:49">Eze 16.49</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">nopi pise ohhuakunaw rae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a hyn a hu hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw a rae hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit nynh sanmah hoyleinaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a maeleihku khyh nawlan hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung a pya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte kae ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">Sodom khua hawte thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Gomorrah khua hawte nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e profeh hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">asekuh lante vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Minmin kha eccangkary</para>
  <para style="q2">ka aesah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">chi sii thungkuhpaw tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka niasah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize Pachia pawlangria leinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem profeh hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ram pynpi kya a pazaekuh vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning kya profehbya a ho hae paw profeh hae bya kha ngae nan oh; minmin nynh nanning kha ae ling oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khalang kyate apou leipaw, mih tuanaw kya-e vizin kha ae hopya oh. <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya pawlangria lei hae paw kalan khe, “Nae kya hoynaw a um cih,” a cipya hae; mih lungkhung thyhte a um hae paw kyakhe, “Nae tungvaw shethya thua lan khyh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin lakuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">muih khylan te thae khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khuakhannaw kya hummou a umbua?</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya phy khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a bya kha a peki?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khise khuh dotua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Thinrianaw tuh apou,</para>
  <para style="q1">athawsaepaw khiccung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hoylei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu vawlan khe thawte a khia cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a tuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccingsah te a thangsah mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw tuh dae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nyalang ccyh kya nanning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaerarih lan nae thaethya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kae nynh ka saw lei hae pite</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh hae tuh a ccue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae nynh ka hopah lei hae pite</para>
  <para style="q2">profehbya kha a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama ka khuakhannaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a thadyn hae lanze,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya kha a ho cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy leipaw mih laanpi kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw mih cyisahnaw kyate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">a maeleihsakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kae tuh anaenaw kyalya a umpaw Pachia tou ka thua? Asawnaw kya mah a umpaw Pachia ka thua khyh tou? <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka muih kho lei lan ciate muih leinaw kya a rekuh khopaw hummou a um? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Vaaw te lae kya pong ka um khyh tou? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />“Maan ka sah vae, maan ka sah vae!” cite ka min te hynbya a ho hae paw profeh hae bya kha ka thae vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Hynbya a ho hae paw te mih thinlung kya-e lingnaw bya a ho hae paw e profeh hae thinlung hynh hohseciamou paleihku leite a um cih? <verse number="27" style="v" />Mih minpaaw hae nynh Baal keiccuze ka min kha a ning hae hawte, lu kheit te lu kheit a hoku hae paw mih maan khate ka ccungccaw hae nynh ka min kha ning hae sah cite a paccyn hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Maan a sahpaw profeh nynh a maan kha ho sah, thuasalama ka bya a hoipaw nynh ka bya kha lungzite ho sah. Ccatanphue tuh chanvuih te pawmou asekuh? cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka bya tuh maee te lokuh khyh tou? Lung kha zoihtatyh lan a koisahpaw khynlyng te lokuh khyh tou? <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lu kheit te lu kheit ka bya a rupakuh hae paw profeh hae kha ka rawse hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Mimaw munglae nynh a hopaw bya kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho,” cite a hothya hae paw profeh hae kha ka rawse hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Hynhupaw maan kha ho hae zah, hynbya te accakaepaw mih bya khate ka ccungccaw hae kha a cciakhaesei hae paw profeh hae kha ka rawse hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; minmin kha ka saw khyh hae, ryalaw mah ka naw khyh hae; tukeiccuze minmin tuh e ccungccaw hae hanlan papin thane khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae nynh thuasah, profeh nynh thuasah, ranpibawi nynh thuasah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw tuh pawmou athua?” cite ae khia hae ze, minmin kha, “Nanning hynh phupaw ripaw na thua oh zah, ccaring kae vua cih oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci,” cipaw kha na hopah cih hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Profeh nynh thuasah, ranpibawi nynh thuasah, e ccungccaw hae laku e lukhakheit nynh thuasah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw nynh thua,” cite a ho lanze, amaw te a innbyn kha de ka tah cih hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Naemaw lu kheit te lu kheit laku kya, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawtemou bya a khungru?” tuhkhyhze, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawtemou a ho?” cite bya na khiakuh cih oh. <verse number="36" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw,” cite na ho vae lan khyh oh, pawccecize tuhte bya a hopaw tuh amaw hanlan phupaw ripaw athua ccaccing cih, tuhte na ho oh ze, a hiinpaw Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ah Pachia bya kha na ro vae oh. <verse number="37" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawtemou ae khungru?” tuhkhyhze “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawtemou a ho?” cite profeh kha na khia cih. <verse number="38" style="v" />Thuasalama, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw,” cite na ho oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw,” cite na ho lan khyh oh, mang kae cipah oh pite, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e phupaw ripaw,” cite na ho oh keiccuze, <verse number="39" style="v" />kae hang ccaccing cih oh zah, naemaw kha thuasah, nanning te nae minpaaw hae kae pya oh paw khuapi kha thuasah ka kyate ccaring kae vua cih oh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Ning kho ung leipaw zungzae thethyanaw te zungzae maethyanaw kha nae tungvaw ka ccawsah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahoypaw te Athahpaw Thaeku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh beikinn malang a nung hae paw thaeku sua ning kha yn muihsah. E hynh Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem kyate Babilon lang Jehoiakim ccapaw Judah Siapharan Jekoniah ryte Judah ram e bawi hae, kuihhae hoy hae paw, te sivaw a suh hae paw kha a cciakhae kou hae te nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">2Si 24.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Sua suakheit kya tuh avoi typaw thaeku hawte myarya hoypaw thaeku a um, thuasalama ccangpaw sua suakheit kya tuh ae kho lei lan ciate myarya nyaapaw thaeku a um. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Jeremiah, pawmou na muih?” cite yn khia. Kae nynh, “Thaeku hae kha ka muih, ahoypaw thaeku hae tuh myarya hoy zah, anyaapaw thaeku hae tuh ae kho lei lan ciate myarya anyaa,” cite ka hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: E hmin kyate Khaldi ram lang ka saw hae paw, Judah ram kyate ramccang lang a kyng hae paw Judah hae kha, e ahoypaw thaeku lang ka ria cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Mih tungvaw hoynaw rae khylan riri ka do cih hae zah, e ram lang bua ka kikhae cih hae. Minmin kha ka sak cih hae zah ka phou lan khyh hae, ka lin cih hae zah ka khaee lan khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuanaw kha nynaw thinlung ka pya cih hae; minmin tuh ka ccungccaw athua cih hae zah, kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih, pawccecize mih thinlung balyn te ka kalan oun kithui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Judah Siapharan Zedekiah, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, e ram kya a laehy hae paw Jerusalem kya ahiinhy hae paw te Izip ram kya a um hae paw kha ae kho lei lan ciate myarya anyaapaw thaeku hawte, ka rae cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin tuh laephi vaw e ram hae hanlan ri lan a umpaw, ahoy leipaw uccaw lang ka rae cih hae—ka dee cihnaw hae hmin takyh kyakhe a thethahpaw, tousenawpaw, a sarya hae paw te thya a law hae paw lang ka rae cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te minmin te mih minpaaw hae kalan ka pya hae paw ram kyate khah-e hae kha khaleih ro athua mawlaezung hae, thaloi, ccakan te shethya kha ka sawnua cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon nynh Kyngkunaw Hotybya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw, Jehoiakim tuh Judah Siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw kum khe Judah hae balyn te asekuh lante Jeremiah kya bya yn thua, (tuh-e tuh Nebukhadnezzar Siapharan nynh Babilon siapharan lang a tangnaw masaty kum nynh thua),<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">2Si 24.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />profeh Jeremiah nynh Judah hae balyn te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn kalan a hopya hae paw tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon ccapaw Josiah nynh Judah Siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae thumnaw kyate atunin cia, kum kuin lae thum lungkhu, ka kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha nae kalan apaekuh lei lan kae hopya oh, thuasalama na ngae khyh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae balyn kha nae kalan apaekuh lei lan ae sawpya oh zemah, na ngae khyh oh, thae khylan nae nakaring mah na tuakuh khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e profeh hae nynh, “Nanning balyn nynh ahoy leipaw nae laanpi te ahoy leipaw nae cyisahnaw kyate oun maeleihkuh oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning te nae minpaaw hae kalan langmawlya te zungzae hanlan ae pya oh paw ram kyakhe na um cih oh; <verse number="6" style="v" />ccangpaw pachia hae kha ryalawpya khylan te beik khylan zui nan oh, te nae kuih ryalawnaw khate ka thin yn riasah nan oh. Tuhteze tuh vawsawnaw kae pya lan khyh oh,” cite ae hopya oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama ka bya na ngae khyh oh, naemaw toulou vawsaw pyaku khylan nae kuih ryalawnaw khate ka thin nae riasah oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh ka bya na ngae khyh oh keiccuze, <verse number="9" style="v" />thahlang e minphuin hae balyn te ka ryalahtu Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha heize ka sawnua cih hae, te e ram te a lungkhu um hae paw, te a pepan umpaw minphuin hae balyn kha dou khylan ka konua cih hae, minmin kha khaleih ka roh cih hae zah, ri lan a umpaw te saryanaw roi a sawnua hae paw te zungzae a thethahpaw lang ka rae cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te minmin kyakhe lungtuanaw roi, lungpawnaw roi, zudy ccangvaepaw roi, akaenung liaccanung roi, sungsuhpaw roi te maeekhua awnaw kha ka zosah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7.34</ref>, <ref loc="JER 16:9">16.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:22-23">Bya 18.22-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />E ram pynpi tuh arohpaw te ccungkia leipaw ram lang a tang cih zah, e minphuin hae balyn nynh Babilon siapharan kha kum sung sari lungkhu rya a lawpah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:21">2Sh 36.21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">Jer 29.10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dan 9.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Te kum sung sari accing koute Babilon siapharan te a ram athuapaw Khaldi hae ram kha mih hoyleinaw keiccuze de ka tah cih hae zah, ram tuh zungzae ccungkia leipaw ram lang ka rae cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon ram ka honua vae paw bya balyn, e ccauh kya zeikuhpaw balyn, te Jeremiah nynh e minphuin hae balyn rawsete a honua hae paw kha Babilon ram kya ka ccawsah cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minphuin patae te alesaepaw siapharan hae nynh Babilon hae kha see lang a mangru cih hae; mih cyisahnaw te mih kuih ryalawnaw thyhte ka liaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Thinrianaw Banang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: E thinrianaw misutui banang hynh ka kuih kyate lawtua, te nang kae sawnaw minphuin hae kha niasah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin kalan ka sawnua hae paw thaloi keiccuze minmin nynh a neih cih hae zah ruite tangkitangkae lante a cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kyate banang kha ka lah zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn sawnaw minphuin hae balyn kha ka niasah hae: <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh: Jerusalem te Judah ram e khua hae, mih siapharan hae te mih bawi hae nynh thua hae; atunin a um hae hawte, minmin kha ccungccaw adaenaw te alakawpaw, saryanaw roi sawnuapaw te thyalawnawpaw lang ka rae cih hae; <verse number="19" style="v" />Izip siapharan Faro, a ryalahtu hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae te a ccungccaw hae balyn; <verse number="20" style="v" />apykuhpaw minphuin hae balyn; Uz ram e siapharan hae balyn; Filistin ram e siapharan hae balyn—Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron te Ashdod khua kya a laehy hae paw; <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom, Moab te Ammon hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />Tair siapharan hae, Sidon siapharan hae, rili khunglang e siapharan hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan, Tema te Buz ram e ccungccaw hae, mih nakalia e sang a ngokuh hae paw balyn; <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia ram e siapharan hae balyn te laesia ram a um hae paw a pykuh hae paw minphuin hae kya-e siapharan hae; <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri siapharan hae balyn, Elam siapharan hae balyn, te Media siapharan hae balyn; <verse number="26" style="v" />thahlang e siapharan hae balyn, anaenaw e ry, asawnaw e ryte, lu kheit koute lu kheit, laephi vawlan e peenaw balyn nynh a neih cih hae. Tuh-e hae koute Sheshach siapharan nynh a neih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning kalan kae sawnua cih oh paw thaloi keiccuze neih oh, rui oh lah luaphukuh oh, khuliakuh oh lah thokuh lae nan vae oh, a ci cite na hopah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin nynh na kuih kya-e banang kha nia lan a mya hae ze, hynhte na hopah cih hae: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Na neih hahe cih oh! <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka min te kopaw khuapi kyakhe shethya kha masaty ka thuasah vae cih zah, nanning nynh detahnaw kha pawtemou na sibia kho cih oh? Detahnaw teing leite na um lan khyh oh, pawccecize laephi vaw e ccungccaw balyn kha rawsete thaloi kha ka ko vae cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">profehbya na ho cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na thaesah lan hae paw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ahangnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">yn sia cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw a umnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">a roi a saw cih; a tuuphu kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thawte a sianua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae a nontu hae hawte a sia cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vaw a um hae paw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a sianua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Laephi adianaw cia roi accae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">ho lanpaw byathan a hoi;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn kha byapianaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sei hae paw kha chia khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi kalan a ap cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Shethya tuh ram kheit kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kheit kalan a pazaekuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi asaw huanaw akin-akae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya rupaw khise atho cih!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuin nin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a chia hae paw tuh laephi adianaw voikheit langte voikheit lang cia a pazaekuh cih hae. Minmin kha rawhui lan khyh hae, suelua lan khyh hae zah, uu mah uh lan khyh hae; lae vawlan khe ia hawte athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pou tuurin hae, rawkhuite siarua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pou tuuphu bawi hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">buhhaw kya toukuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nanning chianaw ccyh te</para>
  <para style="q1">deenaw ccyh yn thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">aphutepaw ang tuh ccah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a koi hawte na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuurin hae hanlan ccuenaw hmin</para>
  <para style="q2">um lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuuphu bawi hae hanlan luenaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuurin hae siaruanaw roi te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuuphu bawi hae rawkhuinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin a paeekunaw hae ram kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ropya vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">daebabi lan a umnaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ro athua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A karung a cciatawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih hawte a ccue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize arysawthahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi keiccu thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya lepaw a thinrianaw keiccu thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ram tuh ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">adaenaw ram lang a tang vae.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Beikinn kya Profehbya Honaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw, Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim nynh ram a uknaw athotakaw lyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate e bya hynh yn thua:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2Si 23.36—24.6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn voidu lungkhu khe thadyn lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya beik khylan oun thua hae paw Judah ram e khuapi hae balyn kalan khe kaw kae pyapaw bya balyn kha hopah hae; bya kaw kheit sanmah phei nan hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh a ngae cih hae zah, ahoy leipaw mih laanpi kyate poh a maeleihkuh kho hae; te ahoy leipaw mih cyisahnaw keiccuze mih tungvaw thuasah lan ka paccynpaw ronaw kong ka tuanaw kha mah poh a paleihkuh kho vema. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin kha hynhte na hopah cih hae: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae malang kae nungpya vae oh paw ka kawbya kha zui leite ka bya na ngae khyh oh zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />nae kalan abyapi lante ka saw hae paw ka ryalahtu profeh hae bya kha pawlang na ria khyh oh zetuh, <verse number="6" style="v" />e beikinn hynh Shiloh hawte ka cyih cih zah, e khuapi hynh laephi vaw e minphuin balyn hanlan thyalawpaw khua lang ka rae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Jos 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:60">Sam 78.60</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:12-14">Jer 7.12-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya a hopaw e bya hae hynh ranpibawi hae, profeh hae te ccungccaw balyn nynh a thae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te ccungccaw balyn kalan ho lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pyapaw bya balyn kha Jeremiah nynh he a ho koute, ranpibawi hae, profeh hae te ccungccaw balyn nynh Jeremiah kha kyng hae zah, “Na chih cih! <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te profehbya na ho zah, ‘E beikinn hynh Shiloh hawte athua cih, te e khuapi hynh mah ccungccaw a um lei lan ciate phe adae cih,’ na ci?” cite a cipya hae. Ccungccaw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn khe Jeremiah kha a koihlu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Judah bawi hae nynh he a thae hae te, siapharan inn kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lang cceih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e Sakoih Thawpaw teenaw kyakhe a haung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawi hae te profeh hae nynh bawi hae te ccungccaw hae balyn kyakhe, “Nae nakaring te na thae vae oh hawte, e ccungccapaw nynh e khuapi hynh rawsete profehbya a ho keiccuze chia lan accan,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh bawi hae balyn te ccungccaw hae balyn kha hopah hae zah, “E beikinn te e khuapi rawsepaw bya na thae vae oh paw balyn hynh ho khylan yn sawtupaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu nae hiinzia te nae cyisahnaw kha paleihkuh oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha ngae oh, tuhteze tuh nae tungvaw thuasah lan phe a ho vae paw ronaw kong kha a tuanaw a paleihkuh cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama kae tuh nae kuih kya nynh ka um. Ahoy te ahme cite na tua oh hawte kae hynh yn cyih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae hynh nae chia oh zetuh, naemaw te e khuapi te khuaccaaw hae tungvaw kya a sei leipaw ccungccaw chiise na thuakhae lan oh paw kha ccaerarih lan nykuh oh, pawccecize e bya balyn hynh nae nakaring kya hopya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh nae kalan yn saw ccaccing,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh bawi hae te ccungccaw balyn nynh ranpibawi hae te profeh hae kyakhe, “E ccungccapaw hynh chia lan ccan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia min te aening hynh oun hopya,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te ram lungkhu e piccan hae abang nynh thadyn hae zah, ccungccaw zapi kyakhe, <verse number="18" style="v" />“Judah Siapharan Hezekiah she lyaze profehbya a hopaw Moresheth khuapaw Mikah nynh Judah hae balyn kha hopah hae zah: ‘Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:12">Mik 3.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Zion tuh loo hawte pho athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem tuh arohpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">beikinn mua tuh ramkaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a tang cih,’ a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah Siapharan Hezekiah te Judah hae balyn nynh amaw kha a theih hae zawtou? Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw kha ngiakuh khyh tou? Minmin tungvaw thuakhae lan phe a ho vae paw ronaw kong kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a lung bua paleihkuh khyh tou? Aening nynh myarya lepaw ronaw kha ahmaw toulou tungvaw ah thuakhaeku vae cih oh!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te profehbya a hopaw ccangpaw lu kheit a um ung, aning tuh Kiriath-jearim khuapaw Shemaiah ccapaw Uriah nynh thua. Jeremiah nynh a hopaw bya te sasi alokuh lante, e khuapi te e ram hynh rawsete aning nynh profehbya kha a ho. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehoiakim te a rhawkaw hae balyn te bawi hae balyn nynh Uriah bya kha he a thae hae tuh, siapharan nynh amaw kha chia lan a ccung; tuh-e tuh Uriah nynh he a thae tuh, rih zah Izip ram lang a ccue. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh Jehoiakim Siapharan nynh Akbor ccapaw Elnathan te ccungccaw hae kha Izip ram lang a saw hae, <verse number="23" style="v" />te minmin nynh Uriah kha Izip ram kyate Jehoiakim Siapharan kalan a cciakhae hae, aning nynh Uriah kha thaloi te theih zah, a rhua kha ranzae ccungccaw a uunaw hae hmin kyakhe a vua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Jeremiah tuh chia khylan ccungccaw hae kuih kalan pya athua khyh nawlan, Shafan ccapaw Ahikam nynh a pankhae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Luasawpaw Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw, Judah Siapharan Zedekiah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ccang lante ria lanze</char><char style="fq">Jehoiakim</char></note> nynh a uknaw athotakaw lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate Jeremiah kalan e bya hynh yn thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2Si 24.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:11-13">2Sh 36.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh: Luasawkunawpaw saphuarui te lua kha raekuh lah, na nging kya luasawkuh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Judah Siapharan Zedekiah kalan Jerusalem lang oun cceih hae paw locceihtu hae kyate Edom siapharan, Moab siapharan, Ammon siapharan, Tair siapharan te Sidon siapharan kalan khe byataw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Mih bawi hae hanlan e bya hynh pya hae: Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae bawi hae kha hynhte na hopah cih oh: <verse number="5" style="v" />Alesaepaw ka huhan te ka dyngpaw ka kuih khate laephi te laephi vawlan umpaw ccungccaw te sarangpaw hae kha ka rae hae zah, ka lungrythuapaw ccungccaw miakaw kha ka pya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Atu hynh-e ram balyn hynh ka ryalahtu, Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha ka pya vae; ramkaw e loramsaw hae kha heize amaw ryalawpya khylan ka pya vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minphuin balyn nynh amaw te a ccapaw te a mintawpaw kha, a ram ccyh athang mawlaezung rya a lawpah cih hae; te minphuin patae te alesaepaw siapharan hae nynh aning kha mih seepaw lang a mangru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minphuin phuinkhakheit khyhze peenaw ccangkhakheit nynh e Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha ryalawpya leite, Babilon siapharan kya-e luasawku lan a nging a tuaku khyh lanze, tuh-e ram tuh Nebukhadnezzar kuih te khaleih ka ro mawlaezung, thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate de ka tah cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, “Babilon siapharan kha rya na lawpah lan khyh,” cite a ho hae paw nae profeh hae, apawepaw hae, maansahthya hae paw, beidinhothya hae paw te naawthya hae paw bya kha na ngae lan khyh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh nanning kha nae ram kyate asawnaw lang nue na thua nawlan oh, hynpaw profehbya kha ae hopya oh; nanning kha kae dee cih oh zah na chih cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Babilon siapharan kya-e luasawku khylan a nging tuakuh zah rya a lawpahpaw miakaw tuh, amaw ram kya loophokute a um ccaw ka cciataw cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah Siapharan Zedekiah kalan mah tuhmawte ka hopya: Babilon siapharan kya-e lua kha sawku khylan na nging tuakuh lah, amaw te a ccungccaw hae kha ryalawpyate hiintua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon siapharan kha rya a lawpah cih leipaw minphuin miakaw te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae hawte, nang te na ccungccaw hae tuh thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate pawccemou na chih cih oh? <verse number="14" style="v" />Babilon siapharan kha ryalawpya lei lante ae hopah oh paw profeh hae bya kha ngae nan oh, pawccecize minmin nynh hynhute profehbya kha ae hopya oh. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Minmin kha ka saw lei hae pite, ka min te ahme leipaw profehbya kha a ho hae, tukeiccuze naemaw te nanning kalan profehbya ae hopah oh paw profeh hae kha kae dee cih oh zah, na chih cih oh, a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawi hae te ccungccaw balyn kya ka hopya hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn e angphe hae tuh Babilon ram kyate aro maw lawthui athua cih,” cite ae hopah oh paw nae profeh hae bya kha ngae nan oh, pawccecize minmin nynh ahme leipaw profehbya kha ae hopya oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mih bya kha ngae nan oh; Babilon siapharan kha ryalawpah oh lah, na hiin cih oh. E khuapi hynh pawccemou arohpaw lang a tang cih? <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin tuh profeh thua ccaccing hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh mih kya a um lanze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya, Judah siapharan inn kya te Jerusalem kya a um ungpaw angphe hae tuh Babilon lang cciakhae athua khyh nawlan, minmin nynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha soihbiate ngia hae sah. <verse number="19-21" style="v" />Pawccecize Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jehoiakim ccapaw, Judah Siapharan Jekoniah ryte Judah te Jerusalem e asung-epaw piccan hae kha Jerusalem kyate Babilon lang he a cciakhae hae tuh, Nebukhadnezzar nynh cciakhae leite, e khuapi kya a laehypaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya, Judah siapharan inn kya te Jerusalem kya a laehypaw tung hae, tui tungnawpaw hae te a thadynnawpaw accu hae te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="22" style="v" />Khah-e angphe hae kha Babilon lang phu athua cih zah, kamaw nynh kikhae khylan ka peki mawlaezung tuin kya a um cih. Te ka kikhae cih zah, e hmin kya ka nungthui cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hananiah nynh Jeremiah A Tuaasah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh-e kum, Zedekiah nynh Judah Siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw e sawpaw sah pangawnaw khe, Gibeon khuapaw Azzur ccapaw profeh Hananiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya, ranpibawi hae te ccungccaw balyn malang khe kae kha bya yn hopah zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2Si 24.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:11-13">2Sh 36.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Babilon siapharan kya-e lua kha ka khya vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh e hmin kyate Babilon lang a cciakhaepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn e angphe balyn kha e hmin kalan kum ning lungkhu ka kikhae cih. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Jehoiakim ccapaw, Judah Siapharan Jekoniah te Judah ram kyate Babilon lang a cciakhae hae paw balyn kha e hmin kalan ka kikhae cih hae; pawccecize Babilon siapharan lua kha ka khyapah cih, a ci,” cite a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh beikinn malang a thadyn hae paw ranpibawi hae te ccungccaw balyn malang khe profeh Jeremiah nynh profeh Hananiah kha hopah zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amen! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuhcite cyih vae sah; profehbya na hopaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccingsah sah lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn e angphe hae te a cciakhae hae paw balyn kha Babilon kyate e hmin kalan kikhae vae hae sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama nang te ccungccaw balyn kya atu ka hopaw e bya hynh ngaetua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang te kae ah um maw, langmawlya e profeh hae nynh ram patae te myarya lepaw peenaw hae tungvaw rhawtuknaw, ccakanccinaw te shethya yn thua lanpaw kha a la ho hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Daenaw a um cih, cite a hopaw profeh kha tuh, a bya he accing te rou khaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a saw ccaccingpaw profeh cipaw ny athua cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh profeh Hananiah nynh profeh Jeremiah nging kya-e lua kha lah zah phe a khya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Hananiah nynh ccungccaw balyn malang khe ho zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E hawhynhte minphuin balyn nging kya sawkuhpaw Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kya-e lua kha kum ning lungkhu ka khya cih, a ci,” cite a hopya hae. Tetuh profeh Jeremiah tuh po a cceih vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Profeh Hananiah nynh profeh Jeremiah nging kya-e lua kha a khya koute sosoh aro te, Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="13" style="v" />Cceih lah, Hananiah kha hynhte hopya tua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Thing te raepaw lua, na khya vae paw ccelang sivaw te raepaw lua kha ka rae cih! <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E minphuin balyn nynh Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha rya a lawpya nawlan hae, mih nging kya sivaw lua kha ka saw hae zah, solei rya a lawpah vae cih hae; loramsaw hae kha heize amaw ka pya vae, a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te profeh Jeremiah nynh profeh Hananiah kha, “Hananiah, ngaetua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae saw lei pite, e ccungccaw hae hynh hynbya na zynsah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang hynh laephi vawlan te kae vua cih. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rawsete dounaw bya na ho keiccuze atu kum lungkhu na chih cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e kum, sawpaw sah sarinaw khe profeh Hananiah tuh a chih.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon lang Jeremiah Ccaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem kyate Babilon lang a cciakhae hae paw kya-e piccan hae, ranpibawi hae, profeh hae te ccungccaw balyn kalan khe profeh Jeremiah nynh Jerusalem khua kyate ccaw a ky hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">2Si 24.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />E hynh Jekoniah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jehoiakhin ci zemah akyh.</char></note> Siapharan te a nung, siapharan inn e bawi hae, Judah te Jerusalem cciakhaetu hae, mih kuihhae ahoy hae paw te sivawsuhthya hae paw kha Jerusalem kyate a cciakhae kou hae te a zeipaw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />E ccaw hynh Judah siapharan Zedekiah nynh Shafan ccapaw Elasah te Hilkiah ccapaw Gemariah kuih kyate Babilon lang, Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kalan a kypaw nynh thua. Tuh-e ccaw kya azeikuhpaw tuh: <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerusalem kya kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae paw balyn kha hynhte a hopya hae: <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn sakkuh oh lah, umnah oh; khokhu raekuh oh lah, apoupaw athae kha ae oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Zu dykuh oh lah, ccanung ccapaw saahkuh oh; nae ccapaw hae kha zu hoipah oh lah, nae ccanung hae kha vawpaw la hoisah oh; tuhteze tuh minmin nynh ccanung ccapaw a saah cih hae, tuin ram kya pungzae oh lah, zyabung nan oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning kae kyngsahnaw oh khuapi hoynaw elang ccung kalang oh lah, khah-e khuapi ccelang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang oh, pawccecize khah-e khuapi kya hoynaw a um liate nanning mah hoynaw na mue cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning laku um hae paw profeh hae te apawepaw hae kha lingsakuh nan oh, minmin nynh maan a sah hae paw kha mah zyn nan oh, <verse number="9" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh ka min te profehbya ae hopya oh paw kha hynbya nynh thua; minmin kha ka saw khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Babilon ram kya kum sung sari accingte kyalya nynh nae kalan kae thua cih, te bya ka kinkupaw kha kae ccingsahpah cih oh zah, e hmin kalan kae kikhae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:21">2Sh 36.21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25.11</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dan 9.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Nanning hanlan ka hoipaw paccynnaw hynh ccaerarih lan ka ny, tuh-e paccynnaw tuh nanning hanlan vawsawnaw thua leite hoynaw thua zah, ngaehoinaw a umpaw malang ccyh kha pya khylan nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kae kha nae ko oh zah ka kalan cciate saw nae sang oh ze, kae thaepah cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae ccung oh ze nae muih cih oh; nae thinlung balyn te nae ccung oh ze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Deu 4.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />kae muihsakuh cih oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Nanning kha kae kikhae cih oh zah kae deenaw oh ram balyn te hmin takyh kyate kae suelua cih oh, te kae dee oh zah na cciataw oh paw ram langkhe kae kikhae cih oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hanlan Babilon ram kya profeh oun pya vae,” na ci oh keiccuze— <verse number="16" style="v" />David bawitungkhung kya a haungpaw siapharan te thuasah, e khuapi kya a umpaw ccungccaw hae te thuasah, nanning ryte kyng hae zah ramccang lang a cciakhae bua lei hae paw nae puizia hae te thuasah asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a ho: <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin tungvaw khe thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya kha ka thuasah cih zah, ae kho lei lan ciate kharouh ahoy leipaw thaeku athuhpaw hawte ka thuasah cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin kha thaloi te, ccakanccinaw te, shethya te ka deehui cih hae zah, laephi vaw peenaw balyn khe ri lan umpaw lang ka rae cih hae, te ka deenaw hae minphuin balyn laku khe thyalawpaw, ri lan umpaw, nuinsepaw te a sarya hae paw lang ka rae cih hae, <verse number="19" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh ka bya kha ngae khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci, ka ryalahtu profeh hae kha apaekuh lei lan ka sawpya hae zemah, ka bya kha pawlangria khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Jerusalem kyate Babilon lang see lang ka kyngsah hae paw nanning balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh: <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka min te nanning kalan hynhupaw profehbya a ho hae paw Kolaiah ccapaw Ahab te Maaseiah ccapaw Zedekiah konglang te Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin kha Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kuih kalan ka ap cih hae zah, aning nynh nae muihnaw kyakhe a theih cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah ram kyate kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae paw balyn nynh, “Babilon siapharan nynh maee te a soi hae paw Zedekiah te Ahab hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae cyih vae sah,” cite minmin konglang kha thyalawkunaw kya a mang cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh Israel hae kya hoyleinaw kha rae hae zah, mih innpaw hae zu kha a seikhae vae hae, te kaw ka pya lei hae paw hynbya kha ka min te a ho hae; kae tuh a nyhtu te ccaekia nynh ka thua, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shemaiah Ccaky</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam khuapaw Shemaiah kha hynhte hopya tua: <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae, Maaseiah ccapaw ranpibawi Zefaniah te ranpibawi hae balyn kalan khe ka min te ccaw ky hae, <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei nynh ranpibawi Jehoiada ccelang nang kha ranpibawi lang ae nung vae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya bawi lepaw lan na tang cih zah, profeh nynh ka thua, a cikuh hae paw mingaee miakaw kha na kyng cih hae zah sivawrui te na khii cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nanning kya profeh rya a lahpaw Anathoth khuapaw Jeremiah kha pawccemou na thuihei khyh? <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize aning nynh Babilon kya kae umpaw kalan khe, “Accyh aro cih; inn sakkuh oh lah, umnah oh, khokhu raekuh oh lah, apoupaw athae kha ae oh,” cite ccaw oun ky.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuh-e ccaky tuh ranpibawi Zefaniah nynh profeh Jeremiah a thaenaw khe a ria. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua: <verse number="31" style="v" />Nehelam khuapaw Shemaiah konglang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Shemaiah kha ka saw lei pite, nae kya profehbya ae hopah oh zah, hynbya kha ae zynsah sei oh, <verse number="32" style="v" />tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nehelam khuapaw Shemaiah a ciihan hae kha de ka tah cih hae; aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rawsete dounaw bya a ho keiccuze ka ccungccaw hae hanlan ka raepah cih hae paw hoynaw kha muih man vae lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kikhae lan Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya: <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nang kae hopyapaw bya balyn hynh ccauh kya zeitua. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ka ccungccaw Israel hae te Judah hae kha hiin hoynaw ka pya hae ccyh tuh yn thua ccaccing cih, mih minpaaw hae ka pya hae paw ram lang ka kikhae cih hae zah, tuh-e ram tuh a ccou cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E bya hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel te Judah konglang a hopaw nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Siikunaw roi te rinaw roi kha ka thae,</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pise nynh ccaaw a poi kho tou? cite</para>
  <para style="q2">khiatua oh lah, dotua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Athua lanze, neitangia ccihpaw nopi hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">pise miakaw nynh mih tae vawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">mih kuih a khang hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou ka muih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih balynte mih mae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou dawkadae lan a um hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ezou! Tuh-e nin tuh myarya ri lan um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">touse ruapaw um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob phin hanlan lungriathae ccyh nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhzemah tuh-e kyate a lue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Tuin nin vae tuh, a nging kya-e lua kha ka khyapah cih zah, a khiinaw hae paw arui kha ka paepah cih, ramccang hae nynh ryalawsah vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia rya te minmin hanlan ka langsakuh cih paw mih siapharan David rya kha a lawpah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ka ryalahtu Jakob, rih nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:27-28">Jer 46.27-28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Israel, na bungzou nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize asawnaw langte</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae khum cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ciihan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin a kyngnaw hae ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob tuh a kithui cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengan lungdaete a um cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">rikawnaw pya vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw tuh: Nang kha khum khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">kae umkhae cih; phiariphiarae</para>
  <para style="q2">kae nungnaw oh ram balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thangsah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thangsah lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">detah leite papin kae nung lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">accan thyhte kae thuihei cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Na vaemaw tuh hoy kho vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">na teingpaw vaemaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya accih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang ae do-oih lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">na vaemaw hanlan sii um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">na hanlan dannaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang ae sungsah hae paw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ning vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha pawlang ae ria vae khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae kha thong hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae thong vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyiseinaw myarya le zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na seinaw tuh myarya alung keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawcci leite de kae tah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccemou na vaemaw keiccuze na raw?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na vaemaw tuh hoy kho vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na cyiseinaw tuh myarya le zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na seinaw tuh myarya alung keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">e uccaw hae hynh na tungvaw ka cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang ae laang hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laangru athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na rhaw hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kyng athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae luade hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">luade athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae tei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka teisahru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na rhaw hae nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athuapaw ccungccaw ae ci hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang a ria leipaw Zion!” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">ae ci vae hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ngedannaw kae pyathui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na vaemaw kha kae dansah cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob ciihan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kikhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih umnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya ka ungsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi kha a sangpyng vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">raethui athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ummaenaw khe a umthui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh thehoysahnaw roi te</para>
  <para style="q2">lungpawnaw roi kha a saw cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha ka pungzaesah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">zya lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtuanaw ka ccousah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dothatheihpaw thua lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mih ccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya hawte athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw zapi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang tynsah athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin a tuaa a sahtu hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">de ka tah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mih bawipaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw minphuin lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih uktu bawi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw laku kyate yn langkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e bawi tuh ka kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">ka naesakuh cih zah yn naekuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhkhyhze hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kalan a naekuh ngan cih?</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te nanning tuh ka ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh nae Pachia ka thua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khise khuh dotua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Thinrianaw tuh apou,</para>
  <para style="q1">athawsaepaw khiccung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hoylei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu vawlan khe thawte a khia cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a tuapaw a paccynnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccingsah mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw tuh dae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nyalang ccyh kya nanning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh nae thaethya cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lungtuate Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Tuin ccyh vae ze, kae tuh Israel phin hae balyn Pachia ka thua cih zah, minmin tuh ka ccungccaw athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi kyate a lue hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram kya thawccinaw a mue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel nynh haeungnaw he a ccung te,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh asawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kalan yn langkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sungsahnaw te kae sungsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungzi zungzae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou liaccady Israel!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang kha bua kae thadynsah thui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na tyng kha na lawkuh thui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate na lawthui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na raekuh thui cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu a raetu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">misu ku a lin cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athae kha a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Efraim mua vawlan e</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawvia hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Rang oh lah, Zion mua lang,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kalan cceih oh sih,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite a ci hae ccyh yn thua cih, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob hanlan lungtuate thawte</para>
  <para style="q2">hlawsah oh, minphuin hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">lupi athuapaw hanlan thawte sia oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw Israel hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">beih khum hae,” cite thaesah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin kha thahlang ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cciakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi asaw huaccenaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka suelua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mitmoh hae te ccukhou hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaawpoi hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">neitangia ccih hae paw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kya a umbua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lungpawte zapi hae tuh a ki cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rawkhuite a kithui cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtangnaw pyate ka kikhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">vawkhu kin, thypawku a um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi alawpaw kya ka cciasah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize kae tuh Israel hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">paaw ka thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Efraim tuh ka ccatawccaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pou minphuin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">asawnaw rili khunglang e</para>
  <para style="q2">ram hae kyakhe phytua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Israel kha phiariphiarae a nungtupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">bua a sueluathui cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuurinpaw nynh tuuphu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a do-oih hawte a do-oih cih,” cite ho oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob kha a shawkhaw vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw laeze myaryamaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athung huapaw kuih kyate a khum vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh oun cceih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion mua dung khe thawte</para>
  <para style="q1">hlaw a sah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a pya hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">hoynaw, ccathae, misutui, chitui,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuuphu te vaetua phu kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">ataw hae khate mih lungrythuakhaekuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hiinnaw tuh tui abukuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">khokhu hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">papin zo vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh liaccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate a law cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangvae hae te ataw vae hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungpaw cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih rawnaw kha lungtuanaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka paleih cih zah, lungtangnaw ka pya cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethyanaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw kha ka pya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kha thobaleih lan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nung cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hoynaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungryachikhaekuh cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Gen 35.16-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:18">Mat 2.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Ramah khua kya rawkhuinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">cciteccih lan</para>
  <para style="q2">rawnaw roi kha thae athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Rachel tuh a ccaaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">a um lei vae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">soihbiaku ry vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Na rawpaw hynh ngae ccavae lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na mitphi lua nan vae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize na ryalaw mee lasung a um,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh rhaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kyate a ki cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na malang ccyh hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaehoinaw a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccaaw hae tuh mih ram lang a ki cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Efraim nynh yn ngianawpaw bya ka thaepaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae tuh akiakuh leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaetuataw te nynh kae loku;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha nae thuihei zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thuiheinaw kha ka lawku vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae hynh beih yn kikhae,</para>
  <para style="q2">beih yn kisah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccanglang ka cceihsei koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ngaesikuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae hynh akaw-aleih</para>
  <para style="q2">phe nae muih koute,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka phae kha ka tukuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka di lya thethyanaw ka mue keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka maethah zah, ka lungroh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim tuh ka sungsahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccapaw athua tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka lungrythuapaw ccaaw athua tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Amaw konglang ka ho takyh vae ze</para>
  <para style="q2">palei ka liathui ung.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tukeiccuze ka thinlung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngae ccaccing zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a tungvaw thawccinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hoi ccaccing cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Laanpi kya syntawnawpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bingkuh lah, nynawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tung hae kha bingkuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccianawpaw laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou liaccady Israel, ki ccavae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na khuapi hae kalan ki ccavae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pou alungzi leipaw ccanung,</para>
  <para style="q2">hohseciamou rarymamaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na um ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw thawpaw kha a rae vae:</para>
  <para style="q1">nopi tuh pise hawte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minmin kha he ka kikhae hae te, Judah ram kya te a khuapi hae kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou dingnaw a umnaw hmin,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou athyaapaw mua,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua ae pya!”</para>
  <para style="q2">cikuhpaw bya hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheit bua a ho cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Judah ram te a khua hae balyn, loopho hae te mih tuuphu hae ryte a khiavuikuh hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh a umkheih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thawbang hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih vue ka sosah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawthang hae paw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung ka pyathui cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh ka thokuh zah ka do, ka i liate ka thawzung atoihthui.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lu Raveihte asekuhpaw Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Judah ram te Israel ram kya ccungccaw ciihan te sahiin ciihan ka saw ccyh tuh solei yn thua cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin kha poh khaeete khya khylan, vua khylan, ro khylan te hoyleinaw thuakhaepya khylan phang ka la rin hae hawte, minmin kha lin khylan te sak khylan phang ka rin cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh minmin nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nungpaaw hae nynh ariapaw misu thae kha ae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw hae mih hawzaw,” cite ho vae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:2">Eze 18.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn tuh mimaw seinaw keiccuze a chih cih hae; ariapaw misu thae a aepaw miakaw tuh a haw azaw cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Israel phin te Judah phin hae ryte byakinnaw thawpaw kae rae ccyh tuh solei yn thua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:28">Mat 26.28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:24">Mar 14.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luk 22.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:25">1Ko 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:6">2Ko 3.6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.31-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:8-12">Heb 8.8-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh mih minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate mih kuih te suete ka poukhae lya hae ze, ka raepaw byakinnaw te lokuh lan khyh. Mih vawpaw hawte ka la thua zemah, minmin nynh tuh-e byakinnaw kha a ro hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuh-e nin hae koute Israel phin kya ka rae lanpaw byakinnaw tuh hynhte nynh athua: Ka phunglang kha mih lungkhu kya ka nung cih zah, mih thinlung kya ka zei cih; te kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih zah, minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:16">Heb 10.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nytua,” cite lu kheit te lu kheit ccangpyakute hopakuh vae lan khyh hae, pawccecize adih huaccepaw kyate ale huaccepaw kyacia mih balynte kae kha yn nyh vae cih hae; mih hoyleinaw kha ka ngaethya cih hae zah, mih seinaw kha ka liathui vae lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:17">Heb 10.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ninthu awnaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin kha umsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuazi awnaw hanlan sawpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">awsi hae kha ccynmamyh lan</para>
  <para style="q1">a synriatupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">rili tuileih accae ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q1">rili tui a thesakuhtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a min vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> acihkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />E ka synria hae paw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang te azo hae zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel ciihan mah minphuin</para>
  <para style="q2">phuin kheit athuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka malang te zungzae azo cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Luki lang e vaawlui kha tou kho thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaw lang e laephi athonaw</para>
  <para style="q1">aleihpaw kha akaw-aleih</para>
  <para style="q2">nythya kho athua zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel ciihan balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih cyisahnaw balyn keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka vua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem A Lethung cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Hananel innhangpaw kyate Apaki Koikua kyacia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang khuapi tuh raethui athua ccyh tuh yn thua ccaccing cih. <verse number="39" style="v" />A ramri tuh niccaw lang e Gareb sangpyng cia lawbabin lan athua cih, te a maeleihkuh cih zah Goah cia athua cih. <verse number="40" style="v" />Michi rhua te buhhaw a vuanaw hae accya balyn, te Kidron Vaw kyacia a umpaw loo balyn, nithua lang e Marang Koikua apaki cia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan thyaasah athua cih. Khuapi tuh papinmaw ro thua vae lan khyh zah, vua thua vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Loo A Re</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae taryanaw, Zedekiah Siapharan nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum hawnaw khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya a thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">2Si 25.1-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh lya tuh Babilon siapharan a rhawkaw hae nynh Jerusalem kha a koihlu hae, profeh Jeremiah tuh Judah siapharan inn rhawviatu hae inn voidu lungkhu khe thong a ccaw lya nynh thua, <verse number="3" style="v" />tuin kyakhe Judah Siapharan Zedekiah nynh Jeremiah kha thong a saw. Zedekiah nynh Jeremiah kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘E khuapi hynh Babilon siapharan kuih kalan ka pya cih zah, a lah cih; <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah Siapharan Zedekiah tuh Khaldi hae kuih kyate lue lan khyh, Babilon siapharan kuih kalan pya athua ccaccing cih, aning te a muihkuh cih hae zah mitmae hawiliakute bya a hokuh cih hae; <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah kha Babilon lang a cciakhae cih zah, a tungvaw rya ka law mawlaezung tuin kyakhe a um cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; Khaldi hae kha na dou hae zemah na tae lan khyh hae,’ a ci, cite pawccemou profehbya na ho?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh, “Ka kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh: <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Na paaw neitawpaw Shallum ccapaw Hanamel tuh na kalan yn thua cih zah, “Anathoth kya umpaw ka loo tuh nang nynh yn re, pawccecize nang nynh shawkhawnaw kaw na hoi,” cite ae hopah cih,’ yn cipya,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte ka neitaw lanpaw Hanamel tuh rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu lang, ka kya yn thua zah kae kha, “Benjamin ram Anathoth khua e ka loo kha yn re, pawccecize nang tuh khah-e loo hoinaw kaw te shawkhawnaw kaw na hoi; namaw hanlan rekuh,” yn cipya. Tetuh e bya hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh thua cipaw ka ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anathoth khua umpaw ka neitaw lanpaw Hanamel loo tuh ka re zah, loo mee ngunphua shekel haw lae sari kha ka toupya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nawccawnawpaw min ka thuh zah tazeih ka khia, ccaekia hae kha ka ko hae zah phua kha zawccu te ka khinpya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te aphung thyhte zeikuh zah tazeih khiakuhpaw rekunawpaw ccaw te ccabawng leipaw khawpipaw ccaw kha ka law; <verse number="12" style="v" />te rekunawpaw ccaw tuh ka neitaw lanpaw Hanamel malang, rekunawpaw ccaw kya minthuh hae paw ccaekia hae malang, rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu a haung hae paw Judah hae balyn malang khe Mahseiah ccapaw Neriah a ccapaw Baruk kalan khe ka pya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mih balyn malang khe Baruk kha, <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel Pachia vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: E rekunawpaw tazeih khiakuhpaw ccaw te ccabawng leipaw khawpipaw ccaw hynh lah lah, khaw cia atyn nawlan, laephi ang lungkhu khe nungtua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: E ram lungkhu e inn hae, loo hae te misu khokhu hae hynh rethui athua cih, a ci cite ka hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Loo rekunawpaw ccaw kha Neriah ccapaw Baruk kalan ka pya koute, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw ka sangpaw tuh: <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, alesaepaw na huhan te na dyngpaw na kuih khate vaaw te lae hynh na rae! Na hanlan myaryamaw arupaw pawpaw mah um khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Atynpaw na sungsahnaw kha ccungccaw athong patae kya na langsaku, thuasalama paaw hae seinaw kha nyalang a um hae paw ccaaw hae tungvaw na liaru hae, alesaepaw te athungpaw Pachia na thua zah, na min tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na cikuh, <verse number="19" style="v" />alesaepaw tuanaw na hoi zah ngaeangthua lan umpaw uccaw kha na rae; na mit nynh ccungccaw hae laanpi balyn kha pong a muih; mih ccianaw laanpi thyhte, mih cyisahnaw athae thyhte amee na pya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Izip ram lungkhu muihsahnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae kha na langsakuh zah, Israel ram kya te ccungccaw balyn kyakhe atunin cia palei na langsaku ung, tukeiccuze atunin cia mah po atynpaw min kha na raeku vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Muihsahnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae te thuasah, na dyngpaw na kuih athungpaw te thuasah, alesaepaw ri lan umpaw uccaw khate thuasah Izip ram kyate na ccungccaw hae kha na cciakhae hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />kae pya cih oh cite mih minpaaw hae kya bya na kinpyaku hae paw ram, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw e ram hynh na pya hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />minmin nynh e ram hynh teenua hae zah a lawku hae. Thuasalama na bya ngae khyh hae, na kawbya kha zui khyh hae, cyi lan kaw na pya hae paw balyn kha ccangkheit san cyih khyh hae. Tukeiccuze e shethya thuanaw balyn hynh mih tungvaw na ccawsah vae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuapi kha law khylan laephi thae hae zah, po voilu lan adoh lante a pumnua vae hae, khuapi tuh thaloi rhaw, ccakanccinaw te shethya kha tung zah, khuapi kha rhaw a tuk cciamang hae paw Khaldi hae kuih kya pya athua vae. Na hopaw bya acyikupaw hynh phe na muih vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, khuapi kha Khaldi hae kuih kalan pya athua vae zemah, “Ccaekia hae kha ko hae lah, loo kha re,” nae cipya vae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kithuinaw Kong Hotynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="27" style="v" />Dotua, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thua zah, ccungccaw balyn Pachia nynh ka thua; ka hanlan myaryamaw arupaw paw sanmah a um zawtou? <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: E khuapi hynh Khaldi hae kuih kalan te Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kuih kalan ka pya cih zah, aning nynh a lawkuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2Si 25.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2Sh 36.17-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />E khuapi a tuk cih hae paw Khaldi hae tuh oun thua cih hae zah, e khuapi hynh maee te a soi cih hae; ka thinriasah khylan Baal pachia elang innccukaly kya silawnaw a raenaw hae inn hae te ccangpaw pachia hae kalan niapaw silawnaw a raenaw hae inn hae kha mah maee te a soi cih hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel hae te Judah hae nynh mih di lya mawte ka malang khe ahoy leipaw kyalya kha a cyi hae; Israel hae nynh mih kuih ryalawnaw khate ka thinrianaw rou kha a rae hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />E khuapi hynh nynh rae takaw lyate atu cia, ka thin yn riasah zah ka bung yn pawsah, tukeiccuze ka muihnaw kyate ccaring ka nue cih, <verse number="32" style="v" />pawccecize Israel hae te Judah hae mih siapharan hae, mih bawi hae, mih ranpibawi hae te mih profeh hae, Judah ram e ccungccaw hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh hoyleinaw balyn kha rae hae zah ka thin yn riasah hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih malang sangsah leite mih nulang yn sangsah hae; apaekuh lei lan ka hopya hae zemah, ka bya ngae leite thuiheinaw kha lawkuh khyh hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka min a umnaw beikinn kyakhe anungsikuhpaw mih uccaw hae kha nung hae zah a thusah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2Si 23.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30-31">Jer 7.30-31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:1-6">19.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Mih ccanung hae te mih ccapaw hae kha Molek pachia kalan pya khylan Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya kyakhe Baal pachia hanlan ahangpaw kha a raepya hae; kaw ka pya lei hae pite Judah kha seinaw raesah khylan, hynhcih anungsikuhpaw uccaw oun rae cih hae cipaw hynh ka thinlung kya mah thungkuh boi khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18.21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:10">2Si 23.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">Jer 7.31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, “Thaloi rhaw, ccakanccinaw te shethya thuasahte Babilon siapharan kuih kalan pya athua cih,” na ci oh paw e khuapi konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thinriate ka bungpaw zah myaryamaw ka thin-u keiccuze ka la deenaw hae ram balyn kyate minmin kha bua ka suelua cih hae; e hmin kalan ka kikhae cih hae zah, khyndadyh lan ka umsah cih hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae zah, kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Mimaw hoynaw hanlan te minmin nukhu e mih ccaaw hae hoynaw hanlan, kae kha zungzae yn rithya nawlan hae, lunglokunaw te laanpi ccangkheit zuinaw kha ka pya cih hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Minmin hanlan hoynaw raepyapaw kha papin ka umtaw khyh nawlan, minmin kya zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw kha ka rae cih; ka kyate a maeku khyh nawlan hae, kamaw rawrinaw kha mih thinlung kya ka sang cih. <verse number="41" style="v" />Minmin hanlan hoynaw raepyanaw kyakhe ka lungtuakhaekuh cih zah, minmin kha e ram kya ka thinlung balynte, ka tuanaw balynte, lungzite ka umsah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E myarya lepaw ronaw balyn hynh e ccungccaw hae tungvaw ka thuasah vae hawte, atu bya ka kinpyaku hae paw hiin hoynaw balyn hynh mih tungvaw ka thuasah cih. <verse number="43" style="v" />E ram hynh ccungccaw te sarangpaw um leite, daetedaenaw ram thua zah, Khaldi hae kuih kalan pya athua vae, cite na hopaw e ram lungkhu hin loo hae kha zuaku rekunaw a umthui cih. <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin ram kya thuasah, Jerusalem pepan kya thuasah, Judah ram e khuapi hae kya thuasah, mua vaw e khua hae, niccaw lang e khua hae te alia lang e khua hae kya thuasah loo hae kha phua te reku athua cih zah, zuanaw rekunawpaw ccaw hae tuh minthuh, tazeihkhia te ccaekia kokunaw kha a umthui cih; pawccecize mih hiinnaw kha langmaw hawte ka thuasah thui cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Detah koute Dansahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu thong a ccaw lyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh vae ningnaw a kya yn thua zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />laephi a raetu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, laephi muinsan kha rae zah a tynsahtu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a min <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> cikuhpaw nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="3" style="v" />Kae kha yn ko lah, kae oi cih, na ny boi leipaw alepaw te thuruhpaw uccaw kha kae hopah cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Koihlunawpaw rhawtuk-marung te thaloi hae kyate thungkhawku nawlan cite ro athuapaw e khuapi kya-e inn hae te Judah siapharan hae inn hae konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh: <verse number="5" style="v" />Khaldi hae tuh rhawtuk khylan thuasah, ka thinria zah ka bungpawnaw keiccuze ka chia hae paw michi rhua hae khate inn hae kha phe biasah khylan thuasah oun tee vae hae, pawccecize mih hoyleinaw balyn keiccuze e khuapi kyate ka mae kha ccanglang ka hawitaw vae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama e khuapi hynh ka dansah cih; khuaccaaw hae kha ka dansah cih hae zah hoirumnaw patae te khynnaw kha ka pya cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah hae te Israel hae kha ka kikhae cih hae zah, langmawlya hawte ka thadynsah cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tungvaw a rae hae paw seinaw balyn kha ka thyaasah cih zah, mih seinaw balyn te kae yn dounaw hae kha ka ngaethya cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />E khuapi tuh ka hanlan lungtuanaw te minthaannaw athua cih zah, minmin hanlan hoynaw ka raepaw balyn kha a thae hae paw laephi vaw e minphuin hae balyn malang khe thehoynaw te phu-enaw athua cih; e khuapi ka pyapaw hoirumnaw balyn te hoynaw balyn keiccuze a rih cih hae zah a thyngkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: “Ccungccaw te sarangpaw a um leinaw alakawpaw ram,” cite na hopaw e hmin kya thuasah, ccungccaw te sarangpaw um leite daetedaepaw Judah khua hae te Jerusalem laanpi hae kya thuasah, <verse number="11" style="v" />lungtuanaw roi te lungpawnaw roi, zudy ccangvaepaw roi te akaenung liaccanung roi, hlaw a sah hae paw roi, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lang lungtuanaw silawnawpaw kha ccyngte,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1Sh 16.34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2Sh 5.13</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7.3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Sam 100.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh hoy zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw a sungsahnaw tuh zungzae atyn keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh!” a ci hae paw roi kha thaethui athua cih.</para>
  <para style="m">Pawccecize e ram tuh langmawlya hawte ka thuasah thui cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ccungccaw te sarangpaw a um leipaw alakawpaw hynh-e hmin kya te a khua hae balyn kyakhe tuuphu hae a rin hae paw tuurin hae hanlan rampaeesakunaw hmin tuh bua a um cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mua vaw e khua hae, mua leihpaw e khua hae te alia lang e khua hae, Benjamin ram, Jerusalem pepan e hmin hae te Judah ram e khua hae kyakhe tuu hae a riatupaw kuihkaw khe tuuphu hae tuh bua a cceih cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">David kya Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Israel hae te Judah hae kya bya ka kinpyaku hae paw kha ka ccingsah ccyh tuh yn thua ccaccing cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.14-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5-6">Jer 23.5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin nin te tuin ccyh kyakhe, David hanlan adingpaw Akaran kha ka toihsah cih; aning nynh ram lungkhu kya byading te dingnaw kha a rae cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Judah kha khum athua cih zah, Jerusalem tuh khyndadyh lan a um cih. A min tuh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening dingnaw nynh thua,” cite ko athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Israel phin kya-e bawitungkhung vawlan a haung lanpaw David ciihan tuh papin paekuh lan khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2Sa 7.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:4">1Si 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1Sh 17.11-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />ka malang khe maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw, accyh takyh kya silawnaw a rae cih paw Levi phin ranpibawi lanpaw ccungccaw mah papin paekuh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-10">Nam 3.5-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua zah, <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Khuazi te khuadae tuh mimaw ccyh thyhte a um khyh ccaw hae cite, khuazi hanlan te khuadae hanlan ka raepaw ka byakinnaw kha ro kho athua ze rou nynh, <verse number="21" style="v" />ka ryalahtu David kya ka raepaw ka byakinnaw tuh ro kho athua cih zah, David a bawitungkhung vawlan te a uk cih paw ccapaw kha hoi lan khyh, te ka ryalahtu Levi phin hae kya ka raepaw ka byakinnaw kha mah ro kho athua cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaawlang e awsi hae kha riatae um khyh zah, rili laesia mah riatae a um khyh hawte, ka ryalahtu David ciihan te ka rya yn lawpah hae paw Levi phin hae kha ka pungzaesah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="24" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po hae paw innbyn bynning hae kha bua a vua vae hae,” cite ccungccaw hae nynh a ho hae paw kha hoyte na tua khyh oh tou? Minmin nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha minphuin phuin kheit lang ria lei lan ciate a theihrya hae paw hynh hoyte na tua khyh oh tou? <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Khuazi te khuadae hanlan ka raepaw ka byakinnaw kha thuasah, vaaw te lae hanlan ka raepaw phungzae hae kha thuasah ka tynsah khyh ze rou nynh, <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakob ciihan te ka ryalahtu David ciihan kha ka vua cih hae zah, Abraham, Isak te Jakob ciihan hae kha uk khylan David ciihan lukhakheit kha ka po lan khyh. Minmin kha ka kikhae cih hae zah thaw ka ccih cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zedekiah Chinaw Hodaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar te a rhawkaw hae balyn, a uknaw zakaw umpaw laephi peenaw hae te ccungccaw balyn nynh Jerusalem te a khuapi hae kha rhaw a tuk lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2Si 25.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2Sh 36.17-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Judah Siapharan Zedekiah kalan cceih lah, hynhte hopah: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E khuapi hynh Babilon siapharan kuih kalan ka pya cih zah, aning nynh maee te a soi cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te namaw hynh mah a kuih kyate na lue lan khyh, ae kyng cih hae zah a kuih kalan ae ap cih hae; Babilon siapharan te na tungkuh cih oh zah, mitmae hawiliakute bya na hokuh cih oh; te Babilon lang na cceih cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhzemah, pou Judah Siapharan Zedekiah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua! Namaw konglang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Thaloi te na chih lan khyh; <verse number="5" style="v" />daebabi lante na chih cih. Nang na mawze siapharan lang atangpaw na minpaaw hae hanlan mynkhuhpaw upya athua hae hawte, na hanlan mynkhuhpaw kha ae upah cih hae zah, ‘Ezou, bawipaw!’ cite ae rawhui cih hae; e bya hynh phe ka ho vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci,” cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Profeh Jeremiah nynh Judah siapharan Zedekiah kha Jerusalem khe e bya balyn hynh marya a hopya, <verse number="7" style="v" />tuh lya ccyh tuh Babilon siapharan a rhawkaw hae nynh Jerusalem kha thuasah, Judah ram kyaze a laehypaw Lakhish khua te Azekah khua kha thuasah rhaw a tuk lya hae nynh thua; e khua khuaning rou nynh Judah ram kyaze khualungrua te koihkhawpaw, a laehypaw khua athua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">See hae tungvaw Lungzi leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" />Judah ccungccaw nynh ccangpaw Judah ccungccaw kha see lang a mang vae khyh nawlan, ccungccaw balyn nynh Hebru ccungccaw mih see hae nopi pise kha luesah lan cite see luesahnaw kaw byakinnaw kha Zedekiah Siapharan nynh Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn ryte a rae koute, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te mih see hae nopi pise kha luesah lan cikuhpaw byakinnaw kha mih nawccahpaw bawi hae balyn te ccungccaw balyn nynh zui hae zah, seetangnaw kha bua a um khyh nawlan mih see hae kha a luesah hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama nyalangte mih lungpaleihkuh zah a saw vae hae paw seenung seepaw hae kha kothui hae zah, see lang bua a mang hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kalan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thua zah, <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nae minpaaw hae kha seetangnaw ram, Izip ram kyate he ka poukhae hae tuh, kamaw ccaccei nynh minmin ryte byakinnaw ka rae zah, <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nae kalan zua hae zah kum taruh lungkhu rya ae lawpah vae oh paw Hebru ccungccaw miakaw kha nanning balyn nynh kum sarinaw takyh kya na luesah hahe cih oh; nae ryalawpyanaw kyate na luesah hahe cih oh,” ka cipya hae. Thuasalama nae minpaaw hae nynh ka bya ngae khyh hae, mih nakaring mah tuakuh khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:2">Exo 21.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:12">Deu 15.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanning nynh aro mawze na ngaesikuh oh zah, lu kheit te lu kheit see luesahnaw kaw thote ka malang khe ahmepaw kha na rae oh, ka min te ko athuapaw beikinn khe byakinnaw kha ka malang na rae oh; <verse number="16" style="v" />thuasalama nae lungpaleihkuh thui zah ka min na thusah oh, mimaw rynaw thyhte na luesah vae oh paw seenung seepaw hae kha na kothui oh zah, nae see lang bua na mang oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka bya na ngae khyh oh, nae innpaw hae te nae ban hae kha luenaw na pya khyh oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Kae nynh luenaw kae pya lan oh paw tuh thaloi rhaw, shethya te ccakanccinaw athua cih. Laephi vaw e peenaw balyn hanlan ri lan umpaw lang kae rae cih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka byakinnaw a roh hae paw te ka malang a raeku hae paw byakinnaw kha a zui lei hae paw, vaetuataw kha ccangning lang thoh bua hae zah alaku kya po a ccianaw hae paw tuh-e vaetua taraw hawte ka rae cih hae paw: <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah ram e bawi hae, Jerusalem e bawi hae, siapharan inn e bawi hae, ranpibawi hae te ccangning lang thoh buapaw vaetuataw saw hae laku a cceihpaw ram kya-e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh <verse number="20" style="v" />mih rhaw hae te minmin chia a ry hae paw kuih kalan pya athua cih hae. Mih rhua tuh vaawlang e pavaw hae te laephi vaw e loramsaw hae hanlan looh lang a tang cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Judah Siapharan Zedekiah te a kuihkaw e bawi hae tuh mih rhaw hae te minmin chia a ry hae paw, nanning kha dou leite zya a um hae paw Babilon siapharan a rhawkaw hae kalan ka ap cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin kha kaw ka pya cih hae zah, e khuapi kalan ka thuasah cih hae; a tuk cih hae zah a lah cih hae, te maee te a soi cih hae. Judah ram e khua hae kha ccungccaw um leipaw daetedaepaw lang ka rae cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rekhab hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh Judah Siapharan lang a tang lyaze Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2Si 23.36—24.6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Rekhab hae inn lang cciate, minmin kha byabeih hae lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn akhaan khaan kheit lungkhu lang teekhae hae; te nia lanpaw misutui kha pya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Habazziniah ccapaw Jeremiah a ccapaw Jaazaniah te a uno hae te a ccapaw hae balyn, te Rekhab phin hae balyn kha ka cciakhae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu, Pachia ccungccaw Igdaliah ccapaw Hanan a ccapaw khaan lungkhu lang ka teekhae hae; tuh-e khaan tuh beikinn teenaw kya a ngawtu Shallum ccapaw Maaseiah khaan luki, bawi hae khaan pe khe nynh a um. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Rekhab hae malang khe misutui phe beihpaw ang hae te banang hae kha ka nung zah, “Misutui hynh neih oh,” ka cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, “Misutui tuh kae neih lan khyh, pawccecize kae minpaaw Rekhab ccapaw Jonadab nynh kaw oun pya zah, ‘Nanning nynh thuasah, nae ccaaw hae nynh thuasah misutui hynh kharouh na neih lan khyh oh; <verse number="7" style="v" />inn na sak lan khyh oh, ccacii na tu lan khyh oh, misu khokhu mah na rae lan khyh oh, e hae hynh ccangkheit sanmah na cyih lan khyh oh; na umnaw oh ram kyakhe khaw cia na um kho nawlan oh, nae she lungkhu balyn buu khate na um cih oh,’ oun cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae minpaaw Rekhab ccapaw Jonadab nynh kaw oun pyapaw balyn kha kae zui zah, kae she lungkhu kaemaw, kae zu hae, kae ccapaw hae te kae ccanung hae nynh misutui kha kae neih khyh, <verse number="9" style="v" />umnawpaw inn kha kae sakkuh khyh. Misu khokhu te loo mah kae hoi khyh, ccacii mah kae tu khyh; <verse number="10" style="v" />bu kya kae um zah, kae minpaaw Jonadab nynh kaw oun pyapaw balyn kha kae zui zah kae cyi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh e ram hynh he yn dou tuh, ‘Rang oh, Jerusalem lang cceih oh sih, pawccecize Khaldi rhawkaw hae te Aramean rhawkaw hae raw kha ri lan a um,’ kae ci. Tukeiccu nynh Jerusalem kyahin kae um,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Cceih lah, Judah hae te Jerusalem um hae paw kha hynhte hopah hae, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Pawccemou ka ccangpyanaw hynh ngae leite ka bya hynh na zui khyh oh?’ a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekhab Jonadab nynh a ciihan hae kha misutui nia lei lante kawpya hae zah, minmin nynh atunin cia neih khyh hae, pawccecize mih minpaaw kaw kha a ngae hae. Thuasalama kae nynh nanning kha apaekuh lei lan kae hopya vae oh zemah na zui khyh oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu profeh hae balyn kha nae kalan apaekuh lei lan ka saw hae zah, ‘Ahoy leipaw nae hiinzia kyate paleihkuh oh lah, nae cyisahnaw kha raekuh thui oh, ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik khylan mih nulang zuikuh nan oh, tuhteze nynh nanning te nae minpaaw hae kae pya oh paw ram kya na um cih oh,’ cite kae hopya oh. Thuasalama nae nakaring na tuakuh khyh oh zah, ka bya na ngae khyh oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Rekhab ccapaw Jonadab ciihan hae nynh tuh mih minpaaw kaw kha ngae hae zah a zui hae, thuasalama e ccungccaw hae nynh ka bya ngae khyh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, Israel Pachia, vaaw Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Judah tungvaw te Jerusalem um hae paw balyn tungvaw khe ka hoty vae paw ronaw balyn kha ka thuasah cih; pawccecize minmin kha ka hopah hae zah ngae khyh hae, ka ko hae zahmah yn oi khyh hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh Rekhab phin hae kha hynhte a hopya hae: Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae minpaaw Jonadab kaw kha ngaete, a phungbya balyn kha na zui oh zah, kaw ae pya oh paw balyn kha na cyi vae oh keiccuze, <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Rekhab ccapaw Jonadab ciihan kya she takyhte ka ryalah lanpaw pise paekuh lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn kya Riapaw Ccakue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw kum kya, Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">2Si 24.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccakue kha lawkuh lah, Josiah she lya, nang kae hopya nin kyate atunin cia Israel, Judah te minphuin balyn kong kae hopyapaw bya balyn kha zeitua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih tungvaw thuasah lan ka paccynpaw ronaw balyn kha Judah hae nynh he a thae hae te, ahoy leipaw mih cyisahnaw kyate poh a paleihkuh kho hae, tuhteze tuh mih hoyleinaw te mih seinaw kha poh ka ngaethya kho hae, a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh Neriah ccapaw Baruk kha ko zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jeremiah a hopyapaw bya balyn kha, Jeremiah nynh a opya thyhte Baruk nynh ccakue kya a zei. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Jeremiah nynh Baruk kha, “Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu lang tee lan khee ka thua; <verse number="6" style="v" />tukeiccuze nang nynh cceih lah, kae opah zah ccakue kya na zeipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn e ccungccaw hae nynh a thaenaw hae khe looh-aesung nin kya riapah hae. Mih khua te oun thuapaw Judah hae balyn nynh a thaenaw hae khe mah na riapah cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin balyn nynh ahoy leipaw mih ozia kyate paleihkute, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang ngiakute saw poh a sang kho hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ccungccaw hae a honua hae paw thinrianaw te bungpawnaw tuh myarya ale,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te profeh Jeremiah nynh kaw a pyapaw balyn kha Neriah ccapaw Baruk nynh cyih zah, ccakue kya-e <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn khe a ria.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum pangawnaw, sawpaw sah takuanaw khe Jerusalem e ccungccaw balyn te Judah ram e khua hae kyate Jerusalem lang oun cceih hae paw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe looh-ae a sung hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e Koikua Thawpaw teenaw, thahlang khaan kya umpaw ryaccinkhan Shapan ccapaw Gemariah khaan kya ccungccaw balyn a thaenaw hae khe, Baruk nynh ccakue kya-e Jeremiah bya kha a riapya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Inn kya Ccakue Rianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shafan ccapaw Gemariah a ccapaw Mikaiah nynh ccakue kya-e <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya balyn kha he a thae tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />siapharan inn lang cceihbung zah, ryaccinkhan khaan lungkhu lang a tee; tuin kyatuin Ryaccinkhan Elishama, Shemaiah ccapaw Delaiah, Akhbor ccapaw Elnathan, Safan ccapaw Gemariah, Hananiah ccapaw Zedekiah te ccangpaw bawi hae tuh a haung hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Baruk nynh ccungccaw hae a thaenaw hae kya ccakue a ria lyaze Mikaiah nynh a thaepaw bya balyn kha minmin kalan a hopya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh bawi hae balyn nynh Kushi ccapaw Shelemiah ccapaw Nethaniah a ccapaw Jehudi kha Baruk kalan saw hae zah, “Ccungccaw hae thaenaw kya na riapaw ccakue kha yn ccyng lah, yn cceih,” cite a hosah pya hae. Tukeiccuze Neriah ccapaw Baruk nynh ccakue tuh a kuih kya ccyng zah mih kalan a cceih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te minmin nynh Baruk kha, “Haung lah, ccakue tuh kaening oun riapya tua,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Baruk nynh ccakue tuh a riapya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e bya balyn tuh he a thae hae te, bungzoute lu kheit te lu kheit dokuh hae zah, Baruk kha, “E bya balyn hynh siapharan kalan kae thaesah ccaccing cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te tuh-e bawi hae nynh Baruk kha, “Atu oun hopya tua, e bya balyn hynh pawtemou na zei? Jeremiah nynh ae opyapaw athua tou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruk nynh, “E bya balyn hynh Jeremiah nynh yn opah zah, kae nynh ccakue kyakhe ccatui te ka zei,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh bawi hae nynh Baruk kha, “Nang te Jeremiah tuh cceih oh lah, rekuh oh, nae umnaw kha humhung mah nysakuh nan oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiakim nynh Ccakue kha Maee te A U</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te ccakue tuh ryaccinkhan Elishama khaan kya nungsyate, siapharan inn voidu lungkhu lang cceih hae zah, tuh-e bya balyn kha siapharan kya a hopya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Jehudi kha tuh-e ccakue law lan naw zah, aning nynh ryaccinkhan Elishama khaan kya-e ccakue tuh a law; tuh-e ccaw tuh Jehudi nynh siapharan te a pe thadyn hae paw bawi hae kha a riapya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh lya tuh, sawpaw sah takuanaw, khuaccih saw thua zah, siapharan tuh khuaccih saw a umnaw inn lungkhu khe haung zah, a malang umpaw maee aruapaw maeepung kha a eku. <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehudi nynh ccakue tuh ccamae ccangthum ccangpali he a ria te, siapharan nynh ccakue tuh ccezung te aw zah, maeepung lungkhu e maee lungkhu langkhe athang mawlaezung a phung. <verse number="24" style="v" />Siapharan te tuh-e bya a thaepaw a ryalahtu miakaw tuh mih bungzou khyh, mih boeining mah seiikuh khyh hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccakue tuh a seii khyh nawlan, Elnathan, Delaiah te Gemariah nynh a ngia hae zemah mih bya kha ngae khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh ryaccinkhan Baruk te profeh Jeremiah kha kyng khylan siapharan ccapaw Jerahmeel, Azriel ccapaw Seraiah te Abdeel ccapaw Shelemiah kha kaw a pya hae. Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha a thuruh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Ccangpaw Ccakue A Opya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh opah zah Baruk nynh a zeipaw ccakue kha siapharan nynh maee te a u koute, Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="28" style="v" />Ccangpaw ccakue kha lah lah, Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim nynh maee te a upaw masaty e ccakue kya a umpaw bya rynpaw balyn kha zeitua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim konglangte hynhte na ho cih, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Babilon siapharan tuh yn thua ccaccing cih zah, e ram hynh a roh cih, ccungccaw te sarangpaw hae kha a theih cih hae, acikuhpaw bya hynh pawccemou e ccakue kya na zei? cite na ho zah, e ccakue hynh maee te na u ngan vae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Aning nynh David a bawitungkhung kya a haung cih paw ciihan lu kheit sanmah hoi lan khyh, te a rhua kha khuadae ze khuaninso kya, khuazi ze dangtui kya a vua cih hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Amaw, a ciihan hae te a ryalahtu hae kha mih hoyleinaw keiccu de ka tah cih hae; mih tungvaw thuasah, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae tungvaw thuasah, Judah hae tungvaw thuasah shethya balyn kha ka thuasah cih, tuh-e shethya te raeringnaw ka pya hae zahmah ngaelae khyh hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh ccangpaw ccakue kha lah zah, Neriah ccapaw ryaccinkhan Baruk kha a pya, Judah Siapharan Jehoiakim nynh maee te a upaw ccakue kya-e bya balyn kha Jeremiah nynh opah zah a zei; alokuhpaw bya patae kha biachih athua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Accakaepaw Zedekiah Ngaehoinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Judah siapharan lang a khangpaw Jehoiakim ccapaw Koniah hanpaw Josiah ccapaw Zedekiah nynh siapharan lang a tang vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:17">2Si 24.17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama amaw nynh thuasah, a ryalahtu hae nynh thuasah, ramccungccaw hae nynh thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jeremiah kyate a hopaw bya kha ngae khyh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Zedekiah siapharan nynh Shelemiah ccapaw Jehukal te Maaseiah ccapaw ranpibawi Zefaniah kha profeh Jeremiah kalan saw hae zah, “Kaening hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kalan saw beih oun sangpya tua,” cite a hosah pya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh lya tuh, Jeremiah tuh thong a ccaw loh khyh keiccuze ccungccaw hae laku kya a cceih bungthung ung. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin, Faro rhawkaw hae tuh Izip ram kyate oun toikuh vae hae; tuh-e kong tuh Jerusalem a koihlu hae paw Khaldi hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, Jerusalem kyate a toikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Jeremiah kya yn thua zah: <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Kae kha byakhia khylan ae sawtu oh paw Judah siapharan kha nanning lu ning nynh hynhte la hopah oh, nang bawm khylan oun cceih hae paw Faro rhawkaw hae tuh mimaw ram, Izip ram lang a ki cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Khaldi hae tuh oun ki cih hae zah, e khuapi hynh a tuk cih hae, a lah cih hae zah maee te a soi cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: “Khaldi hae tuh aening kyate ccaring a cceih ccaccing vae cih hae,” cite naemaw toulou kha lingkuh nan oh, pawccecize minmin tuh asawnaw lang cceih lan khyh hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning ae tuk oh paw Khaldi rhawkaw hae balyn kha na tae oh zah, vaemaw mue hae paw kyalya tuh mih bu kya a laehy hae lanze hei, tuh-e hae nynh a thokuh cih hae zah, e khuapi hynh maee te a soi cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah Thongccah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Faro rhawkaw hae nynh oun naeku hae keiccuze Khaldi rhawkaw hae tuh Jerusalem kyate nulang he a ki hae te, <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh a puizia hae kya-e mue lan a ccanpaw sisua kha lawku khylan Jerusalem kyate Benjamin ram lang a cceih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Benjamin Koikua kya he a thua tuh, Hananiah ccapaw Shelemiah a ccapaw Irijah cikuhpaw rhawviatupaw nynh profeh Jeremiah kha, “Nang hynh Khaldi hae kalan nae ccuepaw nynh thua,” ci zah a kyng. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Jeremiah nynh, “Tuh-e bya tuh hynbya nynh thua; Khaldi hae kalan ka ccuepaw thua khyh,” a cipya. Thuasalama Irijah nynh ngaepya leite, Jeremiah kha kyng zah bawi hae kalan a thuakhae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawi hae tuh Jeremiah tungvaw mih thinria, aning kha zia hae zah, ryaccinkhanpaw Jonathan inn khe thong a saw hae, pawccecize tuh-e inn tuh thonginn lang a rae vae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh innmakaw laephi akhunaw kyakhe nin patae a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zedekiah Siapharan nynh Jeremiah kha kosah hae zah, a tungkuh hae. Siapharan nynh a inn khe aruh lante, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate bya hankhakheit a um tou?” cite a khia. Jeremiah nynh, “A um! Nang tuh Babilon siapharan kuih kalan pya na thua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh Zedekiah Siapharan kha, “Na tungvaw thuasah, na ryalahtu hae tungvaw thuasah, e ccungccaw hae tungvaw thuasah, paw ka cyisei keiccu mou thong nae saw? <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Babilon siapharan tuh nang te e ram hynh dou khylan yn thua lan khyh,’ cite profehbya ae hopah hae paw na profeh hae kha teimou a um hae? <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka bawipaw ka siapharan, ka bya beih yn ngaepya tua: kae soihbiakunawpaw bya hynh beih yn thaepah lah, chi khylan ryaccinkhanpaw Jonathan inn lang bua yn saw nan vae,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Zedekiah Siapharan nynh kawtho zah, Jeremiah kha thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu khe thong a saw hae; khuapi lungkhu sanlou athang mawlaezung, sanlou thoutu hae laanpi kyate nin takyhte sanlou phe kheit tyty a pya hae. Tuhcite Jeremiah tuh thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu khe a um.</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah Tuisung lungkhu A Um</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh ccungccaw zapi balyn kalan byahopaw kha Mattan ccapaw Shefatiah, Pashhur ccapaw Gedaliah, Shelemiah ccapaw Jukal te Malkhiah ccapaw Pashhur hae nynh a thae hae; tuh-e a bya tuh, <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E khuapi kya a umpaw balyn tuh thaloi rhaw, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate a chih cih hae; thuasalama Khaldi hae kalan a cceih hae paw tuh a hiin cih hae; mih hiinnaw tuh rhawtuknaw e muepaw lasung hawte a hoi cih hae zah a hiin cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E khuapi hynh Babilon siapharan a rhawkaw hae kuih kalan ap athua ccaccing cih zah, a lah cih hae, a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh bawi hae nynh siapharan kyakhe, “E ccungccapaw hynh chia lan accan, pawccecize aning nynh hynhcihawpaw bya a hopya hae keiccuze e khuapi kya a laehypaw rhawkaw hae te ccungccaw balyn kha mih rawthyasah hae. E ccungccapaw nynh e ccungccaw hae hoynaw kha ccung leite vawsawnaw kha a ccungpya hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah siapharan nynh, “Aning tuh hein kya mang um, aning tuh nae kuih kya nynh a um; pawccecize siapharan tuh nanning rynaw kha khee khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Jeremiah kha cciakhae hae zah, thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu umpaw, siapharan ccapaw Malkhiah a tuisung lungkhu langkhe arui te a sawbung hae. Tuisung lungkhu tui um leite tuiccua rou nynh a um, Jeremiah tuh tuh-e tuiccua lungkhu a phungkuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ebed-melek nynh Jeremiah A Luesah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh tuisung lungkhu nynh a nung hae cipaw kha siapharan inn kya ryalahpaw, Ethiopia minphuinpaw Ebed-melek nynh a thae. Siapharan tuh Benjamin Koikua kya a haung lyakhe, <verse number="8" style="v" />Ebed-melek tuh siapharan inn kyate toikuh zah, siapharan kalan khe, <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka bawipaw siapharan, e ccungccaw hae nynh profeh Jeremiah tungvaw hoyleinaw balyn kha rae hae zah, vuelawte chih sah cite tuisung lungkhu lang a sawbung hae, pawccecize khuapi kya sanlou um vae khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Ethiopia minphuinpaw Ebed-melek kha, “E kyate ccungccaw lu thum kokuh hae lah, profeh Jeremiah kha a chi mawkhe tuisung kyate suethung oh,” cite kaw a pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ebed-melek nynh ccungccaw lu thum kokuh hae zah siapharan inn lang a cceih hae, te boeining nungnaw khaan e arynpaw boei aseiikuhpaw kha lah zah, tuisung lungkhu umpaw Jeremiah kalan khe arui ryte a sawbung pya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Oute Ethiopia minphuinpaw Ebed-melek nynh Jeremiah kha, “Na rakaw te arui laku khe boeipue aseiikuhpaw kha dekuh,” a cipya. Jeremiah nynh tuhcite a cyi. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh Jeremiah kha arui te suethung hae zah, tuisung lungkhu te poh a thuaa hae. Jeremiah tuh rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu khe a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekiah nynh Jeremiah Tuanaw A Ngia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zedekiah siapharan nynh Jeremiah kha kosah hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn teenaw thuakaw ccangthumnaw kyakhe a tungku. Siapharan nynh Jeremiah kha, “Bya kae khia cih; papin yn phei nan,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh Zedekiah kha, “Kae hopya ze, chia leite nae nung cih tou? Tuanaw kae pya ze, ka bya nae ngaepah cih tou?” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Zedekiah Siapharan nynh Jeremiah kha aruh lante byakinpakuh zah, “Hiinnaw oun pyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang kha kae theih lan khyh, chia ae ry hae paw kuih kalan mah kae ap lan khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh Zedekiah kha, “Israel Pachia, vaaw Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae kalan na apku ze rou nynh na hiinnaw kha haang athua cih zah, e khuapi hynh maee te soi lan khyh hae, namaw te na innbyn hae tuh na hiin cih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae kalan na apku khyh zetuh, e khuapi hynh Khaldi hae kalan pya athua cih zah, minmin nynh maee te a soi cih hae, namaw mah mih kuih kyate na lue lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Zedekiah siapharan nynh Jeremiah kha, “Khaldi hae kalan a ccue hae paw Judah hae raw ka rih, pawccecize mih kuih kalan yn apsei cih hae zah, minmin nynh yn theihrya cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh, “Tuhte cyihkuh lan khyh. Kae hopyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh zui lah, namaw hanlan ahoy cih, na hiinnaw kha haang athua cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama apku lei lante bya na paeku zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte vizin yn muihsah— <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah siapharan inn kya a laehypaw nopi balyn kha Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae kalan cciakhae athua cih hae zah, tuh-e nopi hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Na doliakupaw na ban hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae soih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae tae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ccu tuh tuiccua kya bingkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae cciataw vae hae,’ cite a ho cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na zu na ccaaw hae balyn kha Khaldi hae kalan a cciakhae cih hae zah, nang mah mih kuih kyate na lue lan khyh, Babilon siapharan nynh nang kha ae kyng cih; e khuapi hynh maee te a soi cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh Zedekiah nynh Jeremiah kha, “E bya hynh humhung mah nysah nan, tuhkhyhze tuh na chih cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang te bya ah hokupaw hynh bawi hae nynh thae hae zah, minmin nynh nang kha, ‘Siapharan na hopyapaw bya kha kaening oun hopya tua; oun phei nan, tuhkhyhze tuh kae theih cih. Siapharan nynh pawmou ae hopya?’ cite ae khia hae ze, <verse number="26" style="v" />nang nynh minmin kha, ‘Chi khylan Jonathan inn lang bua yn saw khyh nawlan siapharan kha ka ngiaku,’ cite na hopah cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawi hae balyn tuh Jeremiah kya oun thua hae zah bya a khia hae; te siapharan nynh kaw a pya thathyhte Jeremiah nynh a hopya hae. Tukeiccuze aning kha byakhia vae khyh hae, pawccecize bya a hoku hae paw kha humhung nynh mah nyh khyh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Jerusalem kha law athua mawlaezung, Jeremiah tuh thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu po a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eze 33.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem A Law hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum takuanaw, sawpaw sah hawnaw khe, Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar te a rhawkaw hae balyn nynh Jerusalem kha oun ccianua hae zah a koihlu hae; <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae kheitnaw kum, sawpaw sah palinaw, nin takua nin khe khuapi kya-e khualungrua kha a ting hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem kha he a lah hae te, Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae tuh oun thua hae zah, angaelung e koikua kya a haung hae, tuh-e hae tuh: rhawbawi lepaw Nergal-sharezer, Samgar-nebo, bawi lepaw Sarsekhim, Nergal-sharezar te Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e tuhlaepaw bawi hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah siapharan Zedekiah te rhawkaw balyn nynh minmin kha he a muih hae tuh, a ccue hae, khuazi khe siapharan khokhu laanpi kha zui hae zah, khualungrua ccangning laku e koikua kyate khuapi atolang pou hae zah Arabah lang a cceih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama Khaldi rhawkaw hae nynh minmin kha deehui hae zah, Zedekiah kha Jeriko bialae khe a phya hae; te aning kha kyng hae zah Babilon siapharan a umnaw Hamath ram, Riblah khua langkhe a cciakhae hae; aning nynh Zedekiah kha bya a pia. <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Zedekiah ccapaw hae kha Riblah khua kya mih paaw muihnaw khe a chia hae, Judah ram e bawi balyn kha mah a chia hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah mit kha a khoi kou hae te, Babilon lang cciakhae khylan sivawrui te a khii hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaldi hae nynh siapharan inn te ranzae hae inn kha maee te soi hae zah, Jerusalem khualungrua kha a ting hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Oute rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh khuapi kya a laehypaw ccungccaw hae, amaw kalan a ccue hae paw te a laehypaw ccungccaw hae kha kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh pawpaw mah a hoi lei hae paw ryachi hae abang kha Judah ram kya cciataw hae zah, misu khokhu te loo hae kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah A Lue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan kha Jeremiah konglangte kawpya zah, <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jeremiah kha yn ko, amaw kha hoyte do-oih lah, vawsaw pya nan, aning nynh ae hopya hawte cyipah,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan, bawi lepaw Nebushazban, rhawbawi lepaw Nergal-sharezer te Babilon siapharan kuihkaw e bawi lupi balyn nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah, <verse number="14" style="v" />thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu e Jeremiah kha a kosah hae. Minmin nynh a umnaw inn kalan saw khylan, Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah kya a ap hae. Tetuh Jeremiah tuh a minphuin hae ryte a umkheih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah tuh thong rhawviatu hae voidu lungkhu a um lyakhe, a kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh: <verse number="16" style="v" />Cceih lah, Ethiopia minphuinpaw Ebed-melek kha hynhte hopah: Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E khuapi hoynaw elang thua leite, hoyleinaw elang ka bya kha ka ccingsah cih, tuin nin khe ka bya tuh na malang accing cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama tuin nin khe nang kha kae khum cih zah, na ripaw ccungccaw hae kuih kya ap na thua lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize nang kha kae khum ccaccing cih zah, thaloi te na chih lan khyh; kae kha nae doliaku keiccuze na hiinnaw tuh rhawtuknaw kya-e muepaw lasung hawte na hoi cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gedaliah kya Jeremiah A Um</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh Jeremiah kha Ramah kya a luesah koute, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua; kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae hae paw Judah hae te Jerusalem e hae balyn ryte Jeremiah kha mah sivawrui te khii athuabua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh Jeremiah kha ko zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh e hmin kyahin shethya ka thuasah cih, a la ci; <verse number="3" style="v" />a la ho vae hawte, e shethya hynh nae tungvaw a thua vae; nanning balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw na sei oh zah, a bya na ngae khyh oh keiccuze e uccaw hynh nae tungvaw accah vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kuih kya khiikuhpaw sivawrui hynh atunin kae supya vae. Babilon lang ka kya na cciabua ry ze cceihbua lah, hoyte kae do-oih cih; Babilon lang ka kya na cciabua ry khyh ze, cceihbua nan. Dotua, ram pynpi tuh na malang nynh a um; ahoy te akyh cite na tuanaw miakaw lang cciatua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na umsya lanze, Babilon siapharan nynh Judah ram e khua hae a uktu lang a nungpaw Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah kalan kithui lah, na ccungccaw hae laku amaw kya umbua; tuhkhyhze na ccia rynaw lang la cceih,” a cipya. Te rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw nynh looh te lasung pya zah a cciasah vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah tuh Mizpah khua umpaw Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kalan cceih zah, tuh-e ram kya a cciataw hae paw ccungccaw hae laku khe Gedaliah kya a umbua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kha ram uktu lang nung zah, kyng hae zah Babilon lang a cciakhae lei hae paw nopi, pise, imua hae, ram lungkhu e mih ryachihua hae paw kha amaw kuih kya a ap hae cipaw tuh, ramkaw umpaw rhawtho hae paw a cciakhaetu hae balyn te mih rhawkaw hae nynh he a thae hae te,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.7-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:22-24">2Si 25.22-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael, Kareah ccapaw Johanan, Tanhumeth ccapaw Seraiah, Netofah minphuinpaw Efai ccapaw hae te Maakah minphuinpaw Jazaniah tuh mih rhawkaw hae ryte Mizpah khua umpaw Gedaliah kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah nynh minmin te mih rhawkaw hae kyakhe, “Khaldi hae ryalaw lanpaw kha rih nan oh. Ram lungkhu um oh lah, Babilon siapharan rya kha lawpah oh, tetuh naemaw hanlan ahoy cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae tuh aening kalan oun thua hae paw Khaldi hae malang khe nanning hanlan locceihtu lang um khylan Mizpah khua kya ka um cih; thuasalama nanning tuh misutui, hawnin e thingthae te chitui kha suelua oh lah, nae ang lungkhu khe ccakhungkuh oh, te na law vae oh paw khua hae kyakhe um oh,” cite bya a kinpyaku hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhawte, Babilon siapharan nynh Judah ram khe a laehypaw ccungccaw hae kha cciataw hae zah, Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah tuh minmin uktu lang a nung cipaw kha Moab ram, Ammon ram, Edom ram te ccangpaw ram hae kya a umpaw Judah hae balyn nynh he a thae hae te, <verse number="12" style="v" />phiariphiarae a umnaw hae hmin balyn kyate ki hae zah, Judah ram, Mizpah khua umpaw Gedaliah kalan a thua hae; te misutui te hawnin thingthae kha patae a ccakhungku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gedaliah kha Chianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:25-26">2Si 25.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kareah ccapaw Johanan te ramkaw a umpaw rhawtho hae paw cciakhaetu hae balyn nynh Mizpah umpaw Gedaliah kalan cceih hae zah, <verse number="14" style="v" />Gedaliah kha, “Ammon hae siapharan Baalis nynh Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael kha nang chia khylan yn sawpaw kha na nyh tou?” cite a khia hae. Thuasalama Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah nynh minmin kha zyn khyh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kareah ccapaw Johanan nynh Mizpah umpaw Gedaliah kha, “Beih ka la cceih sah lah, Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael kha kae theih sah, humhung nynh mah nyh lan khyh. Na pepan a sueluakuh hae paw Judah hae balyn kha phiariphiarae nung khylan te a laehypaw Judah hae kha ro khylan, pawccemou aning nynh nang kha ae chia lanpaw tuh?” cite aruh lante a hopya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah nynh Kareah ccapaw Johanan kha, “Tuhte cyih nan, pawccecize Ishmael kong na hopaw tuh hynbya nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gedaliah Dounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw khe, siapharan phin athuapaw, siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae kyaze lupi lu kheit athuapaw, Elishama ccapaw Nethaniah a ccapaw Ishmael tuh ccungccaw lu haw ryte Mizpah khua umpaw Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kya a thua hae. Mizpah khua kya looh a aekheih lya hae khe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.1-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:25">2Si 25.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael te ccungccaw lu haw nynh thonuakuh hae zah, Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah kha thaloi te a chia hae, pawccecize Babilon siapharan nynh Gedaliah kha ram lungkhu uktu lang a nung keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mizpah khua kya Gedaliah ryte a umkheih hae paw Judah hae balyn te tuin kya umpaw Khaldi rhawkaw hae kha mah Ishmael nynh a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gedaliah a theih kou hae te humhung nynh mah a ny maw awkhualan khe, <verse number="5" style="v" />Shekhem, Shiloh te Samaria kyate ccungccaw sung tarya tuh mih khawming ngokute, mih boeining seiikute, mih pyn awkute oun thua hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya pya lanpaw ccathae silawnawpaw te mynkhuhpaw kha oun ccyngbia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael tuh Mizpah khua te minmin tungku khylan rawkhui biate yn thua. He a tungkuh hae te aning nynh minmin kha, “Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kalan oun cciatua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh khuapi ngaelung he a thua hae te, Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael te a kya umpaw ccungccaw hae nynh tuh-e hae tuh theih hae zah, tuisung lungkhu lang a vua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e laku e lu haw hae nynh Ishmael kha, “Kaening hynh oun theih nan, pawccecize kae ccakhungkuhpaw chanvuih, barli, chitui te khoitui kha ramkaw kae thuruhkunaw kya kae hoi,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin te mih ban hae kha chia leite a haang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ishmael nynh theih hae zah mih rhua a vuanaw tuisung tuh myarya ale, tuh-e tuisung tuh Israel siapharan Baasha rhaw kyate thungkhawku nawlan Siapharan Asa nynh a thaekupaw nynh thua. Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael nynh a chia hae paw michi rhua khate tuh-e tuisung tuh phe a biasah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute Mizpah khua e a laehypaw ccungccaw balyn, siapharan ccanung hae, rhawviatu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kalan ap hae zah Mizpah khua a cciataw hae paw balyn kha Ishmael nynh pong a kyng hae. Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael nynh minmin kha kyng hae zah Ammon hae kalan a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nathaniah ccapaw Ishmael nynh hoyleinaw a raepaw balyn kha Kareah ccapaw Johanan te a kya umbua hae paw rhawkaw cciakhaetu hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />mih ccungccaw balyn kha kokute Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael kha tuk khylan ccianua hae zah Gibeon tuilipi pe khe a phya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ishmael te a umkheih hae paw ccungccaw balyn nynh Kareah ccapaw Johanan te a umkheih hae paw rhawkaw cciakhaetu hae balyn kha he a muih hae tuh mih lungtua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh Ishmael nynh Mizpah kyate a kyng hae paw balyn tuh kithui hae zah, Kareah ccapaw Johanan kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael tuh lu tarya ryte Johanan kyate lue hae zah Ammon hae kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael nynh Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kha a theih koute, Ishmael nynh Mizpah khua kyate kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae paw rhawkaw hae, nopi hae, imua hae, tinriapaw ccungccaw hae balyn kha Kareah ccapaw Johanan te rhawkaw cciakhaetu hae balyn nynh Gibeon khua kyate bua a kikhae hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin tuh Khaldi hae keiccuze Izip ram lang ccia lan eenaw te pou hae zah, Bethlehem khua pe umpaw Geruth Khimham khua khe a um hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />pawccecize Babilon siapharan nynh ram uktu lang a nungpaw Ahikam ccapaw Gedaliah kha Nethaniah ccapaw Ishmael nynh a chia keiccuze Khaldi hae tuh a rih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Ahiinhy hae paw Tuanaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Oute rhawkaw cciakhaetu bawi hae balyn, Kareah ccapaw Johanan, Hoshaiah ccapaw Azariah te adih ale ccungccaw balyn nynh <verse number="2" style="v" />profeh Jeremiah kalan naekuh hae zah, “Kaening nynh kae ngiapaw hynh beih oun ngaepya tua, kaening kae laehypaw balyn hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan saw beih sangtua. Pawccecize na muih vae hawte, ccungccaw patae laku kyate kaening beihtaraw rou nynh kae laehy vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaening nynh kae zui lanpaw laanpi te kae cyi lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh oun muihsah sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Profeh Jeremiah nynh minmin kha, “Myarya hoy: Na ngia oh hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan saw ka sang cih zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae leih oh paw miakaw kha kae hopah cih oh; pawpaw mah kae phei lan khyh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh Jeremiah kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh na kyate kaening oun hopyapaw atyn-are thyhte kae zui khyh lanze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh kaening kha rawsete ahmepaw te alungzipaw ccaekia lang tang vae sah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kaening nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia bya kha he kae ngae te, hoynaw kae mue ccaw cite, nang kae sawnuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia bya kha ahoy athya ci um leite kae ngae cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nin haw aro te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jeremiah kya yn thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh Jeremiah nynh Kareah ccapaw Johanan te a kya um buapaw rhawkaw cciakhaetu bawi hae balyn te adih ale ccungccaw balyn kha pum hae zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />minmin kyakhe, “Na ngia oh paw kha amaw malang thuakhaepya lan kae nae sawnuathe oh paw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="10" style="v" />E ram kya na um oh ze rou nynh nanning kha suebung leite kae lesah thung cih oh; kae lin cih oh zah poh kae khaee lan khyh oh; pawccecize nae tungvaw ka la thuakhaepaw shethya keiccu ka ngaethah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ri oh paw Babilon siapharan kha rih nan oh; amaw kha rih nan oh, pawccecize nanning khum khylan te a kuih kyate luesah khylan kae tuh nae kya ka um, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae tungvaw thawccinaw ka hoi cih, te aning nynh nae tungvaw thawccinaw a hoi cih zah nae ram lang ae kisah cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha ngae leite, ‘E ram kya kae um lan khyh, <verse number="14" style="v" />rhawtho leinaw, mungkae roi thae leinaw te vuelaw leinaw Izip ram lang kae cceih cih zah, tuin kya kae um cih,’ cite palei na ho oh zetuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />pou a laehypaw Judah hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh. Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh Izip ram lang tee lan zah tuin kya khuasah lan, cite bya na paeku oh zetuh, <verse number="16" style="v" />na ri oh paw thaloi nynh Izip ram khe ae phah cih oh; te na ri oh paw ccakanccinaw nynh nae nulang te ae deehui cih oh zah, tuin kya na chih cih oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Izip ram lang ccia lan zah khuasah lan, cite bya a paekuh hae paw balyn tuh thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate a chih cih hae; mih tungvaw ka thuasah cih paw shethya kyate lue zah a laehypaw te ahiinhypaw um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka thinrianaw te ka bungpawnaw kha Jerusalem um hae paw tungvaw kya buu athua hawte, Izip ram lang he na cceih oh te, ka bungpawnaw kha nae tungvaw buu athua cih. Nanning tuh anungsikuhpaw, ri lan umpaw, thyalawpaw te sarisarya nungpaw lang na tang cih oh. E hmin hynh na muihthui vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou a laehypaw Judah hae, Izip ram lang cceih nan oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae hopya vae oh. Na mesei vae oh, cite <verse number="20" style="v" />atunin raeringnaw kae pya oh paw hynh hoyte nyh oh. Pawccecize naemaw ccaccei nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kalan nae saw oh zah, ‘Kaening hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kalan saw oun sangpah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia nynh a hopaw miakaw kha kaening oun hopah lah, kae cyih cih,’ nae cipya oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atunin kae hopya vae oh, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning hopya lan yn nawpaw bya miakaw kha papin na zui khyh oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuasah khylan na ccianua ry oh paw hmin kyakhe thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate na chi lan oh paw kha hoyte nykuh oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip Ram lang Jeremiah Cciakhaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia nynh Jeremiah kha ccungccaw balyn kalan hopya lan a sawnuathepaw a bya balyn kha Jeremiah nynh he a hopah kou hae tuh, <verse number="2" style="v" />Hoshaiah ccapaw Azariah, Kareah ccapaw Johanan te a lysakuh hae paw balyn nynh Jeremiah kha, “Hynbya nynh na ho. ‘Izip ram kya um khylan cceih nan oh,’ cite ho khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh nang kha ae saw khyh; <verse number="3" style="v" />Khaldi hae nynh kaening kha chia khylan, tuhkhyhze kyngte Babilon lang cciakhae khylan cite Khaldi hae kuih kalan ap khylan Neriah ccapaw Baruk nynh nang kha ae tuhou,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhcite Judah ram kya um lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopya hae paw bya kha Kareah ccapaw Johanan, rhawbawi hae balyn te ccungccaw balyn nynh ngae khyh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />A deenaw hae ram takyh kyate Judah ram kya um khylan oun kithui hae paw Judah hae a laehy hae paw balyn kha Kareah ccapaw te rhawbawi hae nynh a cciakhae hae—<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43.5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:26">2Si 25.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />nopi, pise, imua, siapharan ccanung hae te rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh Shafan ccapaw Ahikam a ccapaw Gedaliah kya a cciataw hae paw miakaw, te profeh Jeremiah te Neriah ccapaw Baruk kha mah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae leite Izip ram lang cceih hae zah, Tahpanhes khua a thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Tahpanhes khua kya Jeremiah kya yn thua zah: <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung alepaw hae kha na kuih te lah lah, Tahpanhes khua kya Faro siapharan inn lang teenaw kya-e anglae phaekuhpaw laanpi khe uutua. Tuhcite na cyipaw tuh Judah hae nynh muih hae sah lah, <verse number="10" style="v" />minmin kyakhe, Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka ryalahtu Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kha ka kosah cih hae zah, aning nynh a bawitungkhung kha, ka uupaw e lung hae vawlan khe a nung cih, te khah-e hae luki khe a siapharan boeibu kha a dawkhaw cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar tuh yn thua cih zah, Izip ram kha a roh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">shethya te chia lan accan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya te a theih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyngte ramccang lang</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhae lan accan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te chia lan accan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi te a theih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh Izip pachia hae beikinn hae kha maee te a soi cih; khah-e hae kha maee te a soi cih hae zah ccaring a cciakhae cih hae; tuurinpaw nynh a boeining kya-e sih kha a law hawte, Izip ram kha a lah cih zah tuin kyate khyndadyh lan a poutaw cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Izip ram e Heliopolis khua a umpaw lungbing hae kha a khya cih; Izip pachia hae beikinn hae kha maee te a soi cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh hae kha Seisahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izip ram e Migdol khua, Tahpanhes khua, Memfis khua te Patharos ram a umpaw Judah hae hanlan Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw bya: <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Jerusalem te Judah ram e khua hae balyn tungvaw ka thuakhaepaw shethya balyn kha nanning nynh phe na muih vae oh. Minmin kha dotua oh; atu lya ccungccaw a um lei lan ciate phe adae, <verse number="3" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh thuasah, nanning nynh thuasah, nae minpaaw hae nynh thuasah na la ny boi lei oh paw ccangpaw pachia hae kalan silawnaw rae khylan te ryalawpya khylan ccianua hae zah, ka thinriasahte hoyleinaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu profeh hae balyn kha apaekuh lei lan nae kalan ka saw hae zah, “Ka huapaw hynh-e anungsikuhpaw uccaw hynh na cyi khyh nawlan oh, kae ngia oh!” cite ae hopya oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh mih hoyleinaw kyate maeleihku lanpaw te ccangpaw pachia hae kalan silawnaw rae lei lanpaw kha ngae khyh hae zah mih nakaring tuakuh khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thinrianaw te ka bungpawnaw kha ka bu zah, Judah ram e khua hae te Jerusalem khua e laanpi hae kyakhe maee lang arua; tuh-e hae tuh accakaepaw te ccungccaw adaenaw hmin lang a tang hae, atunin cia tuhcite po a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: A laehypaw ccungccaw a um lei lan ciate, Judah hae laku kyate nopi te pise, imua te nosi kha zosah khylan, pawccemou hynhcihawpaw vawsawnaw alepaw hynh naemaw toulou nynh nae tungvaw na thuakhaeku oh? <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ccianua oh zah na umnaw oh Izip ram kyahin ccangpaw pachia hae kalan silawnaw raete, nae kuih ryalawnaw khate kae hynh pawccemou ka thin nae riasah oh? Laephi vaw e minphuin hae balyn laku kya thyalawnawpaw te saryanawpaw lang tangte vua na thua cih oh tou? <verse number="9" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae nynh thuasah, Judah siapharan hae nynh thuasah, mih zu hae te naemaw te nae zu hae nynh thuasah Judah ram kya te Jerusalem laanpi hae kya na rae oh paw nae seinaw hae kha phe na ning vae oh tou? <verse number="10" style="v" />Atunin cia ngaesikunaw khyhze rawrinaw kha na langsakuh khyh oh, nanning te nae minpaaw hae malang ka nungpaw ka phungbya hae te ka kawbya kha na zui khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae tungvaw shethya thuakhae lanpaw te Judah hae maemih lanpaw kha bya ka paeku vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Izip ram kya um khylan ccia lan cite byapaekuh hae paw Judah phin a laehy hae paw kha ka cciakhae cih hae zah, mih balynte a chih cih hae; Izip ram kya a khuliakuh cih hae; thaloi te ccakanccinaw khate a chih cih hae; adih huapaw kyate ale huapaw kyacia thaloi te ccakanccinaw khate a chih cih hae; anungsikuhpaw te ri lan umpaw lang a tang cih hae zah, thyalawnawpaw te saryanawpaw lang a tang cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem kha thaloi, ccakanccinaw te shethya khate de ka tah vae hawte, Izip ram um hae paw kha de ka tah cih hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />tuhteze nynh Izip ram lang um lan a cceih hae paw Judah hae a laehy hae paw tuh lue lan khyh hae, hiin lan khyh hae zah Judah ram lang kithui lan khyh hae. Judah ram lang a ki ry hae zemah, rhaw kyate a khyn hae paw holeite tuh kithui vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh mih zu hae nynh ccangpaw pachia hae kalan silawnaw a rae hae paw kong a nyh hae paw pise hae balyn, mih pe a thadyn hae paw nopi hae balyn, myarya lung hae paw zapi hae te Izip ram Pathros khua um hae paw balyn nynh Jeremiah kha byakhung hae zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te nae hopyapaw bya kha kaening nynh kae ngaepah lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhlaetuh, Judah ram e khua hae kya te Jerusalem e laanpi hae kyakhe kaening te kae minpaaw hae, kae siapharan hae te kae bawi hae nynh kae la cyimae hawte, vaaw siapharannung kalan silawnaw kae rae cih zah amaw kalan niapaw silawnaw kha kae rae cih, bya kae kinku vae thyhte atyn-are kae cyih cih. Tuhte kae la cyih zah looh patae leih kae hoi, kae hoirum zah vawsawnaw mah kae la tung boi khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama vaaw siapharannung kalan silawnaw rae leite kae um zah, niapaw silawnaw kha kae rae vae khyh zetuh, atyn-are ahoboupaw lang kae tang zah, thaloi te ccakanccinaw khate kae chih vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te nopi hae nynh, “Vaaw siapharannung kalan silawnaw kha po kae rae cih zah, niapaw silawnaw kha po kae rae cih; kae vawpaw hae nynh a ny lei lan hae te vaaw siapharannung hanlan amaw muinsan lo lante sanlou kha kae raepah zah, niapaw silawnaw kha kae rae, cite tou nae tua?” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhcite Jeremiah kalan bya a khungru hae paw balyn, nopi te pise balyn kha Jeremiah nynh byakhung hae zah: <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nanning te nae minpaaw hae, nae siapharan hae te nae bawi hae, e ram kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh Judah ram e khua hae te Jerusalem khua e laanpi hae kya silawnaw na rae oh paw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh liathui khyh tou? A thinlung kya nung khyh tou? <verse number="22" style="v" />Hoyleinaw na rae oh paw te anungsikuhpaw na rae oh paw kha muih zah ngaesang kho vae khyh; tukeiccuze nae ram tuh ccungccaw um leite, adaepaw, accakaepaw te thyalawpaw ram lang a tang vae, tuhcite atunin cia a um vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanning nynh silawnawpaw maee na u oh keiccu thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw na sei oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae leite, a kawbya, a phungbya te a phunglang kha na zui khyh oh keiccu thuasah atunin alangku hawte, e shethya hynh nae tungvaw a thua vae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh ccungccaw balyn te nopi balyn kha, “Izip ram a um hae paw Judah hae nanning balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh, <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning te nae zu hae nynh, ‘Kaening nynh vaaw siapharannung kalan silawnaw rae lan te niapaw silawnawpaw kha bu lan cite bya kae kinku vae thyhte kae cyih cih,’ cite bya te na ho oh paw kha nae cyisahnaw te na ccingsah vae oh. Bya na kinku oh paw kha tynsah oh lah, niapaw silawnaw kha rae ccaleih oh! <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Izip ram a um hae paw Judah hae nanning balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, Izip ram pynpi kya Judah hae lu kheit munglae nynh sanmah, ‘Bawipaw PACHIA tuh a hiin,’ cite ka min kha a ho vae khyh nawlan, alesaepaw ka min te bya ka kinku, a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nae tungvaw hoynaw pya khylan thua leite, hoyleinaw ccawsah khylan kae dokhaw cih oh; Izip ram a um hae paw Judah hae balyn tuh lu kheit san a laehy lei lan ciate thaloi te ccakanccinaw khate aroh cih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te thaloi kyate lue zah Izip ram kyate Judah ram lang a kipaw milu tuh azya cih; Izip ram lang khuasah lan a thua hae paw Judah hae a laehy hae paw balyn nynh, minmin bya tou atyn, tuhkhyhze kae ka bya tou atyn, cipaw kha a nyh cih hae. <verse number="29" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, Nanning rawsenawpaw ka bya tuh solei accing cih cipaw na ny nawlan oh, e hmin kya nanning detah lanpaw muihsahnaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah siapharan Zedekiah kha a hiinnaw a ccungpaw, a rhaw athuapaw Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar kuih kalan ka pya hawte, Izip siapharan Faro Hofra kha a hiinnaw a ccung hae paw a rhaw hae kuih kalan ka pya cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">2Si 25.1-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Baruk hanlan Lungtangnaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw kum kya, Jeremiah nynh a opya thyhte Baruk nynh e bya hae kha ccakue kya a zei lyaze, profeh Jeremiah nynh Neriah ccapaw Baruk kalan a hopyapaw bya tuh hynhte nynh thua:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">2Si 24.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou Baruk, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh na kalan hynhte a ho: <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang nynh, “Ka tungvaw ngaethya lan kou um! Ka lungriathaenaw kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngaethyanaw kha yn biachih; ka hawkhaekunaw khate ka thawbang zah ngaengannaw ka hoi khyh,” na ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Baruk kha hynhte hopya tua: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ka sak vae paw kha ka phou cih zah, ka lin vae paw kha poh ka khaee cih—tuh-e tuh e ram pynpi hynh nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang nynh namaw hanlan myarya lepaw uccaw hae kha na ccungku tou? Khah-e hae kha ccungkuh nan; pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tungvaw shethya ka thuasah cih; thuasalama nang tuh na thuanaw miakaw kyakhe na hiinnaw kha rhawtuknaw kya-e lasung hawte kae pya cih, a ci,” cite a cipya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip tungvaw Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minphuin hae konglangte Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw Jehoiakim nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw kum khe, Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Zufrates vawkhu kin e Karkhemish khua kya a taepaw Izip siapharan Faro Neko a rhawkaw hae te asekuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.2-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:1-25">Isa 19.1-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Eze 29.1—32.32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawriaphua adihpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">alepaw kha paccyn oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk lan malang cceih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Marang hae kha ade de oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">cciku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Sivawlukhung kha khungkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ccoi kha tawkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw angki kha kiku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawkeiccumou a rih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ka muih hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tuh nulang a ki hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhawkaw hae tuh shung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">thawte a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nulang dohui khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih pepan balyn rinaw te phe abeih!</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Myarya rang lan a ccue</para>
  <para style="q2">kho hae paw mah lue kho khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae mah lue kho khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Palung lang Zufrates vaw pe khe</para>
  <para style="q2">thykuh hae zah a khuliakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nal vaw athopaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alepaw vaw hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thokuhpaw tuh hummou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izip tuh Nal vaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alepaw vaw hawte thuasah yn thokuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka le cih, laephi kha ka bong cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae te tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw kha ka roh cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou marang hae, malang cceih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou marangle hae, thawte ccue oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Rhawkaw hae tuh malang cceih hae sah:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ethiopia hae te khawriaphua</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccyngkuh hae paw Put hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">the te li kawthya hae paw Ludi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">malang cceih hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin nin tuh vaaw PACHIA Bawipaw nin,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rhaw hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">thyaaccounaw mue khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">liaru nin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thaloi nynh a ae cih zah a byn cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih chii kha phe byn lan a neih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize vaaw PACHIA, Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">palung lang ram Zufrates vaw kin khe</para>
  <para style="q2">silawnaw kha a rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou ccanung liaccady Izip,</para>
  <para style="q2">Gilead lang cceihthung lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">dannawpaw balm sii kha lawtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">sii patae kha alakaw lan na mang vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">dannaw na muelae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na maethyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh a thae vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na rawnaw tuh laephi pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe azeihkuh; rhawkaw lu kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw lu kheit kyakhe thykuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">parouh mawte a khuliakuh hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon nynh Izip A Tuk Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Izip ram kha tuk khylan yn ccianua lanpaw kong, profeh Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:10-13">Jer 43.10-13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izip ram kya ho oh lah, Migdol kya,</para>
  <para style="q2">Memfis kya te Tahpanhes kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Umnaw dokute paccynkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nae pepan um hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi nynh a laang vae</para>
  <para style="q2">cih hae,” cite thaesah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccemou Apis tuh a ccue?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou nae zohtuh tangnuapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thadyn khyh?</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuu zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a khulia keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nae ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thykuh hae zah a khuliakuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">te lu kheit te lu kheit hokuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Thoku tua, a rosah thyapaw thaloi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ahmaw ccungccaw hae kalan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah puinaw ram lang ki oh sih,” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izip siapharan Faro kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Amaw ccyhhoy kha a liasah hanpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bya ccakaepaw,” cite minphu oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A min vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a cikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Siapharan nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh ka hiin thyhte, mua hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">Tabor mua hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rili kin umpaw Karmel mua hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e siapharan tuh yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou ccanung Izip,</para>
  <para style="q2">kyngkute ramccang lang</para>
  <para style="q1">cciakhaeku khylan paccynkute umtua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize Memfis khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">alakawpaw, arohpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um leipaw lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Izip tuh apuithyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaetua tohlaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah palung langte</para>
  <para style="q2">kaekih nynh a thuanua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ram lungkhu e hohpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae heize</para>
  <para style="q1">thobaleihpaw vaetuataw te nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a loku hae; minmin mah</para>
  <para style="q1">maeleihkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thadyn leite a ccuekheih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin ronaw nin,</para>
  <para style="q2">detahnaw ccyh nynh a thuanua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izip tuh a ccuepaw hupaw hawte a roi a saw;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize a rhaw hae patae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thing a nge hae paw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">hae khate oun ccianua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin tuh tungkhipaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">lung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">riatae a um khyh hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip a ramkaw tuh myarya azi zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh pong a nge cih hae.</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccanung Izip tuh maethya a ccou cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">thahlang e ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">kuih kalan ap athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Dotua, Thebes khua e Amon pachia tungvaw thuasah, Faro, Izip te a pachia hae te a siapharan hae, Faro te Faro a doliakuh hae paw tungvaw thuasah detahnaw ka thuasah cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin chia a ry hae paw Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar te a kuihkaw e bawi hae kuih kalan khe minmin kha ka ap cih hae. Tukoute Izip ram tuh langmawlya hawte ccungccaw bua a um cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Israel A Khum Cih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pou ka ryalahtu Jakob, rih nan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46.27-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:10-11">Jer 30.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Israel, na lungroh nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw kyate kae khum cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ciihan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a kyngnaw hae ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob tuh a kithui cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">thawdangte daebabi lan a um cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah Jakob kha</para>
  <para style="q2">risah lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Jakob, rih nan,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize na kya ka um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kae denaw ram hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka roh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama nang tuh kae roh lan khyh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang kha ahmete kae thuihei cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">detah leite ruarua tetuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae luesah lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Filistin hae kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Faro nynh Gaza a tuk mawze, Filistin hae konglangte profeh Jeremiah kya yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh hynhte nynh thua:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.1-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Isa 14.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eze 25.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Zef 2.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zek 9.5-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Dotua, palung langte tui yn le cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">paepae leikuhpaw tui alepaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">yn tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tui alepaw nynh ram pynpi te ram lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">umpaw balyn kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi te tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">pong avu cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw hae tuh a sia a rua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lungkhu um hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih marang hae ccukoh roi,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih marangle hae amiakuhpaw roi,</para>
  <para style="q1">marangle accu hae amiakuhpaw roi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nungpaaw hae kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawzya keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw hae kha kinua vae khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize Filistin hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw ccyh te</para>
  <para style="q1">Tair te Sidon khua kyate a laehypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">bawmtu miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ronaw ccyh tuh yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Filistin hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a laehypaw Kaftor tuikoih kya-e hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza tuh a lu phe o lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a sang ngo athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ashkelon hae tuh zya adae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou a laehypaw Filistin hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Hohseciamou naemaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaemaw na muesakuh ung cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thaloi!</para>
  <para style="q2">Hohseciamou dae leite na um ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na thaloibu lungkhu lang sangkuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">daetedae lan umtua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ashkelon khua te</para>
  <para style="q2">rili kin um hae paw kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya</para>
  <para style="q2">vae keiccuze pawtemou</para>
  <para style="q1">daebabi lan a um kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e tuh cyi khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rya phe a naw vae.</para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moab kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab ram konglangte,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.1-47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Isa 15.1—16.14</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eze 25.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Nebo khua hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um, phe roh vae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Kiriathaim tuh law thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawlungrua kha tingbung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab minthaannaw tuh um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Rhaw hae nynh Moab kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">Heshbon khe hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuakhankuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Rang oh, minphuin phuin kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">athuanaw kyate vua oh sih!” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Madmen khua, nang mah ro na thua cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi nynh nang kha ae deehui cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim khua e siaruanaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ccungccaw kharouh daenaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw ronaw!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Moab ram tuh aroh vae!”</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab ram e imua hae tuh a siarua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhith lang kaethungnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccihtaci lan rawkhuite a kaethung hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Horonaim lang rungbungnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathae thinphangnaw roi kha a thae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccue oh! Na lue oh ccaw ccue oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Laesia ram e lann hawte ccue oh!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thanccingte, na thawzung te</para>
  <para style="q2">na sisua kha na doliaku keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nang mah ae lah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na pachia Khemosh tuh a ranpibawi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalahtu hae ryte kyngte</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang lang a cciakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rohtu hae tuh khua takyh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aluepaw khua um lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">accya tuh azo cih zah, bialae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aroh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab hanlan shawkulung bingpah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize aning tuh solei a khulia vae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a khua hae tuh ccungccaw a um leinaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">adaepaw khua lang a tang vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalaw kya a sawphahkuhpaw tuh thyalawnaw tung sah; chiise luasah nawlan a thaloi a mang ry leipaw tuh thyalawnaw tung sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab tuh misu ahaaw vawlan e atui hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">a zawthaw lya mawte ngaengante a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh ang angkheit kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">angkheit kalan lia boi khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kyngte ramccang lang cciakhae boi khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze misutui tuh athuanaw zo khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">amynkhuhnaw mah zo khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Minmin kha misutui hawte lia khylan a liatu hae kha ka sawnuanaw ccyh tuh solei yn thua cih; minmin nynh Moab ang hae kha khaleih a lae cih hae zah, a lungre hae kha palae tui lan a koi cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Israel phin tuh a doliakupaw Bethel pachia keiccu maethyanaw a mue hawte, Moab tuh Khemosh pachia keiccu maethya a ccou cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Aening tuh rawhoy hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">athawsaepaw rhawkaw hae nynh ah thua oh,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite pawtemou na ho kho oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab te a khua hae a rohtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn cceihthung vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a po hae paw ccangvae hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">chiakunaw teing khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">a cceihbung vae hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a min vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">acihkuhpaw Siapharan nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab hanlan shethya tuh anae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ronaw tuh arangte yn naekuh vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moab pepan um hae paw balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">a min a nyh hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab hanlan rah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Athungpaw ccoi, aphu-epaw hoitang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe khya vae rei!” cite ho oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccanung Dibon khua e</para>
  <para style="q2">bawitungkhung kya a haung hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw kyate rungbung oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laerou vawlan haungtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab a rohtu nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ccianua thung vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">na rhawlungrua kha a ro vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou Aroer khuaccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi pe khe thadyn oh lah, dotua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">A ccuepaw pisepaw te a luepaw nopinung kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawmou acyihkuh?” cite khiatua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab tuh aro vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite a siarua vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab tuh phe roh vae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Arnon vaw pe khe ho oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mua vaw bialae e khua hae, Holon, Jahzah, Mefath, <verse number="22" style="v" />Dibon, Nebo, Beth-diblathaim, <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Beth-gamul, Beth-meon, <verse number="24" style="v" />Kerioth te Bozrah khua hae kya thuasah, asawnaw te anaenaw umpaw Moab ram e khua hae balyn kya byapianaw a thua vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ki kha moi thua vae zah, a kuihbaw kha khya athua vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab kha ruisah oh, pawccecize aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rawse zah a pooku; Moab tuh amaw a lua kyakhe kalouhkuh sah lah, nuinsepaw lang tang sah. <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel tuh miruh hae ryte kyngkheihpaw athua lei pite, nang nynh na sarya; aning kong na ho takyhte sarisarya na nung!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pou Moab kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae kha cciataw oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkarung kya um oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Lungkarung arae kya a bu a luakuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vahu te lokuh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab nynh a lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe kae thae vae—</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh myarya a lysakuh—</para>
  <para style="q1">a tansakunaw, a lysakunaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungkhungnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinlung a hangsahkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe kae thae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei nynh a lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ny vae, a pookunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw thua zah, a cyisahnaw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw nynh thua, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Moab hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite ka um;</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab hae balyn hanlan ka rah;</para>
  <para style="q2">Kir-heres ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rah ka khui.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pou Sibmah misu ku,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jazer khua hanlan laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">nang na hanlan ka rahhua!</para>
  <para style="q2">Na misu akaran hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">rili po khung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jazer cia phe thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">hawnin e na thingthae hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">na misu thae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rohtu hae nynh a ro vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moab ram hoypaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw te lungpawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">law athua vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">misu mianaw khu kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">misutui kha ka kansah vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua siaruate misu thae a nonpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit san um vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruanaw tuh lungtua</para>
  <para style="q1">siaruanaw thua vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Heshbon khua te Elealeh khua tuh rah hae zah, mih rawnaw roi tuh Jahaz cia athan, Zoar khua te mah thae hae zah, Horonaim te Eglath-shelishiyah kyacia athan. Pawccecize Nimrim vaw taraw heize phe akan. <verse number="35" style="v" />Te Moab ram e ahangnaw hmin kya silawnaw a rae hae paw te mih pachia hae kalan a pyatu hae kha ka zosah cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thinlung tuh Moab hanlan phyly hawte a khui, te ka thinlung tuh Kir-heres ccungccaw hae hanlan phyly hawte a khui; pawccecize a mue hae paw mih hoirumnaw tuh phe roh vae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw mih lu a okuh hae, mih khawming a ngokuh hae, mih kuih awkuh hae zah, mih tae kya buriboei a voiku hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab ram e innccukaly miakaw kya te khualae e laanpi hae kyakhe rawkhuinaw rou nynh a um; pawccecize humhung nynh mah a ry lei vae paw ang hawte, Moab kha ka koi vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="39" style="v" />Moab tuh phe koi vae ccarei! Rawkhuite a um vae rei! Moab tuh maethyate nulang a sihkuh vae rei! Tukeiccuze Moab tuh a sarya hae paw lang tang vae zah, a pepan e ram balyn nynh a ri hae paw lang a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Dotua, aning nynh mosi hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab kha a uingnuakuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a sake a dawnua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khua hae te rhawlungrua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a lah cih hae. Tuin nin vae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab rhawkaw hae thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia accihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung thinlung te alokuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moab nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawse zah a pooku keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">aroh cih zah minphuin</para>
  <para style="q2">phuin kheit thua vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pou Moab ram um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">rinaw, hunghua te kaang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae malang phang um hae! cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Rinaw kyate a ccue hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hunghua lungkhu lang accah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">te hunghua lungkhu kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a lue hae paw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kaang kya a kae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Detahnaw a mue kum hae khe,</para>
  <para style="q2">e uccaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab tungvaw ka thuasah cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Rhaw kyate oun lue hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawbang keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">Heshbon mynlyh kya a haeung hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Heshbon khua kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">Sihon siapharan inn kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">maeesoi apou keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab ramri hae te rhawdou</para>
  <para style="q2">a ry hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">mua ahang hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e maee nynh a u vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Pou Moab, na hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Khemosh pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">a beik hae paw tuh a roh vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ccanung hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kyng hae zah a cciakhae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuhzemah Moab hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nyalang ccyh kya bua ka kikhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q2">E kyacia hynh Moab tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">byapianaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ammon hae kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon hae konglang</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel nynh ccapaw hae saahkuh khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Rhoccoutu hoi khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Athua lanze, pawccemou</para>
  <para style="q2">Milkom pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Gad ram kha lah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Gad ram e khua hae kyakhe a um hae?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.1-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eze 21.28-32</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 25:1-7">25.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ammon hae khua Rabbah khe</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknaw roi ka ccaesah ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">solei yn thua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Rabbah tuh arohpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khua taraw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maee te soi athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel kya-e a luade hae paw ram kha</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel nynh bua a lua cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a lah cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pou Heshbon, rawkhuite umtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize Ai khua tuh aroh vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Rabbah ccanung hae, rah oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Buriboei zingkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyate um oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">buanawpaw ccungngue khate</para>
  <para style="q2">naemaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q1">vaemaw muesaku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize Milkom pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a ranpibawi hae te a ryalahtu hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">a kyng cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang lang a cciakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou a lungzi leipaw ccanung,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou na thawzung liate na pooku?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na thawzung tuh athang cciamang vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na sisua kha na doliakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Hum nynh mou rhaw yn tuk cih?” na ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">nae pepan um hae paw balyn kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">rinaw kha kae thuakhaepah cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning lu kheit cci tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">rangkhirangkhaete na ccue cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae ae nung cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw kyate a khyn hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sueluatu lu kheit san um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama, tukoute tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Ammon hae kha ka kikhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Edom kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom ram konglangte</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Teman ram kya hawnaw um vae khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuanaw hoi hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuanaw pya vae khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih hawnaw tuh azo vae tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.7-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou Dedan khuaccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang maeleihkute ccue oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rekuh oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Esau nynh a tungpaw shethya,</para>
  <para style="q2">detahnaw ccyh kha mih tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Misu thae lotu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kalan oun thua hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccamua kha cciataw khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Miruh hae nynh khuazi oun thua hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ry hae paw kyalya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lawkuh khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Esau a uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khah zah a sasete ka nung,</para>
  <para style="q1">rekunaw hmin a hoi lei lan ciate,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rekunaw hmin kha pong ka langsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">A ciihan hae, a uno hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a innpaw hae kha ro athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw mah um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngawraw hae kha cciataw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw nynh ka do-oih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na nomae hae nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn doliakuh hae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Banang kha nia lan accan lei hae paw nynh a nia hae ze, nang tuh detahnaw kha na lue cih zawtou? Detahnaw kha na lue lan khyh; tuh-e banang tuh na neih hahe cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Bozrah khua tuh ri lan umpaw, saryapaw te ccungccaw adaepaw khua lang a tang cih zah, thyalaw nawlan a mang cih hae; te a pepan e khua hae balyn tuh ccungccaw adae zungzae cih, cite kamaw ccaccei nynh bya ka kinku, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate the ka thae:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Nanning nynh pynkheihlan</para>
  <para style="q2">sueluakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Edom kha tuk oh, rhawtuk khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">thokuh oh!” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">locceihtu kha saw athua vae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hynh minphuin hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">adih huapaw lang te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a theihrya hae paw lang kae rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ri lan na umnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">na lysakunaw thinlung nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ae ling vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh lungpi akoinaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a umpaw te mua ahangnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a reihpekuhpaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mosipi hawte ahangnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">bu na luaku zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kyate nang kha kae sahbung cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom ram tuh ri lan umpaw lang a tang cih; a pe a cceihpaw miakaw tuh mih ngaeangthua cih zah, aning nynh a tungpaw shethya keiccuze saryanaw roi a sawnua cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom, Gomorrah te mih pepan e khua hae hawte aroh cih zah, tuin kya khuasahpaw te a umpaw lu kheit san um lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Gen 19.24-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Jordan vaw kin thing alungnaw kyate sarangpaw hae rampaeekunaw hae kalan yn cceihthungpaw chindeih hawte, Edom kha ccaring ka dee cih zah, ka popaw kha Edom kya ka nung cih. Pawccecize kae yn lopaw hummou a um? Kae yn ngankuhpaw hummou a um? Ka malang a thadyn nganpaw tuurintu a um tou? <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Edom tungvaw a paccyn nuapaw te Teman ram um hae paw hanlan a eenaw kha thaetua oh: Tuuphu kya-e a nohua hae paw kha ccaring a cciakhae ccaccing cih hae; mih tuukhia kya-e tuu hae tuh mih tungvaw acyihkuhpaw keiccuze a siikuh ccaccing cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin a khuliaku hae paw roi keiccuze laephi tuh a hy cih; a sia hae paw roi tuh Rili Se kyate heize thae athua cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Rhaw tuh cceihthung zah, mosi hawte Bozrah khua kha uingnuakuh zah a sake a dawnua; tuin nin kya Edom rhawkaw hae thinlung tuh neitangia accihpaw nopi hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Damaskas kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damaskas khua konglangte,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Hamath te Arpad nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thethyapaw a thae hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">phe siikuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">rih hae zah mih lungvawsaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">adae kho leipaw rili hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinphang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.23-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Isa 17.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Zek 9.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaskas tuh a thawzya vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccue khylan a maeleihkuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bungzou zah neitangia accihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hawte lungriathaenaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">teingnaw nynh a thuanua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A minthaanpaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athua vae ccarei!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khuapi lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangvae hae tuh khualae e</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi hae kya a khuliakuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin nin khe a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ro athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damaskas khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te ka soi cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Benhadad siapharan inn hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh a u cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kedar te Hazor kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh a taepaw Kedar ram te Hazor peenaw hae konglang kha</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Thokuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kedar ram kha ccianua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nithua lang e ccungccaw hae kha roh oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mih bu hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuuphu hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zokhawpaw mih boei hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih uccaw hae balyn kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">luade oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kalauh hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q1">suekuh oh, “Pawpaw kya balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lanpaw a um,” cite siapah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pou Hazor ram um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccue oh, asawnaw lang cceih oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">akhunaw hmin kya rekuh oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize Babilon Siapharan</para>
  <para style="q1">Nebukhadnezzar nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q1">khuakhan zah, ae paccynnuaku vae oh.</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thokuh oh, koikua te</para>
  <para style="q2">sakoihccaw hoi leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaengante khyndadyh lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a makhaete a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin kha ccianua oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mih kalauh hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sahiin phu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">luadepaw lang a tang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih nakalia a ngokuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">teitei lang balyn phiariphiarae</para>
  <para style="q2">pong ka nung cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hmin takyh kyate shethya kha mih tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuasah cih,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor ram tuh suizaw karung,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw zungzae adaenaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tangsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya humhung mah um lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit nynh sanmah tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khuasah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Elam kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh Judah siapharan lang a tang takaw lyakhe, Elam ram konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh profeh Jeremiah kya yn thua zah,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Elam thawzung kyaze abyapi huapaw a li kha ka khyapah cih; <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmin takyh kyate khisan phuin pali kha Elam lang ka zawsah cih; e khisan hae balyn khate minmin kha phiariphiarae a um lan hae ka mungsah cih hae, kyngte ramccang lang a cciakhae hae paw Elam hae nynh a thuanua lei hae paw ram um lan khyh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Elam hae kha mih rhaw hae malang te mih hiinnaw a ccung hae paw malang khe ka risah cih hae; myarya lepaw ka thinrianaw shethya kha mih tungvaw ka thuasah cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Minmin kha ka maemih makhia hae, mih nulangte thaloi ka sawnua cih hae; <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka bawitungkhung kha Elam ram kya ka nung cih zah, mih siapharan te mih bawi hae kha ka roh cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama Elam kha nyalang ccyh kya ka kikhae thui cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon khuapi, Khaldi hae ram konglangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh profeh Jeremiah a hopyapaw tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.1—51.64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Isa 13.1—14.23</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">47.1-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minphuin hae kha thaesah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuruh leite alan kha sae oh lah</para>
  <para style="q1">thaesah oh, hynhte ho oh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon khuapi tuh law athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Bel pachia tuh maethyanaw a mue vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Marduk pachia tuh a lungroh vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon a zohtuh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw mue hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungroh vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize palung lang e minphuin phuin kheit nynh Babilon kha yn ccianua vae, ccungccaw lu kheit san a um lei lan ciate ccungccaw phe a daesah cih; ccungccaw te sarangpaw hae tuh pong a ccue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Tuin nin vae tuh Israel hae te Judah hae tuh pynkheihlan a cceih cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha rawkhuite a ccung cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion langkhe mih mitmae hawite, Zion lang cceihpaw laanpi kha a khia cih hae, te ning kho a um vae cih leipaw, zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a cceih cih hae zah a tungkuh vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae tuh azopaw tuu hae nynh thua vae hae; mih tuurin hae nynh mua hae vawlan khe a cciakhaesei vae hae; mua muakheit kyate muakheit kalan cceih hae zah, mih tuukhia kha a ning vae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />A muihpaw balyn nynh minmin kha a ae cih hae zah, mih rhaw hae nynh, “Aening tuh ah sei khyh oh, pawccecize a paeenaw hae ahmepaw ramno athuapaw te mih paaw hae nynh a doliakuh hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw khe minmin nynh a sei hae keiccu nynh thua,” cite a hoku vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon kyate ccue oh, Khaldi hae ram kyate pou oh lah, miaa phu a cciakhaepaw miaatepaw hae hawte thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Bya 18.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize thahlang e minphuin le hae paw aphu kha ka tuhou cih zah, Babilon lang ka cciakhae cih hae; Babilon kha paccynnuakute a tuk cih hae zah a lah cih hae. Mih the tuh kuih ccakaete a kihan leipaw, thekawthyapaw rhawkawpaw the hawte athua cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khaldi ram tuh luadepaw lang a tang cih zah, luadetu hae tuh phe a byn cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou ka rho ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rohtu hae, nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtua lungpawte na um oh zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua vawlan sakalialaw a leihpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">vaetua tohlaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua oh zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rangtepaw hawte na sia oh zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nae nung tuh maethyanaw a mue cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning ae saahnung oh tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thethya a ccou cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon tuh ram hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q1">anyaa huaccepaw, ramkaw, ramrou te</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw phe adaepaw ram athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon pe po a cceihpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">miakaw tuh a siikuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a vaemaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">saryanaw roi a sawnua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />The te li a ccyngkuh hae paw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha koihlute</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuk lan paccynnuakuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae the kha nungban leite kaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw phe a sei vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Teitei lang balyn te Babilon kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Aning tuh a shung vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a rhaw thungkhawnawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khualungrua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ating vae,” cite sianua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize hynh-e hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liarunaw nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">a tungvaw liaru oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a la cyi hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a tungvaw cyihru oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babilon ram kya ccacii a tupaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">loohrue ccyh lya rungkou te</para>
  <para style="q1">looh a ruepaw kha theih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw rohtupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi keiccuze mih balynte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccungccaw hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">a ki cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw ram lang khaleih</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel tuh chindeih hae nynh sawde te a dee hae paw tuu hae hawte nynh thua. Assiria siapharan nynh masaty ae hae zah, atu athangnaw kya Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh a ru kha a ree. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Assiria siapharan kha de ka tah hawte, Babilon siapharan te a ram kha de ka tah cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel kha a paeenaw hmin lang ka kikhae cih zah, Karmel mua te Bashan mua vawlan khe ram a paeekuh cih, Efraim sangpyng hae te Gilead mua vawlan khe phe byn lan a ae cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin nin te tuin ccyh khe, Israel a hoyleinaw kha ccung athua cih zah muih thua lan khyh; Judah seinaw kha muih thua lan khyh; pawccecize ka haang vae hae paw, a laehy hae paw seinaw kha ka ngaethya cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merathaim ram kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">ccianua thung oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Pekod ram kya um hae paw kha tuk oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha phe thang lan khaleih roh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kaw kae pya</para>
  <para style="q2">oh paw balyn kha cyih oh,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin ram kya rhawtuknaw roi te</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw ronaw roi kha accae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Laephi pynpi a tudepaw khynlyng tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">bae thua zah phe khya vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon tuh minphuin hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw lang a tang vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pou Babilon, namaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaang na syakhawkuh zah na kae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama tuh-e tuh na nyh khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na rawse ngan keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae muih hae zah ae kyng vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a zunghe inn kha hung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw zunghe hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a toikhaekuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize vaaw Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi ram kya cyi lan a hoipaw rya nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Teitei langte balyn yn ccianua oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccung-inn hae kha hung oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">looh apumkuhpaw hawte pum oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khaleih roh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">paw sanmah alaepaw um nan sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A tangnua hae balyn kha theih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawchianaw kalan marya cciasah bung oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin hanlan ngaethya lan kou um, mih ccyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin detahnaw nin tuh a thua vae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngaetua oh! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia phulawnaw, a beikinn a ropya hae keiccuze phulawnaw kong kha Zion kya siakhae khylan, Babilon ram kyate ccue hae zah a lue hae paw roi tuh accae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babilon dou khylan thekawthya hae paw balyn kha pum oh. Babilon kha po voilu lan ryahmin tahnuakuh oh, lu kheit san lue nan sah. A cyisahnaw thyhte amaw kha liaru oh; a cyi hawte a tungvaw cyihru oh, pawccecize Israel Pachia Athyaapaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha pawlangria leite a dou vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:6">Bya 18.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a ccangvae hae tuh khualae e laanpi hae kya a khuliakuh cih hae zah, tuin nin khe a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh ro athua cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vaaw Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou lungkhungpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae rawse,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">de kae tah cihnaw ccyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccyh tuh a thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lungkhungpaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thykuh cih zah a khuliakuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thotu lu kheit san um lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuapi kha maee te ka soi cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a pepan umpaw atyn-are kha pong a u cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Israel hae tuh tuaasahkunaw a teing hae, Judah hae mah tuhcite a teingbua hae; minmin a kyngtu hae balyn nynh minmin kha ccavyng kyng hae zah, cciasah lan phe a mya hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin Shawkhawtu tuh a thung, a min tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a cikuh. Aning nynh mih byathan kha a hokhae ccaccing cih hae zah, ram kha a daesah cih, thuasalama Babilon khuaccaaw hae kha tuh sasulalae a nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi hae, Babilon khuaccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">bawi hae te mihaw hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi accah cih!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A pawe hae paw tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi accah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mingaee lang a tang cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon rhawkaw hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi accah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh aroh cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Babilon marang hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a marangle hae tungvaw thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kya umpaw ramccang</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae balyn tungvaw thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi accah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hawte athua cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon a sisua hae balyn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi accah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a luade cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khuaakannaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon tui tuh karae arou cih!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize Babilon tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh ram thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh zohtuh hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaeekhaekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze loramsaw hae tuh ram-ui hae ryte Babilon kya a umkheih cih hae zah, kalauh pavaw hae mah a um cih hae, Babilon tuh ccungccaw umnaw hmin, she takyh kya ccungccaw umpaw hmin thua boi vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:2">Bya 18.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v" />Pachia nynh Sodom, Gomorrah te mih pepan e khua hae kha a ro lya hawte, tuin kya a umtu te khuasahtu lu kheit san um vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Gen 19.24-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Dotua, minphuin phuin kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">palung langte yn cceih cciamang vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin athungpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan hae patae tuh laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungtho hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Minmin tuh li te ccoi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccyngkuh hae, mih rysawthah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccinaw hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih roi tuh rili roi te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q2">pou ccanung Babilon,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuk lan a paccynkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkawpaw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh marang ccikute</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae ccianua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e kong tuh thae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih a khua phe chih,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathaenaw nynh thuanua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">neitangia ccihpaw nopi hawte a teing.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jordan vaw kin thing alungnaw kyate zungzae hinlalyhpaw sarangpaw hae rampaeekunaw hae kalan yn cceihthungpaw chindeih hawte, minmin kha Babilon kyate ccaring ka dee kangmaw cih hae zah, ka popaw kha Babilon kya ka nung cih. Pawccecize kae yn lopaw hummou a um? Hum nynh mou kae kha tungku lan yn ko kho? Ka malang a thadyn nganpaw tuurintu a um tou? <verse number="45" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Babilon tungvaw a paccyn nuapaw te Khaldi ram kha rawsete eenaw a raenuapaw kha thaetua oh: Accaccing lante, tuuphu kya-e a nohua hae paw kha ccaring a sue cih hae; accaccing lante, mih tuukhia kya-e tuu hae nynh a tung hae paw keiccuze a siikuh cih hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Babilon kyng lya-e roi keiccuze laephi tuh ahy cih; a rawnaw roi tuh minphuin hae nynh a thae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon khua te</para>
  <para style="q1">Khaldi ram um hae paw kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">rohtu khivae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rohtu khivae, tuhkhyhze rohtu muisaw.</char></note> kha ka thosah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccangkung a vawthya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon lang ka saw cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon kha a vaw cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Vawsawnaw nin vae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">teitei langte balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thuanua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kha thyatethya lan a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thekawtupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">the kaw sah nan oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">sivaw angki mah kisakuh nan oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">A ccangvae hae kha hiin nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a rhawkaw hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">marya roh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaldi hae ram khe khuliakute</para>
  <para style="q2">a chih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi hae kyakhe vaemaw a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel Pachia Athyaapaw malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel ram te Judah ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw te phe abia zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha vua khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon kyate ccue oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae hiinnaw raveih kha khumkuh oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon seinaw keiccuze rohbua nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize e ccyh hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">phu a law ccyh thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha accan thyhte a liaru cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babilon tuh laephi pynpi a ruisahpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kya</para>
  <para style="q1">umpaw sui banang nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh a misutui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">neih hae zah, mih lung amua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:2-4">Bya 17.2-4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:3">18.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babilon tuh vaekheihmawte</para>
  <para style="q2">khuliakuh zah akoi;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning hanlan rah oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">A vaemaw hanlan balm isei kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lawpah oh; dan mah a dan kho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaening nynh Babilon kha</para>
  <para style="q2">dansah lan kae zuakuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama dan kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha vua oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahmaw ram raveih lang cceih oh sih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a teingpaw byapianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang phe phah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui cia phe a phya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:5">Bya 18.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening dingnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a langsaku vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">rang oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia ryalaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion kya siakhae oh sih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />The kha phe he lan taw oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">The bawng kya the kha phe biasah oh!</para>
  <para style="m">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Babilon kha ro lan a paccyn keiccuze Medes siapharan kha a lung a thosah vae, tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phulawnaw thua zah, a beikinn hanlan phulawnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babilon khualungrua te</para>
  <para style="q2">ahawiliakuh lante alan kha sae oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawviatu hae kha nungchih oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">santari ccungtu hae kha nung oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aruh lante abuhtu hae kha nung oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh paccyn zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon khuaccaaw hae konglang</para>
  <para style="q2">a la ho thyhte a cyi vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui patae a umnaw pe khe</para>
  <para style="q2">khuasah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sisua patae a hoipaw nang,</para>
  <para style="q1">na thangnaw ccyh a thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na hiinnaw rui kha pae athua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Bya 17.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a kinkupaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Thanccingte, tungkhipaw phu te</para>
  <para style="q2">alokuhpaw rhawkaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya phe ka biasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang taenaw roi kha a saw cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laephi kha a huhan te a raetupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi kha a hawnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a thadynsahtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha a thyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">tharae a dawtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A roi he a saw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kya tui roi</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya ccaepaw a um,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">tuihu kha a kaesah thung.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khuaaraw nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khozaw laesakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccakhungnaw kyakhate</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan kha a pousah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw hoi leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mingaee nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">suilaeethyapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">mih zohtuh hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a ccou hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih zohtuh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme leipaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kya hy um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin tuh alakawpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahynhupaw ryalaw nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin detahnaw ccyh khe</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh aroh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob hanpaw athuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynh-e hae hawte thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize aning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn-are a raetu thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel tuh a rho minphuin nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">a min tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> acikuh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Raetu Zunghe Israel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang tuh ka khynlyng,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuknawpaw ka zunghe nynh na thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha mangte minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan ka koi hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha mangte peenaw hae kha ka ro hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nang kha mangte marang te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccikuh hae paw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">marangle hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccikuh hae paw kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan ka khya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nang kha mangte nopi pise hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pise ataw vae paw te pise taraw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">liaccaw ccangvae hae kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan ka pae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nang kha mangte tuurin hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuuphu hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">leithue hae paw te mih vaetua hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">uktu hae te bawi hae kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">zoihtatyh lan ka khya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babilon khua te Khaldi ram um hae paw balyn nynh Zion kya a rae hae paw hoyleinaw balyn keiccuze minmin kha na muihnaw ccaccei khe ka liaru cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Laephi pynpi kha a rohpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">pou ro athyapaw mua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae rawse; nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kuih kae dyngnua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha lungpi karynkarenaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">kae toubung cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">te maee a upaw mua lang kae rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Inn apaki hanlan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">inn aleihpaw hanlan thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">na kyate lung kha lah lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh zungzae arohpaw na thua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ram lungkhu kya alan sae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae laku kya mungkae tu oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon kha tuk khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha paccyn oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha rawsete Ararat, Minni te</para>
  <para style="q2">Ashkenaz peenaw hae kha pum oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha rawsete rhawbawi lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit kha khang oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">marang hae kha tungkhipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">aphupi hawte cciakhae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babilon kha tuk khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha paccyn oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Medes siapharan hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ram uktu hae, bawi hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">mih uknaw kuihkaw umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram miakaw kha paccyn oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babilon ram tuh thyngkuh zah a teing,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon ram kha khuasahtu um leite</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw adaenaw ram lang</para>
  <para style="q2">rae lan a paccynnuaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk kha umtaw hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawlungrua te</para>
  <para style="q2">akoihlukunaw kyakhe zya a um hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thawthah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hae hawte athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon e inn hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te soi thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khua koikua ccong hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khya athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na khuapi tuh teitei langte balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">teenua thua zah law athua vae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon siapharan kha hopya khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">zeccuetu lu kheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit oun thua hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />rhaw hae nynh vawkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">zuanaw hmin kha a law vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawlungrua kha maee te a soi vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">te rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thinphang bungzoute a um hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel Pachia, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ccanung Babilon tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccathae tin ccyh lya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">huimin te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah sosoh aro te,</para>
  <para style="q2">loohrue ccyh yn thua vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha zoihtatyh lan yn pae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">yn laang vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha ang accawnghanpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">yn rae vae, hupi nynh laang hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">po yn laang vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka saw athuathuapaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">a vuesosakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha moh yn lua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka ngesaw yn pae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon tungvaw liarunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">um vae sah,” cite Zion kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw nynh a ho cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem nynh mah, “Ka chiise</para>
  <para style="q2">yn luasah keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">Khaldi ram um hae paw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">liarunaw um sah,” cite a ho cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Na byathan kya kae pankhae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na hanlan liarunaw ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">A rili kha ka rousah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a tuidy kha ka kangsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Babilon tuh arohpaw apumkuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">suizaw hae karung,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangthua lan umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">saryanaw roi a sawnua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw a um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hmin lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Babilon hae tuh chindeih hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ngingrarih lan a sia cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih taw hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">are-aro a tuakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin tuh mih lungtua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">thoku leite po a ih lan hae cia,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh myarya he a ry hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka niasah cih hae zah ka ruisah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sawchianaw kalan a cciakhae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuutepaw te miaatepaw hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ka cciakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Laephi pynpi nynh a lunglekhaekupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Sheshach khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">kyng phe athua vae rei!</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon tuh minphuin hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw lang phe a tang vae rei!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Rili nynh Babilon kha po phah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aroi myarya ccaepaw tuileih hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pong avu vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khuapi hae tuh ri lan umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaakannaw ram te laesia ram,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw lu kheit san a um leipaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">po a ccianaw leipaw ram lang a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babilon e Bel pachia kha de ka tah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a laangpaw kha moh ka luasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minphuin hae nynh amaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">sueluakuh vae lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon khualungrua tuh phe ting vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon khuapi kyate pou oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw myarya lepaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">nae hiinnaw raveih kha khumkuh oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Khah-e ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na thae oh paw laanbya keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae rawthah nan sah, ri mah rih nan oh—</para>
  <para style="q1">kum kheit ze laanbya phuin kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ccae zah, malang kum kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw laanbya phuin kheit yn than cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram lungkhu kya puathonaw laanbya te</para>
  <para style="q1">uktu lu kheit te lu kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsekunaw kong kha athaan.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Babilon ram e</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">de ka tahnaw hae ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">solei yn thua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ram pynpi tuh maethya a ccou cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q1">chia athuapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khua lungkhu a khuliakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tetuh palung lang e rohtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha oun thuanua hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">vaaw te lae te tuin kya umpaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate a sia cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:20">Bya 18.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babilon keiccuze laephi pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw patae a chi hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel hae kha chianaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon tuh a chih hahe cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:24">Bya 18.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Thaloi rhaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a lue hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">thysung leite cceih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Asawnaw ram kya na um oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ning nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kha nae thinlung kya um sah:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aening nynh saryanaw bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ah thae vae oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">maethya ah ccou oh; thethyanaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ah mae phang oun bong vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ramccang hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin thyaa lungkhu lang a tee vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon a zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">de ka tah ccyh te a ram pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">vaemaw a mue hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a raw a khui hae ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">solei yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babilon tuh vaaw cia hangkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sihkakinpaw khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a rae zemah ka saw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">rohtu hae nynh a tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a thuanua cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Babilon e rawnaw roi tuh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi ram e myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw roi tuh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha a roh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya ccaepaw a roi kha a daesah cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih tuileih accaepaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">athawsaepaw tui roi hawte thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih roi accaepaw tuh anawhoih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />pawccecize rohtupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kha a thuanua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae kuih kya thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih li kha a khyapya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">liaru a mangpaw Pachia nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccing lan a pyaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Babilon a bawi hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a mihaw hae, a uktu hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rhawbawi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a rhawkaw hae kha a ruisah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh kharouh thoku leite</para>
  <para style="q2">po a ih zungzae cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a min vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> cikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Siapharan nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">Thaawkalaepaw Babilon khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi te phe nging lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a tingbung cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahangpaw a koikua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te a soi cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw hae tuh accakaepaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawthangsakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae tuh maee hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thaw a bangsakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremiah nynh Saraiah kha Kawpya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw kum khe, amaw ryte Babilon lang a cceihkheih hae paw Mahseiah ccapaw Neriah a ccapaw Seraiah kha profeh Jeremiah nynh kaw a pya. Seraiah tuh Zedekiah a do-oihtu bawi nynh thua. <verse number="60" style="v" />Babilon tungvaw accah cih paw shethya balyn, Babilon konglang zei athuapaw bya balyn kha Jeremiah nynh ccakue ccangkheit kya a zei. <verse number="61" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh Seraiah kha hynhte a hopya: “Babilon khua he na thua te, e bya balyn hynh na ria cih, <verse number="62" style="v" />‘Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e hmin kya ccungccaw te sarangpaw a um khyh nawlan te zungzae adaepaw lang athua nawlan, namaw ccaccei nynh e hmin ro lanpaw kha phe na ho vae,’ cite na ria cih. <verse number="63" style="v" />E ccakue hynh na ria koute lung te na khiide koute Zufrates vawkhu angaelung langkhe na phung cih zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.63-64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:21">Bya 18.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="64" style="v" />‘Babilon tungvaw ka thuasah cih paw shethya keiccuze, Babilon tuh tui kaw lang accah cih zah, pou vae lan khyh,’ cite na ho cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">E hae hynh Jeremiah bya nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Ronaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-25:7">2Si 24.18—25.7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah tuh kum kuin lae kheit acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kyate kum haw lae kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Hamutal cikuh zah Libnah khuapaw Jeremiah ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoiakim nynh a la rae hawte, Zedekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem te Judah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha myaryamaw a thinriasah hae zah, aning nynh minmin kha a muihnaw kyate ccaring a dee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Zedekiah nynh Babilon siapharan kha a dou. <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum takuanaw, sawpaw sah hawnaw, nin haw nin khe Babilon Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar tuh a rhawkaw hae balyn ryte Jerusalem kha oun ccianua hae zah a koihlu hae; khuapi po voilu lan laekarung kha a thaenuaku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:2">Eze 24.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae kheitnaw cia khuapi kha a koihlu hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e kum, sawpaw sah palinaw, nin takua nin khe khuapi kya ccakan myarya ccih zah, ram kya-e ccungccaw hae hanlan looh um vae khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh Khaldi hae nynh khualungrua kha ting hae zah, khuapi po voilu lan a um hae zemah, Judah rhawkaw hae balyn tuh khuazi khe ccue hae zah, siapharan khokhu pe umpaw khualungrua ccangning laku e koikua kyate khuapi atolang poute Arabah langkhe a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eze 33.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Khaldi hae nynh siapharan Zedekiah kha deehui hae zah, Jeriko bialae khe a phya hae; a rhawkaw hae balyn nynh amaw kha ccuetaw hae zah pong phiakuh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan kha kyng hae zah, Hamath ram Riblah khua umpaw Babilon siapharan kalan a thuakhae hae, te aning nynh Zedekiah kha bya a pia. <verse number="10" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Zedekiah ccaaw hae kha mih paaw muihnaw khe a chia hae, Judah bawi balyn kha mah Riblah khua khe a chia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Babilon siapharan nynh Zedekiah mit kha a khoi koute sivawrui te a khii, te Babilon lang cciakhae zah, a chih cia thong a saw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Eze 12.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Beikinn Ronaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:8-17">2Si 25.8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh Babilon siapharan lang a tangnaw kum haw lae takuanaw kum, sawpaw sah pangawnaw, nin haw nin khe Babilon siapharan a pyn rhawviapahtu hae rhawbawipaw Nebuzaradan tuh Jerusalem lang a tee. <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, siapharan inn te Jerusalem e inn balyn kha maee te a soi; inn lepaw miakaw kha maee te khaleih a soi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">1Si 9.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw ryte a umkheih hae paw Khaldi rhawkaw hae balyn nynh Jerusalem akoihlupaw khualungrua balyn kha pong a ting hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh khuapi kyaze mih ryachi huapaw abang, khuapi kya a laehy hae paw, Babilon siapharan kalan a ccue hae paw te a laehypaw kuihhae hoy hae paw kha pynkheihlan Babilon lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh ram lungkhu e mih ryachi huapaw ccungccaw hae abang kha misu khokhu kya ryalahtu lang te loophotu lang a cciataw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw sohin tung hae, tui nungnawpaw rahung te a thadynnawpaw atung hae kha Khaldi hae nynh zoihtatyh lan khya hae zah, sohin balyn kha Babilon lang a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.17-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15-47">1Si 7.15-47</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Ang hae, buhhawlua, tetakia hae, pakepi, angsaw hae te beikinn ryalawnaw kya mangpaw sohin te raekuhpaw angphe balyn kha a cciakhae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sui te ngun khate raekuhpaw pakekhupaw adihpaw hae, maee-e nungnawpaw pake hae, pakepi hae, ang hae, maeekhuatung hae, angsaw hae, niapaw pyanawpaw pakekhupaw hae kha rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw nynh ccaring a cciakhae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn elang a raepaw tung tungning, tuikua kua kheit, tuikua kaw umpaw sohin vaetua ccanghaw lae ning, e sohin angphe hae balyn tuh aripaw kha tou kho um lei lan ciate alung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tung tungkheit ze dong haw lae tarya hang zah, alepaw dong haw lae ning acih; alungkhu tuh ua zah zong pali athaaw. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tung adung khe sohin te raekuhpaw tunglukhung a um; tuh-e tunglukhung tuh dong pangaw hang zah, adung tuh po voilu lan sohin te raekuhpaw sivaw te ccalee thae a um hae. Te tung tungningnaw tuh mah ccalee thae te tuhcih maminte a um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tung voikheit langte ccalee thae tuh sung takua ccangtaruh um zah, sivaw kya po voilu lan a umpaw ccalee thae tuh za kheit acih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Babilon lang Judah hae A Sue hae</para>
  <para style="r">(2Si 25.18-21, 27-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh ranpibawi lepaw Seraiah, ranpibawi Zefaniah te beikinn thuakaw ngawtu lu thum kha a cciakhae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuapi kyate rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi lu kheit, khuapi kya muih athua hae paw siapharan kungsi kya-e lu sari, ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae kha a sueluatupaw ryaccinkhan lu kheit, khuapi kya muih athua hae paw ram lungkhu e ccungccaw sung taruh kha a cciakhae hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te rhawviatu hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh minmin kha Riblah khua umpaw Babilon siapharan kya a thuakhae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Babilon siapharan nynh Hamath ram Riblah khua khe minmin kha bua hae zah a chia hae. Tuhcite Judah hae tuh kyng hae zah mih ram kyate ramccang lang a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae paw ccungccaw milu tuh: Siapharan lang a tangnaw kum sarinaw kum khe, Judah hae thong thum lu kuin lae thum; <verse number="29" style="v" />kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe, Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem kyate milu za tarya sung thum lu ning; <verse number="30" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kuin lae thumnaw kum khe, rhawviatu rhawkaw hae bawipaw Nebuzaradan nynh Judah hae kha za sari sung pali lu pangaw a cciakhae hae; mih balynte thong pali za taruh acih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoiakhin tungvaw Thawccinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin kha a kyngnaw hae te sung thum kum sarinaw, sawpaw sah haw lae ningnaw, nin kuin lae pangaw nin kya, Babilon siapharan Evil-merodak nynh ram a uk takaw kum khe, Judah siapharan Jehoiakhin kha thawccih zah thonginn kyate a luesah; <verse number="32" style="v" />aning kha hoyte byabeih zah, Babilon khua amaw kya a um hae paw ccangpaw siapharan hae mih haungnaw laeze ahang huapaw haungnaw kha a pya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jehoiakhin nynh thonginn lungkhu a lawkupaw boeining kha khahkuh zah, a hiin lungkhu balyn siapharan ccaboi kya nin takyhte looh a ae. <verse number="34" style="v" />A hiin lungkhu balyn, nin takyh aepaw kha a chi nin cia Babilon siapharan nynh a pya.</para>
</usx>